&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Axon&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Axon’s mission is bold and simple: Protect Life. We build technology that gives first responders, enterprises and communities the clarity to act in the moments that matter most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Real-Time Operations (RTO) portfolio, powered by Fusus, is transforming how public safety and security organisations detect, assess and respond to incidents. By connecting live video, devices and operational systems, we help customers build a shared understanding of what is happening—and respond with greater confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Director of Software Engineering to help build and scale the mission-critical software behind these experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Director of Software Engineering within Real-Time Operations, you will lead multiple engineering teams delivering secure, reliable and scalable software for public safety and enterprise customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the technical direction and engineering execution for your area, translating product priorities into clear plans and measurable outcomes. Working closely with Product, Design and other engineering leaders, you will guide architectural decisions, develop engineering talent and ensure teams deliver software that customers can depend on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a leader who combines technical depth with strong people leadership. You will be comfortable moving between long-term strategy and delivery detail—challenging assumptions, making trade-offs and creating the conditions for teams to do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver technology that matters.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead teams building software that supports real-time situational awareness and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape technical direction.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish a clear technical strategy that balances customer needs, platform reuse and long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strong teams.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop engineering managers and technical leaders, strengthening ownership, collaboration and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise engineering standards.&lt;/strong&gt; Improve reliability, security and delivery quality across systems that span devices, cloud services and user-facing applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect strategy to execution.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product and Design to turn customer problems into prioritised roadmaps and dependable delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;VP, Software Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is based out of our London office and follows a hybrid schedule. We rely on in-person collaboration and ask that team members work onsite Tuesdays through Fridays, with the flexibility to work remotely on Mondays, unless there is an approved workplace accommodation. We believe that connection fuels innovation, and our in-office culture is designed to foster meaningful teamwork, mentorship, and shared success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop multiple software engineering teams, setting clear expectations for technical quality, delivery and team performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Design to define roadmaps, sequence investments and make informed trade-offs between new capabilities, platform improvements and technical debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide architecture and system-design decisions across your area, engaging directly with engineers on complex technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build engineering practices that strengthen testing, code review, CI/CD, observability and deployment confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the operational health of your services, using incidents and customer feedback to drive lasting improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, coach and develop engineering managers, technical leads and engineers; address performance issues with clarity and candour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across Axon to deliver integrated experiences and resolve dependencies between teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Security, Privacy and Compliance partners to embed customer and regulatory requirements into engineering decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate progress, risks and trade-offs clearly, creating alignment without adding unnecessary processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 15 years of total experience in software engineering, including at least 5 years in engineering leadership roles, with experience leading teams and developing engineering leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering complex software products through multiple teams, from planning and architecture through launch and operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency in distributed systems, cloud services and modern software architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building secure, reliable systems where availability, performance and customer trust are critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to balance delivery commitments with the investment needed to improve platform quality and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgement in ambiguous environments, with the ability to make decisions, explain trade-offs and adapt as new information emerges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering closely with Product, Design and other engineering organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commitment to building inclusive, high-trust teams and developing talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real-time systems, video streaming, IoT or device-to-cloud architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise security, public safety technology or other mission-critical software environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform modernisation, complex integrations or scaling products across international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission-driven:&lt;/strong&gt; You connect engineering decisions to meaningful outcomes for customers and communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-obsessed:&lt;/strong&gt; You work backwards from customer needs and stay close to how your software is used.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technically credible:&lt;/strong&gt; You ask insightful questions, challenge assumptions and help teams make sound architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A multiplier:&lt;/strong&gt; You develop other leaders and create an environment where teams can take ownership and succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candid and collaborative:&lt;/strong&gt; You give clear feedback, welcome different perspectives and join forces across organisational boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accountable for outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; You bring focus to complex priorities and follow through on commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits that Benefit You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive base salary and RSUs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Comprehensive pension plan with matching contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Private health insurance &amp;amp; cash plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;30 days paid holiday + UK public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enhanced maternity/paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;GymPass subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Life assurance &amp;amp; income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Career growth support and wellness resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits listed herein may vary depending on the nature of your employment and the location where you work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and people of color are less likely to apply to jobs unless they check every box in the job description. If you’re excited about this role and our mission to Protect Life but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification listed here, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above job description is not intended as, nor should it be construed as, exhaustive of all duties, responsibilities, skills, efforts, or working conditions associated with this job. The job description may change or be supplemented at any time in accordance with business needs and conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some roles may also require legal eligibility to work in a firearms environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We collect personal information from applicants to evaluate candidates for employment. You may request access, deletion, or exercise other CCPA rights at&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- ----- via our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Axon Privacy Web Form&lt;/a&gt;. For more information, please see the Your California Privacy Rights section of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Axon’s mission is to Protect Life and is committed to the well-being and safety of its employees as well as Axon’s impact on the environment. All Axon employees must be aware of and committed to the appropriate environmental, health, and safety regulations, policies, and procedures. Axon employees are empowered to report safety concerns as they arise and activities potentially impacting the environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer that promotes justice, advances equity, values diversity and fosters inclusion. We’re committed to hiring the best talent — regardless of race, creed, color, ancestry, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship status, marital status, disability, gender identity, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations and ordinances — and empowering all of our employees so they can do their best work. If you have a disability or special need that requires assistance or accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ---------- &lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please note that this email address is for accommodation purposes only. Axon will not respond to inquiries for other purposes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Phishing alert:&amp;nbsp; Axon will never ask you to pay for any part of the hiring process, including training, equipment, or background checks. We do not make job offers via text message, WhatsApp, or instant messaging platforms without a formal interview process.&amp;nbsp; All legitimate job openings are listed on our official careers page at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.axon.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;If you receive a suspicious offer or outreach from an email address that is not ----- or if you are asked for sensitive personal information (bank details, Social Security Number) prematurely, please ignore the message and report it to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As our Senior Press Officer, you’ll be at the heart of our mission to communicate Reform UK’s message to the public. You’ll be part of a team creating powerful articles, press releases, and social media content, along with innovative advertising campaigns that capture attention, energise our supporters, and clearly lay out our vision for the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for applicants that are Reform UK members and believe in what we stand for.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Written Output:&lt;/strong&gt; Write, edit, and distribute high-quality articles, press releases, and statements that reflect the party’s positions and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Media Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and post engaging content for our social media platforms, ensuring our messaging remains consistent and impactful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Marketing:&lt;/strong&gt; Create and and develop advertisements and campaigns that promote our values and policies across multiple channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media Relations:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate and maintain strong relationships with journalists, editors, and media outlets to secure coverage and manage inquiries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with leadership to craft and execute our short and long term goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in writing, communications, public relations, or journalism, ideally in a political or campaign environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing and editing skills with a keen eye for detail and a flair for persuasive communication..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative thinking and the ability to develop innovative advertising and marketing materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong commitment to the values and mission of Reform UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Owner, you will manage the execution of NMI&#39;s strategy and roadmap, while facilitating backlog grooming, prioritisation, triage and other development ceremonies. Our Product Owners also take an active role in product launches, ensuring internal stakeholders are trained on the latest product capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will need a unique blend of business and technical savvy, a big-picture vision and attention to detail, and the drive to make that vision a reality. You must enjoy spending time learning the product and understanding its users in order to make the best design decisions for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About NMI&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NMI, a global leader in payment technologies, allows software and sales professionals to deliver payment innovations to their clients without having to build payment expertise in house. NMI enables our partners with choice, and challenges the one-size-fits-all approach to payments. You&#39;ve probably used NMI in the last 24 hours without even realizing it. We&#39;re the platform that powers success for innovative tech created by SMBs, entrepreneurs and fintech startups. We&#39;re creative problem solvers who help visionaries smash through boundaries and think beyond what&#39;s possible so they can think about what&#39;s next. But we&#39;re not just built for the tech savvy. We democratize the latest payments technology so that everyone can realize the benefits of easy payments across the full spectrum of commerce. Our mission is to use our expertise to enable more payments, in more ways and more places. We provide ISOs, Fintech Innovators and Technologists the freedom to focus on what they do best, liberating them from restricted payment solutions and giving them access to the latest payment technology now and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How We Work - Our Core Values&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a Good Person, It&#39;s Simple.&lt;/strong&gt; We treat everyone fairly and with respect. We lead with kindness, humility and integrity. We take the time to understand each other and our customers. And we serve with care, because customers are never a transaction, and always our focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align, Trust &amp;amp; Go.&lt;/strong&gt; We debate openly, listen carefully and challenge thoughtfully. Once we decide, we move forward together - holding ourselves accountable to our commitments, and focusing on what matters most to our customers. That alignment creates momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the Bar.&lt;/strong&gt; Good enough isn&#39;t enough. We stay curious, measure everything, stay honest about progress and keep pushing ourselves to think creatively. We drive change, again and again. And leave things better than we found them. When we raise the bar, our customers feel it too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise the product backlog and coordinate with stakeholders including the Product Manager, customer facing teams, executives and your development team to deliver maximum value and quality to the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a subject matter expert in the relevant product domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop an understanding of the target market and user base, and use this to guide product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop epics and user stories for all new functionality, present user stories to product teams and ensure new functionality meets the acceptance criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders to help define a Minimum Viable Product (MVP) that delivers incremental value and aligns with the product vision and NMI&#39;s strategic goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the development team, Product Manager and other Product Owners on release planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write detailed release notes and provide product training to internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct User Acceptance Testing (UAT) to ensure new products and functionality work as expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with other Product Owners to ensure dependencies are prioritised appropriately across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate work in progress and upcoming work to key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the conceptual and functional integrity of new features or components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish timelines and product benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the voice of the customer through customer interviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Do I have what it takes?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate thrives in ambiguity and approaches problem solving, teamwork and innovation with a positive attitude. This person has a very strong understanding of our customers, including the driving forces in payments technology and product evolution, and has the coaching skills to motivate teams and individuals around a common vision of product development excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3–5 years of product owner experience, or similar/equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in ecommerce, retail and/or payments technology; payments technology experience is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take business requirements and translate them into detailed product specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills with customers, business and technical team members across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of technology and comfort reading technical specifications and working with APIs and SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate and work effectively in a distributed environment, with colleagues in different geographical regions and across various levels of the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for solving puzzles and understanding how different solutions work together in a retail, ecommerce or payments environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you feel like you have a slightly out of the ordinary career path or history? We are open to all walks of life and very willing to hear your story. Please don&#39;t feel like this should be a barrier to securing a great career at NMI! We appreciate success can come in all shapes and sizes. Fill in the &#39;Additional Info&#39; box on our application to tell us more about your path.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;As well as being a part of something exciting everyday, you will also receive the following benefits:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual bonus scheme dependent on individual and company performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual salary of £50,000 - £70,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday each year (+ bank holidays + 1 day after each year of service with up to a max. of 30 days)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workplace pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance (upon 30 days of employment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 hours per day, 35 hours per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote first culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great work-life balance with our Flexi-time policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family Friendly policies (Enhanced Maternity and Paternity Pay and Shared Parental Leave).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A chance to develop with an allocated company training budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike2Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifeworks, an Employee Assistance Programme which offers wellbeing, family and financial support services, such as assessments, resources and even 1:1 counselling sessions. It also offers interesting perks such as discounts on gyms, restaurants, high street retailers and cinema tickets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong commitment to employee wellbeing including mental health first aiders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee referral scheme with generous financial reward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonusly colleague reward scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that having a diverse group of employees strengthens both our work and our workplace. We&#39;re focused on making NMI more diverse and welcoming with initiatives like having a dedicated Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion action group, diversity goals for hiring, anonymized resume screening, affinity groups such as our Women&#39;s network and LGBTQ+ Network, open forums for discussions on diversity and social justice, and measuring inclusion and belonging as part of our regular employee engagement surveys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NMI is committed to providing equal employment opportunity for all persons regardless of race, color, religion, sex, age, marital status, national origin, sexual orientation or sexual identity, genetic information, citizen status (except those that do not have the legal right to be employed in the United States), disability, military service, service member, veteran status, or any other basis protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that all offers of employment are made subject to receipt of satisfactory background and financial checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Attention job applicants: Please note that in compliance with the data protection regulations within your jurisdiction, any personal information submitted with your job application may be collected and used by NMI for the purpose of recruitment and employment-related activities. By submitting your application, you acknowledge and provide explicit consent to the processing of your personal information as described in our privacy policy found on our website. For more information on how we process your information, please read our privacy policy here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nmi.com/legal/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;https://www.nmi.com/legal/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary range, depending on experience:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£50,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£70,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #666e99;&quot;&gt;What Cognite is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;Relentless&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 110, 153);&quot;&gt;to Achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cognite operates at the forefront of industrial digitalization, building AI and data solutions that solve the world’s hardest, highest-impact problems. Our Moonshot is bold: unlock $100B in customer value by 2035, and redefine how global industry works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Field / Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Approximately 50% (Client sites, etc)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Cognite&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cognite is a global industrial Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) company enabling the full-scale digital transformation of heavy-asset industries. Our core software product, Cognite Data Fusion (CDF), powers companies with contextualized OT/IT data to develop and scale solutions that increase safety, sustainability, and operational efficiency while driving revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Business Development Director within our Supply Chain Center of Excellence (CoE)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive Cognite’s growth by winning new Supply Chain business within accounts headquartered in your territory. Operating as a subject matter expert, you will leverage deep domain insights to help customers transform their supply chain value chain using Cognite Applications and the Cognite Data Fusion Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory &amp;amp; CoE Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute a targeted territory strategy to accelerate bookings growth and secure high-impact supply chain clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively prospect and leverage your personal network to generate pipeline, providing compelling &quot;commercial insights&quot; on optimizing the supply chain value chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Sales Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead extended territory teams (including pre-sales and technical experts) through complex enterprise sales cycles to exceed bookings targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-Based Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Quantify ROI and present strong business cases to help enterprise executives justify software investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner-savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; work with partners to qualify and progress their pipeline, and drive joint engagements on qualified opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Account / Engagement Leader in negotiating favorable pricing and commercial terms with C-level executives by demonstrating the long-term strategic value of Cognite’s solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with internal Product Management and Marketing teams to feed real-market supply chain insights back into product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Hygiene &amp;amp; Forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Account Leaders and their First Line Managers in accurately forecasting monthly/quarterly bookings and maintaining up-to-date account records in &lt;a href=&quot;http://salesforce.com&quot;&gt;Salesforce.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge, Skills, Abilities (KSAs) &amp;amp; Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep domain expertise in complex Supply Chain operations for Energy, Manufacturing or Power Utilities verticals. Understanding of Production operations and industry x.0 initiatives is also required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Value Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to sell value and build quantified ROI frameworks for prospective buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Informal Leadership, Influence &amp;amp; Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; High degree of self-motivation, time management, and ability to informally lead and effectively influence cross-functional deal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Stellar presentation, written, and verbal communication skills tailored for C-suite engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Technical Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Software/SaaS:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven mastery of selling complex analytics or data platforms (e.g., AI, Big Data, Data Warehousing, Business Intelligence, Machine Learning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Ecosystems:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with modern data architectures and tools, such as Big Data frameworks (Hadoop, Spark, Hive, BigQuery), Data Warehouses, and Machine Learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of experience in the Manufacturing and broader industrial supply chain environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years of direct or in-support sales experience, selling enterprise software/SaaS (BI, Big Data, Advanced Analytics, or AI/ML) to C-level executives, Management and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated history of consistently meeting or exceeding SaaS bookings goals in direct / partner / channel-based sales models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environment Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience operating in high-growth startup environments (Series A, B, or C stage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Us Great &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Values:&lt;/strong&gt; High autonomy, a culture of speed and openness, social and diversity initiatives (Together@Cognite), and a commitment to innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive base + variable compensation, 401(k) employer matching, fully covered health/dental/vision/disability premiums, and learning stipends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Unlimited PTO, paid parental leave, and catered company lunches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 41, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #666e99;&quot;&gt;Why Cognite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work at the forefront of Industrial AI, partnering with some of the world&#39;s leading industrial organisations to solve problems that actually matter at scale — not hypothetical ones. You&#39;ll join a collaborative, fast-moving environment where curiosity and ownership are the norm, not the exception. If you want delivery work you can point to and be proud of, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cognite is committed to creating a diverse and inclusive environment at work and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive the same level of consideration for employment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Modalités de travail:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Chez&amp;nbsp;GoDaddy, l’organisation du travail varie selon les équipes : certaines travaillent au bureau, d’autres en mode hybride, et d’autres entièrement à distance.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Sur Site:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ce poste s’exerce à temps plein sur site. Vous devez donc résider à une distance permettant de vous rendre régulièrement dans les locaux auxquels vous êtes rattaché(e). Vous travaillerez sur ce site dès votre premier jour&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Rejoignez notre équipe :&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Chez&amp;nbsp;GoDaddy, notre infrastructure est au service de millions de clients à travers le monde. Nous recherchons un(e) Data Center Manager expérimenté(e) pour piloter les opérations, les équipes, la performance financière et la qualité des services de notre centre de données de Strasbourg.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;En tant que membre de l’équipe de management du site, vous déclinerez la stratégie de l’entreprise en actions concrètes à travers la planification des effectifs, le développement des talents, la gestion financière, la gouvernance opérationnelle et l’amélioration continue. Vous collaborerez avec les clients, les fournisseurs et les différentes équipes internes afin de garantir des opérations sûres, fiables et évolutives dans un environnement fonctionnant 24 h/24 et 7 j/7.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Votre&amp;nbsp;expérience&amp;nbsp;doit&amp;nbsp;inclure&amp;nbsp;….&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience confirmée en management et leadership, notamment dans l’encadrement de managers, le développement d’équipes responsabilisées et la conduite du changement organisationnel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience dans le pilotage d’opérations au service de clients Enterprise et de services critiques pour l’activité.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience en gouvernance opérationnelle, gestion des risques, continuité d’activité, gestion budgétaire, prévisions et&amp;nbsp;reporting&amp;nbsp;auprès de la direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expertise technique dans au moins deux des domaines suivants : administration système (Linux et/ou Windows), réseaux, architecture des centres de données, programmation/scripting&amp;nbsp;ou automatisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience dans la mise en place de programmes de formation, de développement des compétences et de planification de la relève.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Idéalement, vous disposez également de…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Plus de 5 ans d’expérience dans les opérations de centres de données, d’infrastructures ou d’environnements critiques, avec des responsabilités croissantes en management d’équipes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Bonne connaissance des environnements Linux et Windows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience avec Python, Bash, PowerShell, Java, Perl, Ruby, PHP ou des technologies de&amp;nbsp;scripting&amp;nbsp;similaires.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Connaissance de RAID, SAN/NAS, de l’architecture x86, des processus de démarrage, des systèmes de fichiers et d’exploitation, des réseaux, des technologies de stockage et du diagnostic d’infrastructures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience dans la mise en œuvre d’initiatives d’automatisation, d’excellence opérationnelle ou d’amélioration des processus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Expérience avec&amp;nbsp;ServiceNow, CMDB, Jira, Confluence, Microsoft 365,&amp;nbsp;Workday&amp;nbsp;et des outils de gestion des stocks.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nous vous encourageons à postuler même si votre expérience ou vos compétences ne correspondent pas à&amp;nbsp;tous les critères. Nous valorisons la diversité des parcours et les compétences transférables, et favorisons le développement et l’apprentissage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nos avantages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nous proposons une offre globale de rémunération et d’avantages pouvant inclure des congés payés, des dispositifs d’épargne retraite, des bonus ou primes, des actions, la participation à notre programme d’achat d’actions pour les salariés, une couverture santé compétitive ainsi que des avantages favorisant l’équilibre familial, notamment le congé parental. Les avantages proposés par&amp;nbsp;GoDaddy&amp;nbsp;varient selon le poste et le lieu de travail et pourront être présentés plus en détail au cours du processus de recrutement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;À propos de nous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;GoDaddy accompagne les entrepreneurs du monde entier en leur fournissant les outils et le soutien nécessaires pour réussir en ligne et rendre les opportunités accessibles au plus grand nombre. GoDaddy permet à chacun de donner vie à son idée, de créer un site web professionnel, d’attirer des clients, de vendre ses produits et services et de gérer son activité. Notre mission est de donner à nos clients les outils, les informations et l’accompagnement nécessaires pour transformer leurs idées et leur initiative en succès. Pour en savoir plus, consultez notre page &lt;a href=&quot;https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faboutus.godaddy.net%2Fabout-us%2Foverview%2Fdefault.aspx&amp;amp;data=05%7C01%7Cklilas%40godaddy.com%7C4a7c273441f14a72548908dab30d54f3%7Cd5f1622b14a345a6b069003f8dc4851f%7C0%7C0%7C638019167147789183%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=JKqNxY8z5E%2BjfKXCtVVYGLmGXuv31qCpLmWP960VLzo%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW47857006 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW47857006 BCX0&quot;&gt;Chez&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW47857006 BCX0&quot;&gt;GoDaddy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW47857006 BCX0&quot;&gt;, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des équipes contribue à créer de meilleurs produits. Notre culture valorise la diversité et l’inclusion des idées, des expériences et des perspectives. Nous intégrons les principes de diversité, d’équité, d’inclusion et d’appartenance dans notre façon de travailler, pour nos collaborateurs comme pour nos clients et nos activités. Pour en savoir plus sur nos engagements ainsi que sur nos données en matière de représentation et d’équité salariale, consultez notre rapport annuel &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.godaddy/diversity&quot;&gt;Diversity Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;sur notre page dédiée à la diversité.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nous célébrons également cette diversité au travers de nos C&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.godaddy/culture&quot;&gt;ulture&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot;&gt;GoDaddy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;est fier d’être un employeur garantissant l’égalité des chances. Les candidatures de personnes qualifiées ayant des antécédents judiciaires seront examinées conformément aux exigences légales locales et fédérales. Consultez&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot;&gt;notre politique complète&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;en matière d’égalité des chances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW111644679 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;em&gt;Refer to our full&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.godaddy.com/legal/agreements/equal-opportunity-employment-statement&quot;&gt;EEO policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;Notre équipe de recrutement est à votre disposition pour vous accompagner dans votre candidature.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;Si&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;vous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;avez&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;des&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;questions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;contactez&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight MacChromeBold SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;a ---------- class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;DE-DE&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW26905308 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW226975864 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;FR-FR&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW226975864 BCX0&quot;&gt;GoDaddy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW226975864 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;n’accepte pas les candidatures spontanées transmises par des recruteurs ou des agences de recrutement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW226975864 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[220,720],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0,0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1,1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ping Identity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe in making digital experiences both secure and seamless for all users, without compromise. We call this digital freedom. And it&#39;s not just something we provide our customers. It&#39;s something that inspires our company. People don&#39;t come here to join a culture that&#39;s built on digital freedom. They come to cultivate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intelligent, cloud identity platform lets people shop, work, bank, and interact wherever and however they want. Without friction. Without fear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While protecting digital identities is at the core of our technology, protecting individual identities is at the core of our culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pingidentity.com/en/company/championing-every-identity.html&quot;&gt;We champion every identity.&lt;/a&gt; One of our core values, Respect Individuality, reminds us to celebrate differences so you are empowered to bring your authentic self to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Denver, Colorado and we have offices and employees around the globe. We serve the largest, most demanding enterprises worldwide, including more than half of the Fortune 100. At Ping Identity, we&#39;re changing the way people and businesses think about cybersecurity, digital experiences, and identity and access management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe in making digital experiences both secure and seamless for all users, without compromise. We call this digital freedom. And it&#39;s not just something we provide our customers. It&#39;s something that inspires our company. People don&#39;t come here to join a culture that&#39;s built on digital freedom. They come to cultivate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intelligent, cloud identity platform lets people shop, work, bank, and interact wherever and however they want. Without friction. Without fear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While protecting digital identities is at the core of our technology, protecting individual identities is at the core of our culture. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pingidentity.com/en/company/championing-every-identity.html&quot;&gt;We champion every identity.&lt;/a&gt; One of our core values, Respect Individuality, reminds us to celebrate differences so you are empowered to bring your authentic self to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Denver, Colorado and we have offices and employees around the globe. We serve the largest, most demanding enterprises worldwide, including more than half of the Fortune 100. At Ping Identity, we&#39;re changing the way people and businesses think about cybersecurity, digital experiences, and identity and access management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Director of Sales Engineering, Southern Europe you will take a senior role in shaping how we engage with customers, partners, and the wider sales organisation. You will lead a small team of Sales Engineers, guiding their development and ensuring they are well equipped to succeed, while continuing to spend most of your time working directly on high value opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior hands on leadership role. You will set technical direction for key accounts, influence deal strategy, and help resolve complex architectural questions. You will act as a trusted advisor to customers and sales teams, while also representing the SE function in regional planning, forecasting, and cross functional discussions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead by example, taking ownership of strategic opportunities and stepping in where your experience can make a meaningful difference to outcomes. At the same time, you will coach your team to grow their own expertise and confidence, creating an environment where they can perform at a high level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Team Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support a team of Sales Engineers (SE&#39;s), providing coaching, regular feedback, and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear expectations for technical quality, customer engagement, and opportunity execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help onboard and mentor new team members and strengthen consistent ways of working across the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional sales leadership to ensure SE resources are aligned with priority accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a healthy, collaborative team culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of strategic and complex opportunities that benefit from senior technical leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver solution demonstrations, discovery sessions, technical guidance, RFx responses, and proofs of concept&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide technical strategy across multiple deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an escalation point for technical challenges during critical deal phases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with customers and partners, becoming a technical advisor they rely on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with sales teams throughout qualification, discovery, and technical proof phases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate pre sales efforts with post sales delivery teams to ensure smooth handovers and clear expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Ping Identity at customer meetings, executive briefings, partner events, and industry sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross Functional Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide insight into market trends, customer challenges, and developing areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share well reasoned product feedback with product owners and help shape regional solution positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic planning and forecasting discussions with regional sales leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with marketing and product teams to refine competitive messaging and technical narratives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience of&amp;nbsp;managing sales engineering teams in France, and preferably also Iberia &amp;amp; Italy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of IAM concepts, architectures, and protocols. Experience with standards such as OAuth, OIDC, SAML, and SCIM is helpful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with REST APIs and JSON, and familiarity with one or more modern programming or scripting languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of core infrastructure technologies, including networking, DNS, HTTP/S, load balancing, proxies, and virtualisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with major cloud platforms, such as AWS, Azure, or GCP, and deployment technologies like Kubernetes and Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how customers are using agentic AI and how identity secures AI agents, their permissions, and their behaviour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, including the ability to explain technical concepts clearly to technical and non technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently while also supporting and elevating a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing multiple priorities without losing focus on key opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in learning and staying current in a fast evolving technical landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS in Software Engineering or equivalent degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent French language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility to work in France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Ping:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in and facilitate a flexible, collaborative work environment. We’re growing quickly, but remain true to the innovative, can-do startup values that got us here. Most importantly, we keep hiring talented, smart, fun, and genuinely nice people because that’s who we want to succeed with every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are just a few of the things that make Ping special:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that empowers you to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups that create a sense of belonging for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team bonding events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits and perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global volunteering and community initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO &amp;amp; Holiday Schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Healthcare Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for Education Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Offset (Specific locations)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ping is the collective sum of all our individual experiences, backgrounds and influences and we pride ourselves in growing and learning together. We are committed to building an inclusive and diverse environment where everyone’s individuality is respected and everyone has an Identity. In recruiting for new colleagues, we welcome the unique contributions you can bring and encourage you to be your best self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer.&amp;nbsp; All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex including sexual orientation and gender identity, national origin, disability, protected Veteran Status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos de Mirakl &lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fondée en 2012, Mirakl est à l’avant-garde de l’innovation marketplace, permettant à toutes les entreprises de rivaliser dans l’économie de plateforme.&lt;br&gt;Son operating system combine aujourd’hui des solutions pour :&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;le lancement, la gestion et la croissance d’une marketplace ou d’une activité de dropship (Mirakl Platform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;la vente omnicanale alimentée par l’IA (Mirakl Connect)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;le retail media (Mirakl Ads)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;le commerce agentique (Mirakl Nexus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Avec ses sièges à Boston et Paris, Mirakl accompagne un écosystème mondial de plus de 450 clients B2C et B2B et un réseau de plus de 100 000 marques et vendeurs tiers.&lt;br&gt;Des marques comme Macy’s, Decathlon, Carrefour, Asos et Airbus Helicopters utilisent Mirakl pour réinventer leur approche du commerce.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour plus d&#39;informations, rendez-vous sur www.mirakl.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mirakl en chiffres &lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗓️ Fondée en 2012 | Membre de French Tech Next40&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👥 Plus de 750 employés répartis dans 9 bureaux à travers le monde : Paris, Barcelone, Bordeaux, Boston, Londres, Munich, New York, Sydney, Tokyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos valeurs &lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travailler chez Mirakl, c&#39;est accélérer votre carrière aux côtés de collègues ambitieux, passionnés et solidaires. Nous sommes fiers de la diversité des parcours, des perspectives et des expériences qui rendent nos équipes uniques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nos 5 valeurs guident notre façon de collaborer :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💡 Travailler dur ensemble : le travail d&#39;équipe et la collaboration sont les fondements de notre succès&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏆 Aller au bout des choses : &amp;nbsp;nous privilégions l&#39;action et l&#39;efficacité pour obtenir des résultats percutants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Aller au-delà des attentes : &amp;nbsp;nous relevons les défis de manière proactive et visons toujours l&#39;excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 Réussir grâce à l&#39;expertise : le partage de connaissances et l&#39;apprentissage continu sont au cœur de notre culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 Satisfaire et responsabiliser les clients : nous nous engageons à assurer la réussite de nos clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of the Customer Services organization led by Alice, Manager of Digital Support, working at the intersection of Support, Product, Content, and Engineering. Together, you&#39;ll be transforming how customers, partners, and employees access support — making it easier for users to find answers, solve problems, and get help independently and efficiently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;At the heart of this transformation is &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;One Help, Mirakl&#39;s AI-powered digital support platform&lt;/strong&gt;, combining conversational AI, product knowledge, and self-service capabilities to deliver a seamless support experience. As the functional owner of One Help, you&#39;ll be central to making that vision a reality.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Own and manage One Help as its functional administrator — configuring the platform, managing AI settings, conversational flows, and user journeys, while coordinating technical improvements with Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Analyse user conversations, behaviours, and feedback to identify friction points, unanswered questions, and inaccurate answers that undermine self-service resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Test and optimise AI-generated answers, prompts, and conversational experiences — experimenting with new AI capabilities to continuously raise the quality of the digital support experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Monitor key performance indicators including answer quality, self-service resolution rates, user satisfaction, and escalation rates — translating data into prioritised, actionable improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Drive One Help adoption across Mirakl, partnering with Support, Product, and Engineering teams to evolve the platform based on real user needs and emerging AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;3 to 5 years of experience in Customer Experience, Knowledge Management (Dcoumentation, help center, knowledge base) or Customer Education, including hands-on involvement in implementing or deploying an AI chatbot or virtual assistant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience administering, configuring, or optimising conversational AI, chatbots, virtual assistants, or digital self-service platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Proven ability to analyse user behaviour and performance data to identify improvement opportunities and translate them into tangible actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Experience with platforms such as Intercom Fin, Zendesk AI, Ada or similar is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Familiarity with prompt engineering, AI agents, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), or no-code/low-code automation tools is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;User experience mindset: identifying friction points and translating insights into more intuitive, effective experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Analytical thinking: comfortable with performance metrics, conversation data, and user feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Technical curiosity: practical understanding of how AI-powered tools work, including LLMs, prompts, and knowledge retrieval — coding expertise not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Cross-functional collaboration: able to work effectively with both technical and business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Strong ownership and autonomy: proactive, resourceful, and comfortable driving a platform&#39;s evolution independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tools&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-powered and automation tools (e.g., Dust, n8n, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and content management platforms (Confluence, Paligo, Heretto, Gitbook, Zendesk Guide, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Languages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;English: Full professional proficiency &lt;em&gt;(required)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;French: Full professional proficiency &lt;em&gt;(required)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-lg text-foreground&quot;&gt;Our Hiring Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We warmly encourage you to apply to any of our roles, even if you think you&#39;re not an exact match.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Please click the &quot;Apply&quot; button to submit your application — this helps us make the best possible assessment and get back to you as quickly as possible.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-decimal pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Screening call with Talent Acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;1-hour interview with Alice, Hiring Manager, including a live case study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Values interviews with key stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Welcome at Mirakl!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nous recrutons des collaborateurs aux parcours et expériences très différents pour nous aider à grandir. Ceux-ci dépassent souvent les exigences professionnelles conventionnelles et nous aident à créer une culture d&#39;apprentissage continu. Si vous êtes prêt à rejoindre un leader mondial qui soutient la transformation e-commerce de plus de 450 retailers et organisations B2B parmi les plus innovants au monde. Nous pouvons utiliser des solutions d&#39;intelligence artificielle (IA) pour rationaliser notre processus de recrutement, notamment pour présélectionner les candidatures, analyser les CV et évaluer les réponses. Si l&#39;IA nous aide à travailler efficacement, toutes les décisions finales en matière de recrutement sont prises par des humains. Pour plus d&#39;information, consultez notre &lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;AI Guidelines for Candidates and Interviews&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;A career that’s the whole package!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Conga, we’ve built a community where our colleagues can thrive. Here you’ll find opportunities to innovate and support growth through individual and team development, all within an environment where every voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conga&lt;/strong&gt; lines up commercial operations so companies run as connected, smarter businesses. By unifying the people and processes that drive commerce, Conga aligns pricing, quoting, contracting, rebates, and communications so teams stay in sync and buyers keep moving forward. The result is trusted decisions, consistent buyer experiences, and profitable growth. More than 10,000 customers worldwide, including over 50% of the Fortune 100®, trust Conga when commercial complexity is high and global impact is on the line.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Switzerland (remote)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;RVP Sales&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel: &lt;/strong&gt;within DACH&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;native/C2 level French and English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Quick Snapshot…..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Account Executive, you&#39;ll be at the forefront of our revenue growth strategy, driving both new business acquisition and the expansion of existing enterprise accounts across key strategic industries in the DACH region. You will build trusted relationships with executive stakeholders, understand complex business challenges, and position Conga&#39;s enterprise-wide solutions to deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Sales Engineering, Business Development, Marketing, Transformation Specialists, Customer Success, Professional Services, Partners, and clients, you will manage the full sales lifecycle from prospecting through close. This role is focused on 40% new business generation and 60% growth within existing customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why it&#39;s a big deal…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have the opportunity to sell high-impact, mission-critical transformation initiatives that create substantial value for enterprise organizations. You will develop and execute territory, account, and opportunity plans, engage senior decision-makers, and lead complex sales cycles to drive predictable revenue growth within your assigned region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you the person we are looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Track Record&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have at least 20 years of successful B2B enterprise technology sales experience within the SaaS industry and a strong track record of success in DACH.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acts as a trusted advisor to enterprise customers, aligning business challenges with measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently exceeds quota within complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise sales environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds and leverages executive, customer, partner, and ecosystem relationships to create, accelerate, and expand strategic opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates strong knowledge of AI, automation, and revenue management trends, effectively translating these into customer value and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives predictable revenue growth through strategic account planning, executive engagement, and value-based selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hunter Mentality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You thrive in a fast-paced environment and have a passion for identifying, pursuing, and winning new business opportunities. Through persistence, strategic thinking, and strong commercial acumen, you consistently create pipeline and close high-value enterprise deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Selling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You take a consultative approach to understanding customer challenges, business priorities, and strategic objectives. You effectively position Conga&#39;s solutions and services, clearly articulating value and demonstrating how they help customers achieve their desired outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You proactively leverage available resources and take ownership of results. You are highly motivated, resilient, and committed to achieving success regardless of the challenges encountered along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can articulate complex technology concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences. You possess excellent listening, presentation, and negotiation skills, enabling you to address objections, build credibility, and influence stakeholders at every level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You embrace change and continuously adapt to evolving market conditions, customer priorities, and competitive dynamics. You are innovative in your approach and seek new ways to create value for customers and the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work effectively across cross-functional teams including Sales Engineering, Business Development, Marketing, Customer Success, Professional Services, and Partners to deliver exceptional customer outcomes. You have the leadership presence and influence to align stakeholders, mobilize resources, and drive successful business results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will give you an edge...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling Revenue Lifecycle Management solutions with strong knowledge of CPQ, CLM, revenue optimization, document generation, and e-signature products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education and/or experience in Economics, Statistics, Mathematics, Accounting, Marketing, Finance, or Operations Research is considered a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Did we pique your interest? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the kind of job you would love in the kind of environment where you would thrive, please click apply. &lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Resume Format&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We accept resumes in any format, we suggest using PDF or plain text. These formats help ensure that your resume’s formatting remains intact, making it easier for our recruiters to review your application promptly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don’t meet every requirement for the role?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and members of ethnic minorities are less likely to apply to jobs unless they meet every single qualification. At Conga we are dedicated to building a diverse, inclusive, and authentic workplace, so if you’re excited about this role but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyway. You just might be the right candidate for this or other roles. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;st-additionalInformation&quot; class=&quot;job-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Additional Information&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conga is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer and provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants regardless of race, color, religion, gender, gender identity, age, national origin, disability, parental or pregnancy status, marriage and civil partnership, sexual orientation, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. We understand interviewing can be stressful for those with disabilities. If reasonable accommodation is needed to allow you to show us your best self, please let your recruiter know as soon as possible. All your information will be kept confidential according to EEO guidelines. Conga is not open to third party solicitation or resumes for our posted FTE positions. Resumes received from third party agencies that are unsolicited will be considered complimentary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;job-apply print-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conga&#39;s Applicant Privacy Statement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The information you provide during the application process will be used in accordance with Conga’s Applicant Privacy Statement (&lt;a href=&quot;https://conga.com/applicant-privacy-statement&quot;&gt;https://conga.com/applicant-privacy-statement&lt;/a&gt;). By submitting your application, you acknowledge and agree to the terms outlined in this privacy statement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Autonomous Drone Software Engineer to join a swarming programme. As an engineer on a lean, high-impact team, you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not be siloed; this role spans the entire autonomy lifecycle, from developing autonomy capabilities to investigating real-world flight-test data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across the autonomy stack and partner integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with hardware engineers, product managers, and external partners to define system requirements and translate them into robust software architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement robust distributed state machines, leader election protocols, and fault-tolerant architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code while confidently managing complex concurrency and contention scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run rigorous tests utilizing SITL/HITL simulation environments to validate code prior to physical deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in code reviews, architectural discussions, and technical documentation to elevate the team&#39;s engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act decisively during flight-test investigations, applying strong engineering judgment to physical failure modes and release safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional engineering experience in robotics, embedded systems, or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in modern C++, with practical experience designing, reasoning about, and debugging highly concurrent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded systems experience working close to hardware on real-time or safety-critical platforms (e.g., avionics, automotive, robotics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural understanding of distributed systems, with the ability to deliberately evaluate and select consensus designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with robust release management, versioned artifacts, and pinned dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4, MAVLink, and related drone software ecosystems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;PHENOGY is a dynamic, fast-growing company specializing in innovative energy storage solutions. We develop, manufacture, and distribute advanced energy storage systems worldwide.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scriptor-paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of IT, you will ensure that Phenogy&#39;s IT-Technology foundation is secure, reliable, scalable, and capable of supporting rapid international growth. You will own the company&#39;s core IT operations, infrastructure, enterprise applications, cybersecurity, workplace technology, and service delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role focuses on operational excellence and business enablement. You will ensure that employees, strategic partners on the supply-chain as well as on the sales-channel side, manufacturing operations, and commercial teams can work effectively through robust technology platforms while maintaining high standards of security, compliance, and service quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your tasks &amp;amp; responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute Phenogy&#39;s global IT roadmap, ensuring stable and scalable technology operations across Switzerland, Germany, the United States, Singapore and future locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own enterprise applications and business systems, including ERP, collaboration platforms, identity management, endpoint management, and future MES integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain secure, cloud-based infrastructure and workplace technology environments that support global collaboration and operational continuity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cybersecurity, information security, risk management, business continuity, disaster recovery, and compliance initiatives aligned with industry best practices and future certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage external IT service providers, technology vendors, MSPs, and cybersecurity partners while ensuring service quality, performance, and cost efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead the internal IT organization, including IT Operations, Service Management, and Cybersecurity capabilities, while defining future sourcing and staffing strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish IT governance, service management processes, SLAs, asset management, and operational KPIs to support a growing international organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Operations, Supply Chain, PMO, Quality, Finance, and Commercial functions to ensure technology effectively supports business execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Must have&#39;s:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of leadership experience in IT, Infrastructure, Enterprise Applications, or Technology Operations within manufacturing, industrial, energy, or technology-driven environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing enterprise applications, cloud infrastructure, cybersecurity, networks, and global technology operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing and supporting ERP environments and business-critical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of cybersecurity frameworks, IT governance, risk management, and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage external service providers, technology vendors, and outsourcing partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to translate operational requirements into scalable technology solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in English; German a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&#39;s:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting international manufacturing operations and global supply chains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft Dynamics, MES environments, or industrial IoT integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of ISO 27001, NIST, TISAX, or similar security frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling technology operations in high-growth organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to renewable energy, battery systems, or industrial technology environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Technopark Lucerne with remote and home-office opportunities or Bremen, Germany&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Readiness&lt;/strong&gt;: 20-30%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workload&lt;/strong&gt;: 100%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports &lt;/strong&gt;: COO&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Become part of our eco-passionate expert team - a first-class team all around.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Benefit from flexible work hours as well as remote and on-site working in a modern sustainable office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Enjoy various events, an amazing coffee machine, and the occasional coffee from our CEO (acting Barista)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;At PHENOGY, we highly value diversity, equality, and inclusion. It makes our company stronger. &lt;strong&gt;Our philosophy: one mindset, many minds.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;For recruitment and staffing agencies: PHENOGY works exclusively with selected recruitment partners under formal agreements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We do not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from agencies and assume no liability for claims made by unauthorized recruiters regarding our recruitment processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt; At PHENOGY, we energize the future—sustainably. In this role&amp;nbsp;you will define and execute our digital engineering strategy, owning the architecture, security, quality, and lifecycle of our cloud, edge, and data products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Operating at the intersection of clean energy and industrial IoT, you will lead the digital ecosystem for our Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS) &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;148&quot;&gt;from the gateway upward&lt;/strong&gt;—connecting Edge/Gateway → Cloud Infrastructure → APIs → Monitoring/NOC → Customer Applications &amp;amp; Data Platforms. Working in close alignment with our Embedded Systems lead, Product, Cybersecurity, Operations, and Quality teams, you will turn complex energy and regulatory requirements into scalable, high-availability software and data platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You Will Own &amp;amp; Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Data Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define our technology roadmap, sourcing model (in-house vs. external), and application/data architecture. Establish clear boundaries, data models, APIs, and technical standards from the gateway layer through edge computing, cloud services, data pipelines, and customer/Battery Passport platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Engineering, DevOps &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead internal engineers and external partners. Govern the full software lifecycle—from requirements and Git workflows to automated CI/CD pipelines, environment segregation, release/rollback procedures, and end-of-life decommissioning. Champion automated testing (unit, integration, performance, regression) and proactively manage technical debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Product Cybersecurity &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Embed Security-by-Design via a Secure Software Development Lifecycle (SSDLC). Oversee secure coding, secrets/certificate management, SBOMs, open-source licensing, vulnerability remediation (SAST/DAST/SCA), and penetration testing across our edge and cloud stack in alignment with ISO/IEC 27001, IEC 62443, NIST SSDF, OWASP, NIS2, and the EU Cyber Resilience Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Connected Fleet &amp;amp; Data Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive high-throughput telemetry ingestion, operational data processing, analytics, remote diagnostics, gateway/edge over-the-air (OTA) updates, and secure remote access across our connected storage fleet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Embedded Interface Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the Embedded Systems lead (who owns BMS, controllers, and string-level firmware) to define clean gateway protocols and data contracts—ensuring seamless integration without overlapping responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Team &amp;amp; Supplier Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, mentor, and scale a high-performing platform and data engineering organization. Manage external development partners from technical due diligence and contracting through delivery, ensuring clean IP ownership, documentation, and zero single-vendor lock-in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Executive Governance &amp;amp; IT Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Hold decision-making authority over digital platform architecture, tech stacks, repositories, CI/CD, and technical debt. Partner closely with the Head of IT to maintain a clear boundary between product software and enterprise IT while jointly governing shared domains (IAM, cloud infrastructure, networking, incident response, and disaster recovery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Data Engineering, IT, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record leading software/data teams, complex engineering programs, and external development vendors, translating business goals into clear roadmaps and architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Modern Cloud, API &amp;amp; Data Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in cloud-native software architecture, data pipelines/telemetry processing, integration patterns, REST/streaming APIs, DevOps, CI/CD automation, and full-lifecycle release management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Security Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong command of secure software engineering practices, vulnerability management, and risk-based decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to bridge deep technical execution with executive stakeholder alignment—balancing speed, cost, quality, and operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;Domain experience in Energy Tech, BESS, Industrial IoT, Edge computing, or connected fleet platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;Hands-on familiarity with Microsoft Azure, Azure DevOps, C#/.NET, Python, modern data stacks, and REST APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of IEC 62443 and cybersecurity standards for connected industrial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot;&gt;Experience managing high-availability operational systems and formal product lifecycle management (PLM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;How Success Is Measured&lt;/strong&gt; You will have clear ownership backed by transparent engineering metrics, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Roadmap predictability, release frequency, deployment success/rollback rates, platform availability, and incident trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Code, Data &amp;amp; Security Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Automated test coverage, data pipeline reliability/latency, CI/CD maturity, defect rates/MTTR, critical vulnerability remediation speed, and technical debt reduction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Efficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Architecture documentation completeness, supplier delivery quality, and R&amp;amp;D resource efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Workload:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time | &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Senior Management / Head&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;15,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Executive Management (CTO / COO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Become part of our eco-passionate expert team - a first-class team all around.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Benefit from flexible work hours as well as remote and on-site working in a modern sustainable office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Enjoy various events, an amazing coffee machine, and the occasional coffee from our CEO (acting Barista)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;At PHENOGY, we highly value diversity, equality, and inclusion. It makes our company stronger. &lt;strong&gt;Our philosophy: one mindset, many minds.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;For recruitment and staffing agencies: PHENOGY works exclusively with selected recruitment partners under formal agreements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We do not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from agencies and assume no liability for claims made by unauthorized recruiters regarding our recruitment processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Electra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Air travel is about to become something more: more direct, more accessible, and more connected to the places where people live, work and want to be. Every day in the U.S., people make 35 million trips of 50–500 miles, stuck in traffic or routed through crowded hubs. Chances are, you&#39;ve been one of them. At Electra, we&#39;re changing that with the EL9, a nine-passenger, hybrid-electric aircraft that takes off and lands in just 150 feet. Our Ultra Short technology opens up thousands of new places to fly, beyond conventional runways, congested airports and long drives. We&#39;re backed by Lockheed Martin, Honeywell and Safran. Operators worldwide have signed intent-to-purchase agreements for the first 2,200 aircraft we produce, and we&#39;re moving toward first test flights in 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Getting a new kind of aircraft airborne takes more than ambition. It takes our kind of bold: people who think big while working in the real world. Who move ideas into action and collaborate without silos. Who put people first and make room at the table for everyone. Who challenge one another without diminishing one another.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Sound like you? Then look beyond what you thought were your own limits, and help us take flight beyond runways.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Electra is actively recruiting a Staff Electrical Engineer to help lead the design and development of high-voltage and low-voltage electrical systems for our 9-passenger eSTOL (electric short takeoff and landing), hybrid-electric aircraft. This position focuses on design, prototyping, integration, and testing, and is based in Olten, Switzerland.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead the design, analysis, integration, and testing of assigned electrical systems for our hybrid-electric aircraft. This role has the potential to support a number of aircraft electric systems and equipment, including avionics, power distribution (low voltage and high voltage), power electronics, electrical energy storage, and electric machines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Understand program objectives and requirements to conduct trade studies and help define architectures, requirements, and interfaces between systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and manage requirements for assigned electrical systems and equipment, compatible with program-level safety, performance, certification, and business objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Support the evaluation and selection of electrical equipment suppliers, and provide technical review and oversight throughout the development process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prepare and present design reviews to demonstrate the adequacy of the design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Provide hands-on support for electrical system integration and test activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with program management, other IPTs, and functional groups to accomplish team goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Other duties as assigned.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in the development of aerospace electrical systems, hybrid-electric propulsion, and/or avionics systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency with general-purpose test and build equipment/tools (oscilloscope, multimeter, soldering iron).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A strong work ethic and the ability to work independently and take ownership of assigned areas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent organization and communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to adapt well to change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in electrical engineering, aerospace, or a related field; and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in relevant discipline areas, or an equivalent combination of education, skills, and experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Master&#39;s or PhD in a relevant engineering discipline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with high-power hybrid-electric and/or fully electric propulsion systems and power electronics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of the Federal Aviation Regulations (FARs), certification procedures (especially Part 23), and relevant industry standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience implementing and troubleshooting digital communications architectures (e.g., RS422, CAN, Ethernet, ARINC 429).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with grounding schemes for large and complex electrical systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;US Person (Citizen or Green Card) preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance; STD, LTD, and life insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO, sick leave, and company holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Paid winter break&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;401(k) with immediate vesting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Free catered lunches, coffee, snacks, and drinks at our Manassas headquarters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Free on-site parking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Electra is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law. This position may be subject to ITAR requirements.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Special objects are the final frontier of e-commerce. As Senior Category Lead for Art – Primary Market, you’ll bring structure and consistency to the team’s day-to-day work. You’ll turn priorities into clear plans, strengthen how work moves across the team, and help each person take ownership of outcomes. Alongside this operational focus, you’ll support the Senior Category Manager in translating the category vision into practical initiatives that improve the experience for buyers and sellers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll create an engaged team culture built on trust, clear expectations, and accountability, helping people build on their strengths and grow in their roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll also coordinate with Sales, Marketing, and other relevant teams to deliver cross-functional improvements and keep the category’s priorities moving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a clear operating rhythm:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn category priorities into practical plans with clear owners, milestones, and regular follow-up so work moves forward reliably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve day-to-day operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Clarify workflows and handovers, spot bottlenecks early, and help the team resolve blockers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build team ownership and accountability:&lt;/strong&gt; Set clear goals and expectations, coach team members to take responsibility for their work, and help them use their strengths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen engagement and development:&lt;/strong&gt; Hold regular 1:1s, give timely feedback, and support each person’s growth in partnership with the Senior Category Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use performance insights to guide action:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor category results, identify risks and opportunities, and coordinate focused actions with relevant teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate strategy into delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Senior Category Manager’s vision by coordinating cross-functional initiatives from planning through execution and review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify category growth opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; Use market and performance insight to spot where the category can grow, then work with relevant teams to turn promising opportunities into practical initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong track record of creating structure, setting priorities, and ensuring reliable execution in a category, sales, or commercial team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leadership and coaching:&lt;/strong&gt; You help colleagues perform at their best through clear goals, regular feedback, coaching, and support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and accountability:&lt;/strong&gt; You set clear expectations, follow through on commitments, and encourage others to take responsibility for outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organised project delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; You coordinate cross-functional work, manage dependencies and timelines, and keep stakeholders aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical judgment:&lt;/strong&gt; You use data and customer or market insight to identify issues, set priorities, and evaluate results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear, constructive communication:&lt;/strong&gt; You build trust, share context, give direct feedback, and adapt your communication to different stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interest in contemporary art:&lt;/strong&gt; You bring a genuine interest in contemporary art and the primary art market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work in the Art Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re a supportive, friendly Art team&lt;/strong&gt; that works together to tackle ambitious growth challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll work across Art – Primary Market&lt;/strong&gt;, supporting the Direct from the Artist and Photography categories with clear day-to-day priorities and coordinated delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll collaborate with Sales, Marketing, HR, and relevant partner teams&lt;/strong&gt;, agreeing owners and next steps so decisions turn into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll report to the Senior Category Manager in Art – Primary Market&lt;/strong&gt; and take part in the Art cluster’s management discussions, sharing updates, aligning on priorities, and raising blockers early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferably this role is hybrid,&amp;nbsp; based in Amsterdam. You’ll work from our Amsterdam HQ at least two days per week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Director within our Corporate, Issues &amp;amp; Crisis team, you will be a senior strategic advisor and team leader – protecting and enhancing the reputations of some of the world’s most significant organisations. Based in Amsterdam, you’ll lead high-stakes issues and crisis work across the Energy &amp;amp; Industrials, Healthcare or Technology sectors, counselling senior clients through their most sensitive moments and delivering media training that builds their confidence and capability. You’ll grow existing relationships, win new business, and help build the visibility, reputation and talent of the team in the Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a leading role in developing Burson’s corporate, issues and crisis work in the Netherlands – retaining existing clients and growing new business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor and senior counsel to clients, adding strategic value during sensitive, high-stakes and reputational moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead issues and crisis programmes for clients across the Energy &amp;amp; Industrials, Healthcare or Technology sectors, anticipating risks and building proactive response plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver media training and crisis simulation exercises that build client confidence and capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the visibility and reputation of the team – with a view to winning new business and attracting talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and mentor client teams, nurturing talent and contributing to a strong, collaborative team culture across the agency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take responsibility for budget monitoring, revenue forecasting, resourcing and fee negotiation to ensure the correct level of profitability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Burson externally in relevant specialist forums, network groups and speaker platforms across the Dutch and EU market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven background leading corporate, issues and crisis management within both agency and in-house settings, with strong exposure to complex, high-stakes scenarios and strategic media relations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sector expertise across either Energy &amp;amp; Industrials, Healthcare or Technology with a strong understanding of the issues shaping these industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in designing and delivering media training and crisis simulation exercises, alongside wider reputation management initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in managing communications across a broad range of stakeholders – including media, government, employees, investors and consumers – during sensitive, high-pressure moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially driven and entrepreneurial, with a track record of independently identifying and converting new business and managing client relationships end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted advisor to senior communications leaders and C-suite executives, with excellent interpersonal skills and credibility at the highest levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong, collaborative team leader, experienced in resourcing, commercial oversight and building high-performing, resilient teams, with previous experience within both agency and client-side environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full professional proficiency in Dutch and English, with the confidence to counsel clients and present in both languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-RE1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mavericks Wanted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When was the last time you achieved the impossible? If that thought feels overwhelming, you might want to pause here, but if it sparks excitement...read on&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In 2015, we pioneered a “moneyball for biotech” approach, pooling projects and promising early-stage research from academia together under one financial umbrella to reduce risk and unleash innovation. This model allows science and small teams of experts to lead the way. We build bridges to groundbreaking advancements in rare&amp;nbsp;disease, and&amp;nbsp;develop life-changing medicines for patients with unmet needs as fast as humanly possible. &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Together we define white space, push boundaries, and empower people to solve problems. If you&#39;re someone who defies convention, join us and work alongside some of the most respected minds in the industry. Together, we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;ask&amp;nbsp;&quot;why not?&quot; and help reengineer the future of biopharma. At BridgeBio, we value curiosity and experimentation—including the ethical &amp;amp; thoughtful use of AI to improve clarity, speed, and quality of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Director, Head of Quality &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: inherit;&quot;&gt;&amp;amp; Responsible Person&lt;/span&gt; for Encaleret, International, leads the quality organization of BridgeBio Pharma Europe B.V. and reports to Senior Vice President Quality. As the Responsible Person, the role carries personal accountability under EU GDP for the entity&#39;s distribution activities: release for distribution, recalls, and products that are authentic, correctly stored and transported, and traceable. The role is independent of Commercial Operations, Manufacturing and Supply Chain, with an unrestricted right of escalation to the entity&#39;s full board. She/he leads and develops the entity&#39;s quality team, maintains the entity&#39;s quality management system, developed with the affiliate quality leads from existing BridgeBio frameworks, and leads WDA licensing, inspection readiness and subsequent MIA readiness, if needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the named Responsible Person on the WDA: release for distribution, recall decisions, and GDP compliance of the entity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take final disposition decision on returned, rejected, recalled or potentially falsified products (an RP decision under GDP), in consultation with BridgeBio&#39;s Global Quality Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and coordinate returns, rejections, suspected falsified products and recall operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approve return to saleable stock&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that customers are entitled to receive the products prior to shipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the WDA registration remains current with the commercial supply chain setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the accuracy of quality records and that GDP requirements are implemented and maintained in the quality management system, as required for the WDA license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the WDA application and IGJ inspection readiness&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data integrity and own the entity&#39;s internal audit (self-inspection) program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the GDP quality agreement matrix: contract service providers, 3PLs, distributors and intercompany interfaces&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and write standard operating procedures in BridgeBio’s document management system in accordance with the GDP requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure there is a training program for BridgeBio staff working under GDP and ensure that the relevant staff members are trained on GDP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in GDP vendor qualification program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform quality review of assigned quality events such as deviations, change controls, supplier notifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform distribution release for finished goods received from the contract manufacturing organization, which can include review of temperature, shipping and receiving documentation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for and be directly involved in product complaints from the EU and ROW markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide GDP and QA related support and intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be available and reachable 24/7&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other QA/Quality Person related responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead and develop the entity&#39;s quality team: deputy RP, QA compliance/QMS, and QA operations/GDP; and QP, if needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain the entity&#39;s GDP-compliant quality management system by adopting existing BridgeBio quality frameworks, adapted to the entity&#39;s license requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the affiliate quality leads to resolve quality issues and keep the intercompany interfaces effective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare subsequent MIA readiness (QP recruitment, import, API GMP verification, and batch-certification processes), if needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in updating CMC sections of regulatory and quality documents as needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in regulatory inspections&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in internal and external project team meetings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and review governing procedure (e.g., SOPs, WIs, etc.), where necessary&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Where You’ll Work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Netherlands-based role that will require 30% travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who You Are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in pharmaceutical quality, including significant GDP / distribution quality experience; prior appointment as (or eligibility to be) a Responsible Person strongly preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading regulatory inspections with EU competent authorities (IGJ preferred)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience of managing third party vendors (CMOs, CTLs, 3PLs, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior relevant knowledge and experience related to the distribution of medical products&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of supply chain concepts, supplier management, inventory&amp;nbsp;management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of US/EU GMPs /GDPs and associated guidance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working in a highly regulated environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership of quality teams; experience building quality functions or systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS degree preferably in operations, science, pharmacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documented GDP training and the education and experience to be accepted as Responsible Person by the Dutch authorities (Farmatec/IGJ)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Skills&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding the EU and particularly IGJ regulations in relation to the wholesale distribution of medicines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English language; written/spoken in Dutch language, preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong planning and time management skills with ability to prioritize workload&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, with keen attention to detail&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of data concepts and enterprise resource planning (ERP) systems e.g., SAP&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ready to embrace company core values and diverse corporate culture&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rewarding Those Who Make the Mission Possible&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have high expectations for our team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market leading compensationHybrid work model - we value your flexibility in how you work, but encourage time in the office to strengthen our culture, collaboration, and sense of community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We provide career development through regular feedback, continuous education and professional development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We celebrate strong performance with financial rewards, peer-to-peer recognition, and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a global company, our comprehensive benefits may vary based on location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
