&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics is a leading global sports platform redefining how fans connect with the teams, players and moments they love. Our businesses — Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, Fanatics Events, Fanatics Advertising, Fanatics Markets and Fanatics Studios — maximize the presence and reach for hundreds of partners globally and create a one-stop experience that allows fans to buy, bet, collect, and earn, while engaging with sports in deeper, more immersive ways. This includes licensed fan gear and lifestyle products, sportsbook and iGaming, physical and digital trading cards, live events, premium sports entertainment content, credit card offerings and more. Together, they form a powerful, integrated ecosystem — connected by the Fanatics ONE loyalty program and FanCash, the currency of sport — delivering personalized experiences to over 100 million fans worldwide. Fanatics holds partnerships with over 900 sports properties, from professional leagues and players’ associations to teams, colleges and retail partners; over 7,000 athletes and celebrities; and over 2,000 retail locations, including all Lids stores. Backed by a team of more than 22,000 employees, Fanatics is committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role: a designer who builds, or an engineer who designs. You have the eye to know what good looks like and the code to make it repeatable. You build and run the automated workstreams that Fanatics Casino, and the teams around it, produce brand-safe creative from every day: template and variant generators, image and video generation with our rules built in, copy-to-layout pipelines, Figma plugins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The stack is already here: a shared Figma design system, Figma Motion and Figma Buzz for locked self-serve templates, Figma Weave for generative image and video, Creative Engine for automated static and video assets, and Runway. You turn them into automated templates and workflows that CRM, performance marketing and partners run themselves, with brand, responsible gaming and compliance rules built in so the output is right by default; you own best-in-class video generation, and train the models that keep generated imagery and video looking like us. The tools you make are run by CRM managers, performance marketers and designers across in-app, CRM and paid. You can build, not just brief. Design judgement decides what gets built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute automated workstreams for teams including CRM, performance marketing, partners and design: template and variant generators, copy-to-layout pipelines, Figma plugins and automation scripts that go from brief to approved asset, connecting the existing stack end to end (design system components into Buzz templates, Weave agent workflows for promo imagery, Creative Engine extended from Markets into CRM and in-app).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own best-in-class video generation: set up and run the generative video pipeline across Weave, Runway and Creative Engine for hooks, variants, start frames and localisations, and decide which tool does what where they overlap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and maintain LoRAs and custom models on the Casino visual identity, products, characters and partner assets so generated imagery and video stay on-brand without hand-fixing; retrain when the brand or a partner changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encode the Casino visual identity, responsible gaming requirements and market-specific compliance rules into every workstream, so a CRM manager or performance marketer can run it and the output is safe by default: disclaimer and RG messaging legible and correctly placed at every size. Creative approves anything new.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Target the highest-volume executions first (CRM banners, in-app promo cards, paid variants) and measure the before and after in hours per asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the tools after launch: fix them when the brand, a regulator or a vendor model changes, and retire what stops working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Lead Motion &amp;amp; 3D Designer on motion templates and render pipelines, and with the Design Lead on how brand rules translate into constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document what you build so the team can use it without you, and train the people who run it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present the roadmap and results to Design, Marketing and senior leadership in plain terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on generative AI in production: image and video generation pipelines across tools like Weave, Runway and ComfyUI, LoRA or fine-tune training for brand consistency, prompt and workflow design. Used through their APIs, not only their interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Judgement about AI output: you can evaluate models on quality, cost, licensing and brand risk, set guardrails, handle failure modes, and tell a marketer plainly what a model can and cannot do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years across design and engineering in any mix, with at least 2 building tools other people used in production. You have shipped design work and you have shipped code; we will ask to see both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working code: Python or JavaScript/TypeScript, REST APIs, Figma plugin development or equivalent, and a track record of shipping something maintainable rather than a prototype.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enough design craft to tell good from bad and to turn a brand guideline into a rule a machine can apply: layout, typography, colour, hierarchy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio or repo of tools you built, with who used them, what they replaced and what changed as a result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in a regulated category where some outputs must never ship, and the instinct to design for that.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication with non-technical colleagues, and the patience to train the people who will run what you build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about where the tools are going, and a point of view on what we should not automate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;iGaming, sportsbook or another regulated consumer category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dynamic creative or creative automation platforms (Celtra, Storyteq, Bannerflow, Creatopy) and a view on where they fall short.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion and 3D pipeline work: After Effects scripting, Cinema 4D or Blender automation, render or FFmpeg tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal tools with a lightweight front end (React, Streamlit or similar) that non-engineers adopted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working alongside CRM, lifecycle or performance marketing teams on high-volume, multi-market output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your first 90 days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll learn the stack, the brand rules and the three executions where volume hurts most. You&#39;ll ship the first automated workstream against one of them, with CRM running it, and show the hours it saved. You&#39;ll have a brand LoRA in use and a clear answer to which of Weave and Runway does what.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;About Scale&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scale builds AI systems for decisions that matter. We started out providing the data and evaluation behind many of the world&#39;s leading models, and we still work with the major frontier labs on research and post-training. Today we also build full applications: we take an organisation&#39;s own data and expertise, forward deploy alongside their teams, and build the systems they come to rely on, powered by the Scale GenAI Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The UK is making a wholesale shift to AI. The government&#39;s AI Opportunities Action Plan set out to &quot;mainline AI into the veins&quot; of the country, and the focus has now moved to delivery: the Incubator for AI (&lt;a href=&quot;http://i.AI&quot;&gt;i.AI&lt;/a&gt;) is shipping tools like the Humphrey suite into departments, a Sovereign AI Unit and AI Growth Zones are being stood up, and civilian departments are under real pressure to move from pilots to production. Scale can play a foundational role in building the reliable AI applications that shift depends on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone to lead that work in central government. This isn’t about staying in the office and managing a team of sales people, its about building the business from the front. You&#39;d own our commercial relationships across civilian departments, starting where the near-term pipeline is strongest: HMRC, DWP, and NHS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a critical role reporting directly to our Head of Public Sector, UK. You&#39;d carry a number, win deals yourself, and build a small team behind you as the work grows. It suits someone who has sold into these departments before and knows how they actually make decisions, not just how the org charts look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own our commercial plan and pipeline for UK civilian central government&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find, shape, and close deals yourself, from the first conversation through to contract and into delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use the relationships you already have across departments like HMRC, DWP, and NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work the frameworks, tenders and teaming, and know which route to market is worth the effort and which isn&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a credible counterpart to senior civil servants, and turn what they need into work we can deliver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close to our product and delivery teams so what we sell is what we build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and lead a small team over time, and help shape the wider UK public sector plan with the UK Public Sector Lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve sold and delivered technology or transformation work to UK civilian central government, either from a vendor or from inside government&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve rolled up your sleeves and built something from scratch, whether that’s a new vertical, territory or product launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know at least one major department well (e.g. HMRC, DWP, or NHS) and how it buys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand public sector procurement: frameworks, tenders, and buying that runs through a lot of stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve opened doors, run complex pursuits, and owned the result&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have relationships with senior people across departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You do your best work when things are ambiguous and moving quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;People who tend to fit this have spent years leading UK public sector work at companies like Palantir, Google, AWS, Microsoft or Oracle, at consultancies and systems integrators like Accenture, Deloitte, EY, Bain or McKinsey, or in senior commercial or programme roles inside the departments themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why join&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;d be building this market, not maintaining it. There&#39;s no playbook to inherit, which is rather the point. The deals you win, and the way you win them, will shape how Scale works with UK government for years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scale, our mission is to develop reliable AI systems for the world&#39;s most important decisions. Our products provide the high-quality data and full-stack technologies that power the world&#39;s leading models, and help enterprises and governments build, deploy, and oversee AI applications that deliver real impact. We work closely with industry leaders like Meta, Ernst &amp;amp; Young, Mayo Clinic, Time Inc., Middle Eastern governments, and U.S. government agencies. We are expanding our team to accelerate the development of AI applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that everyone should be able to bring their whole selves to work, which is why we are proud to be an inclusive and equal opportunity workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;PLEASE NOTE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our policy requires a 90-day waiting period before reconsidering candidates for the same role. This allows us to ensure a fair and thorough evaluation of all applicants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Scale, our mission is to develop reliable AI systems for the world&#39;s most important decisions. Our products provide the high-quality data and full-stack technologies that power the world&#39;s leading models, and help enterprises and governments build, deploy, and oversee AI applications that deliver real impact. We work closely with industry leaders like Meta, &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ernst&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; Young, Mayo Clinic, Time Inc., the Government of Qatar, and U.S. government agencies including the Army and Air Force. We are expanding our team to accelerate the development of AI applications.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that everyone should be able to bring their whole selves to work, which is why we are proud to be an inclusive and equal opportunity workplace. We are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability status, gender identity or Veteran status.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and mental disabilities. If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation in the application or recruiting process due to a disability, please contact us at ----- Please see the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights poster&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We comply with the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pay Transparency provision&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLEASE NOTE: &lt;/strong&gt;We collect, retain and use personal data for our professional business purposes, including notifying you of job opportunities that may be of interest and sharing with our affiliates. We limit the personal data we collect to that which we believe is appropriate and necessary to manage applicants’ needs, provide our services, and comply with applicable laws. Any information we collect in connection with your application will be treated in accordance with our internal policies and programs designed to protect personal data. Please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://scale.com/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_-113912706363268805m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coreweave.com&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re proud to be a Living Wage accredited Employer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;1:1-1:20;0-19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-3:411;21-431&quot;&gt;CoreWeave runs one of the largest GPU clouds in the world, and the network underneath it has to be fast, reliable, and almost entirely self-operating. Our Network Development team builds the software that makes that possible. We design, build, and run the platforms and services that provision, configure, automate, monitor, and heal the network, so that the people relying on it rarely have to think about it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:20;433-452&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;7:1-7:454;454-907&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Staff Software Engineer to take ownership of these systems. This is a software engineering role at its core. You will spend most of your time designing and writing production software, setting technical direction, and raising the quality bar for the team. A solid understanding of networking fundamentals is required, but deep network engineering expertise is not. This role is about building the software that operates the network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-17:75;909-2215&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:231;909-1139&quot;&gt;Own the design, development, and long-term health of the platforms and services that automate the network, including config generation, device provisioning, workflow automation, observability tooling, and internal CLIs and APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;10:1-10:151;1140-1290&quot;&gt;Plan and map out complex projects months in advance, sequencing the work, anticipating dependencies, and keeping several efforts moving in parallel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:140;1291-1430&quot;&gt;Lead technical direction through RFCs, design reviews, and architecture decisions, and break ambiguous problems down into shippable work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:189;1431-1619&quot;&gt;Write well-tested, well-documented software in Python and Go, and set the standard for quality across the team through strong test cases, clear error handling, and solid CI/CD practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:167;1620-1786&quot;&gt;Improve the reliability and operability of what we run by defining service-level indicators and objectives and relentlessly reducing manual toil through automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:146;1787-1932&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Network Engineering, Observability, Fleet Engineering, and HPC teams so our automation fits cleanly into the wider system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:109;1933-2041&quot;&gt;Join the on-call rotation once you are ramped, and help drive calm, blameless follow-up when things break.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;16:1-16:99;2042-2140&quot;&gt;Mentor other engineers, review code and designs, and help grow the technical skills of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:75;2141-2215&quot;&gt;Contribute to a positive, collaborative team and organizational culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:17;2217-2233&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-30:166;2235-3685&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:164;2235-2398&quot;&gt;8 or more years of professional software engineering experience, ideally building and operating production infrastructure, platform, or backend systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:39;2399-2437&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in Python and Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:117;2438-2554&quot;&gt;Solid understanding and experience in CI/CD (testing, code review, maintaining continuous builds and deployments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:104;2555-2658&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of managing runtime health for services and applications at an enterprise level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;25:1-25:208;2659-2866&quot;&gt;A love of process automation and toil elimination, with hands-on experience building workflow automation or orchestration systems and automated device provisioning at scale such as Zero Touch Provisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:174;2867-3040&quot;&gt;Strong planning skills, including the ability to lay out and drive projects across a multi-month horizon while keeping several concurrent efforts moving as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;27:1-27:115;3041-3155&quot;&gt;Strong, well-reasoned technical opinions, paired with genuine openness to better ideas and other people&#39;s input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;28:1-28:130;3156-3285&quot;&gt;A solid understanding of core networking fundamentals, including IP addressing and subnetting, routing/switching, NTP, and DNS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;29:1-29:234;3286-3519&quot;&gt;Comfort with Linux and Kubernetes, and experience with infrastructure automation tooling such as Ansible and Jinja, a source-of-truth or IPAM and DCIM system such as NetBox, and observability tooling such as Prometheus and Grafana.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;30:1-30:166;3520-3685&quot;&gt;Excellent written communication, a habit of writing documentation other people can actually use, and experience mentoring engineers and collaborating across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;32:1-32:15;3687-3701&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;34:1-34:61;3703-3763&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;34:1-34:61;3703-3763&quot;&gt;A degree in Computer Science or a related field is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;36:1-36:36;3765-3800&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you&#39;re a good fit?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;38:1-38:289;3802-4090&quot;&gt;We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams – even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we&#39;ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we&#39;d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;40:1-42:102;4092-4501&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;40:1-40:169;4092-4260&quot;&gt;You explain the reasoning behind your technical choices, stay open to being convinced otherwise, and pick the right tool for the job rather than defending a favorite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;41:1-41:139;4261-4399&quot;&gt;You see a problem and solve it without waiting to be asked, and you always look for ways to make things easier, faster, and more secure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;42:1-42:102;4400-4501&quot;&gt;You treat problems as shared problems, keep incident culture blameless, and give credit generously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;44:1-44:19;4503-4521&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;46:1-46:327;4523-4849&quot;&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast! We&#39;re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We&#39;re not afraid of a little chaos, and we&#39;re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;48:1-52:24;4851-4983&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;48:1-48:26;4851-4876&quot;&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;49:1-49:20;4877-4896&quot;&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;50:1-50:20;4897-4916&quot;&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;51:1-51:43;4917-4959&quot;&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;52:1-52:24;4960-4983&quot;&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;54:1-54:418;4985-5402&quot;&gt;We support and encourage an entrepreneurial outlook and independent thinking. We foster an environment that encourages collaboration and enables the development of innovative solutions to complex problems. As we get set for takeoff, the organization&#39;s growth opportunities are constantly expanding. You will be surrounded by some of the best talent in the industry, who will want to learn from you, too. Come join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The projected base salary range for this role is £116,000 to £155,000 for London-based candidates, and €135,000 to €180,000 for Dublin-based candidates.&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To fulfill our obligation to protect client data, successful applicants offered employment with CoreWeave will be required to complete a basic criminal record check, conducted in compliance with GDPR. Employment offers are conditional upon receiving satisfactory check results.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Dental Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Pension Contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance at 4x Salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical Illness Cover&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits may vary by location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CoreWeave is an equal opportunity employer, committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace. All qualified applicants and candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Agencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;CoreWeave does not accept speculative CVs. Any unsolicited CVs received will be treated as the property of CoreWeave and your Terms &amp;amp; Conditions associated with the use of CVs will be considered null and void.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Any unsolicited CVs sent by your company to us – that is to say, in any situation where we have not directly engaged your company in writing to supply candidates for a specific vacancy – will be considered by us to be a “free gift”, leaving us liable for no fees whatsoever should we choose to contact the candidate directly and engage the candidate’s services, and will in no way establish any prior claim by your company to representation of that candidate should the candidate’s details also be submitted by any other party.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position requires access to technology and/or source code subject to U.S. export control laws. Any such access will be provided only in compliance with applicable U.S. export control requirements. As part of the recruitment process, CoreWeave may request limited information reasonably necessary to assess applicable export-control requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
