&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(241, 196, 15);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;547fecc1-069e-5015-b28b-451b56143813|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469775450,&amp;quot;Normal1&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;Normal1&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,335559739,&amp;quot;160&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos,Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE COMPANY:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OAG is the essential intelligence partner transforming global travel. For nearly a century, we&#39;ve been the foundation the travel industry builds on, trusted, proven, essential. Today, we&#39;re going beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We combine unmatched data quality, quantity and access with breakthrough technology and deep industry expertise to deliver what the industry truly needs: not just more data, but better answers. From real-time operational intelligence to strategic decision-making, we power the entire travel ecosystem, from airlines and airports to technology companies and financial institutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are actively embedding AI throughout our intelligence layer, combining nearly a century of proprietary data with the latest technology to deliver answers that were simply not possible before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist because travel moves the world, and we move travel. By transforming complexity into clarity and questions into answers, we give our partners the intelligence they need to thrive in an evolving world. For more information visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.oag.com/&quot;&gt;www.oag.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(241, 196, 15);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;jss-po-ats-3-250 jss-po-ats-3-252&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;mce-content-body&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Internal Forward Deployed AI Engineer, you will work embedded alongside OAG teams to understand how they really work, redesign their processes and deliver dependable AI applications, agents and automation. Reporting to the Director of AI Led Business Transformation, you will partner with business owners and Technology from first discovery through to design, delivery and ongoing operation, challenging whether work is needed at all before automating it. Success looks like measurable improvements to customer outcomes, commercial contribution, operating costs and risk, and reusable capability that colleagues can adopt and sustain without depending on any one builder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role can be worked remotely from anywhere in the UK only. Please note that we&#39;re unable to offer visa sponsorship, so applicants will need the existing right to work in the UK.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(241, 196, 15);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BE DOING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed with OAG teams, observing real work and talking directly to users to define the problem, the starting position, the intended outcomes and the acceptance criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge existing steps, handoffs and approvals, simplifying or removing unnecessary work before automating it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design future workflows that use AI where it adds value, comparing conventional software, workflow automation, agents and existing products, and being open about the trade-offs and costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run dependable AI applications and agents, with the right tool access, memory, evaluation, human oversight and recovery arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Technology on testing, version control, controlled deployment, monitoring and security, and stay involved through rollout and stabilisation, using live evidence to improve reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own designated platform components, initially including n8n and our customer experience “second brain” solution and its memory layer, managing upgrades, running costs, technical debt, support boundaries and tested recovery procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use approved AI tools and agents across your own engineering work, giving them clear context and bounded responsibilities, and independently checking what they produce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable components, reference implementations and practical guidance, and coach colleagues through shared delivery so that capability transfers and technical ownership stays clear.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(241, 196, 15);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE&#39;RE LOOKING FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable delivery and operation of production AI and agentic applications, including responsibility for design decisions, evaluation, release and improvements informed by live use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with business users or customers from discovery and scoping through implementation, rollout and stabilisation. You do not need a forward deployed engineer job title; we are looking for evidence of this way of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong production coding skills in Python, TypeScript or a comparable language, with sound system design, APIs, authentication, SQL and data modelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating business systems and workflow automation, with reliable integrations that handle retries, duplicates and failures safely, and maintaining services through upgrades, failures and changing requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical capability in cloud services, containers, automated deployment, monitoring, incident diagnosis and backup and recovery, applying proportionate security and change controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of how agents fail, including uncertainty, prompt injection and access boundaries, and the judgement to recognise when an agent is the wrong answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of using AI coding tools and agents in your own delivery, explaining what the agents did, how their work was verified and where human judgement changed the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-first, lean thinking: the ability to turn business problems into clear technical options, and to help colleagues adopt practices that improve how they build and maintain solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(241, 196, 15);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IT WOULD BE GREAT IF YOU ALSO HAD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with n8n workflow automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with memory or retrieval systems and the Model Context Protocol (MCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Azure AI services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with Rembr (useful, but not required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don’t meet every requirement but feel excited about this role, we’d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(241, 196, 15);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;WE WILL OFFER YOU:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;💡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;You will proactively explore and adopt AI tools and automation in your day-to-day work, keeping the customer at the centre of everything you do. You will share learnings &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;with your team and approach &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;new technologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt; with curiosity and an open mind. At OAG, finding better ways to work and putting customers first is everyone&#39;s responsibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[852],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;🚀&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;Real responsibility on hard problems, with the autonomy to own decisions and act on them, in an open culture built on trust.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[852],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;🏡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;Flexible working arrangements that allow remote work or office attendance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[852],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;💰&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;An attractive compensation and benefits package, including private health insurance, a company bonus scheme and enhanced pension scheme &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[852],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;🏖️&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;25 days holiday plus bank holidays, and a day off during your birthday month  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[852],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;⚡&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;Octopus EV salary sacrifice scheme &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[852],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;🌍&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;Work remotely anywhere in the world for up to 1 month per year &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[852],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;📚&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;Annual learning and development budget. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:426,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[852],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[1]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:862}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;OAG is committed to creating an inclusive workplace where everyone feels valued and able to perform at their best.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds and experiences. If you &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;require&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt; reasonable adjustments at any stage of the recruitment process, please let us know — &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt;we’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal1&quot;&gt; happy to have an open conversation about how we can support you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Charging your car should feel as natural as charging your phone. That’s the future we’re building: a network of EV chargers where life happens. We don’t just install chargers. We &lt;strong&gt;accelerate sustainable mobility.&lt;/strong&gt; We &lt;strong&gt;obsess over partnerships.&lt;/strong&gt; We &lt;strong&gt;grow relentlessly&lt;/strong&gt;: our network, our partners, and ourselves.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our mission is as simple as it is ambitious: &lt;strong&gt;Accelerate Sustainable Mobility&lt;/strong&gt; by investing in, installing, and operating EV charging stations through an innovative business model. We help businesses find the right charging solutions for their customers and make EV charging more accessible, reliable, and integrated into everyday life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are &lt;strong&gt;Partner Obsessed&lt;/strong&gt; 🤝 — creating tailor-made solutions that better serve our partners and their customers. We’re driven by the challenge of making EV charging simpler and more readily available 💡. And we’re committed to growing relentlessly 📈 — our network, our partners’ businesses, and the professional development of our team.&lt;br&gt;If you’re here, you’re probably not looking for “just a job.” Neither are we. 😎 We’re driven by impact and always looking for people who thrive on turning bold ideas into reality. If that sounds like you, you’ll feel at home here. We’re looking for people who see challenges as opportunities, thrive in fast-growing, high-energy environments, and want to shape the future of mobility, not just watch it unfold. At Powerdot, you’ll get &lt;strong&gt;freedom&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;ownership&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;. The space to experiment. The chance to scale your ideas. And a team that’s always pushing the edge of what’s possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 About this Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Management Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll hold a key position within the Sales team, directly responsible for the Major Accounts scope — partners who manage multiple sites across their portfolio. You’ll operate at the centre of the electric mobility ecosystem, where technology, infrastructure, and a dynamic retail environment come together.&lt;br&gt;Your mission is to grow and protect Powerdot’s most valuable partner relationships by building long-term trust, monitoring account and station performance, and turning insights into actions that improve partner satisfaction and business results. You’ll act as the bridge between our major accounts and every internal team, ensuring that partner needs are understood, prioritised, and delivered — while continuously raising the quality of the partner experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Shape Our Story:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your day-to-day will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Managing and developing long-term relationships&lt;/strong&gt; with Powerdot’s major accounts and strategic partners, building trust and becoming their go-to contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitoring account performance&lt;/strong&gt; — tracking key metrics to identify opportunities to improve partner satisfaction, station performance, and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preparing and leading quarterly business reviews&lt;/strong&gt; — analysing performance, extracting key insights, and building clear action plans to share with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acting as the main point of contact&lt;/strong&gt; for partners — understanding their needs and coordinating the appropriate internal teams to address them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt; with Operations, Maintenance, Finance, Legal, Marketing, and other Powerdot teams to ensure smooth account management and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developing and implementing partner-specific initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; — including promotional campaigns, special operations, and other commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitoring operational station performance&lt;/strong&gt; — proactively identifying issues, risks, and opportunities across the charging stations in your accounts’ portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translating partner feedback into action&lt;/strong&gt; — converting partner needs and business priorities into actionable recommendations for internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contributing to process improvement&lt;/strong&gt; — helping continuously improve Powerdot’s strategic account management processes and overall partner experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Is About You, Not Us 🫵🏼:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1–2 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in strategy or consulting, ideally combined with experience in account management, business development, or a client-facing role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/strong&gt; — you can structure complex topics and turn insights into actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/strong&gt; — you can interact confidently with senior clients and coordinate across multiple internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong business acumen&lt;/strong&gt; — you understand what drives partner value and commercial success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A customer-oriented mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — you put the partner at the centre of your decisions and act on their behalf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities&lt;/strong&gt; — you thrive in a fast-paced, cross-functional environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interest in electric mobility, technology, and infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; — you’re curious about the evolving retail ecosystem and the future of mobility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ownership mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — you take responsibility for outcomes and follow through from insight to action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Kind of Energy We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;We’re not into titles, egos, or corporate buzzwords. We’re into people who make things happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You lead and listen.&lt;/strong&gt; You build trust with senior partners while staying attuned to what internal teams need to deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You own your stuff.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t stop at identifying an opportunity: you turn it into an action plan and see it through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re commercially minded.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand that great account management drives both partner satisfaction and sustainable business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You bring structure to complexity.&lt;/strong&gt; You can manage multiple accounts, stakeholders, and priorities without losing sight of the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ve got a green heartbeat.&lt;/strong&gt; Sustainability isn’t just cool, it’s core. You care about building partnerships that make electric mobility more accessible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You balance rigour with relationships.&lt;/strong&gt; You’re disciplined about analysis and follow-through, but you never lose the human touch with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You grow on purpose.&lt;/strong&gt; You’re eager to learn, deepen your commercial expertise, and help Powerdot strengthen its most strategic relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you&#39;ll be Powered up?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;🏥 Private health insurance coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;💪🏼 Gym membership to support your wellbeing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;⏰ Flexible working hours so you can manage your time effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;🌍 Annual offsite to celebrate achievements and connect with colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;🤝🏼 Regular team-building activities with your local team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;📚 English training to support collaboration across all markets and teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;🍩 Free office snacks, unlimited coffee, and meal allowance for every worked day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start &quot;&gt;⚡️ Special discounts for charging your electric vehicle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Promise To You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The best solutions come from different voices. We’re committed to building a culture where inclusion, respect, and equal opportunity are part of everyday life. At Powerdot, everyone is encouraged to contribute ideas, challenge assumptions, and create positive change.&lt;br&gt;Whether you’re strengthening a partner relationship, leading a quarterly review, or turning feedback into action, your contribution matters. At Powerdot, you’ll have the space to learn, take ownership, and help build partnerships that power the future of mobility. &lt;strong&gt;Your voice helps power the future — literally.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qui sommes-nous:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, leader mondial de la communication, a pour mission de créer de la valeur pour ses clients par la gestion de leur réputation. Grâce à notre expertise, nos technologies de pointe, nos solutions d&#39;intelligence artificielle et notre créativité, nous anticipons les risques en temps réel, identifions les insights générateurs de préférence et d&#39;engagement, et accompagnons la transformation et la réussite de nos clients. Nous réinventons la réputation pour en faire un véritable atout concurrentiel. Burson est le gardien de votre réputation, le partenaire qui vous guide dans un environnement complexe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En rejoignant Burson, vous intégrez une communauté mondiale d&#39;experts à la pointe de l&#39;innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson fait partie du groupe WPP (LSE/NYSE : WPP), spécialiste de la transformation créative. Pour en savoir plus, rendez-vous sur&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt; bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; et suivez-nous sur &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;et Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton rôle au sein de l&#39;équipe (Missions) :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu rejoindras notre équipe&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;Brand &amp;amp; Lifestyle&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;, composée d&#39;une dizaine de consultant.es passionné.es, et tu participeras activement à la mise en œuvre de programmes de communication impactants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sous la responsabilité de consultants expérimentés, tu seras un membre clé de nos équipes projets, avec des missions variées et formatrices :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veille stratégique :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Réaliser des veilles médiatiques et des recherches thématiques pour anticiper les tendances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rédaction impactante :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Rédiger des communiqués de presse, des invitations médias, des notes de synthèse et des profils de journalistes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relations médias et influenceurs :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Développer et entretenir des liens privilégiés avec les journalistes et les influenceurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation et suivi :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Participer à l&#39;organisation d&#39;interviews, assurer les relances journalistes et réaliser les bilans des événements médias.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribution stratégique :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborer à la conception de stratégies de communication innovantes (positionnement, messages clés, actions).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soutien événementiel :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Apporter ton aide à l&#39;organisation d&#39;événements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting d&#39;activité :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Contribuer à l&#39;élaboration des rapports d&#39;activité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ces missions sont conçues pour te faire monter en compétences et pourront évoluer au fil de ton stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le profil que nous recherchons :&lt;/strong&gt; Tu es en M1, M2 ou année de césure en communication, et tu as idéalement une première expérience en stage dans le domaine de la communication ou des Relations Publics. Une convention de stage est obligatoire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au-delà de ton parcours, nous apprécierons particulièrement :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton engagement :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Impliqué.e, curieux.se, rigoureux.se et autonome, tu as également un fort esprit d&#39;équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton intérêt pour l&#39;actualité :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tu es passionné.e par les médias et l&#39;actualité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes compétences en RP :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tu as une bonne connaissance des techniques de relations presse (relances, rédaction de communiqués de presse, shopping médias).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ta qualité rédactionnelle :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tu as une excellente plume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes qualités relationnelles :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tu es à l&#39;aise dans les échanges et sais créer du lien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton niveau d&#39;anglais :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;L&#39;anglais lu, écrit et parlé est un atout précieux, car certaines missions peuvent être internationales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous valorisons la diversité des profils pour construire une équipe riche et complémentaire. La qualité essentielle que nous recherchons est&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;ton envie d&#39;apprendre et de te professionnaliser.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un encadrement de qualité pour ta réussite (Encadrement et Formation) :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Chez Burson, tu seras pleinement intégré.e à l&#39;équipe et participeras à toutes nos activités (réunions d&#39;équipe, réunions agence, moments de convivialité...).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre objectif est clair : te fournir une expérience professionnalisante et concrète pour renforcer ton employabilité à l&#39;issue de ton stage. Nous sommes là pour t&#39;accompagner et te faire progresser.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes avantages chez Burson (Rémunération et Autres Avantages) :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Nous nous engageons à offrir un cadre de stage stimulant et avantageux :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gratification :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;750€/mois.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibilité :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Possibilité de télétravailler jusqu&#39;à 2 jours par semaine (jours flexibles en accord avec le manager) avec une indemnité de télétravail (10€/mois).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobilité :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Forfait mensuel de 45,40€ pour tes transports (carte Swile).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Restauration :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Prise en charge des repas au restaurant d’entreprise pour un reste à charge de 3,70€ (entrée-plat-dessert).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Temps libre :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;1 jour de RTT par mois.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Avantages CE :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Accès aux offres de notre comité d&#39;entreprise (places de cinéma à 5€, chèques cadeaux culture, remboursements sportifs…).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prime de cooptation :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Une prime de 150€ en chèques cadeaux multi-enseignes pour l&#39;aide au recrutement de tes successeurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prêt.e à relever ce défi et à développer tes compétences en Relations Publics Consumer ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pour postuler :&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Envoie-nous ton CV et une lettre de motivation ou quelques lignes expliquant ton intérêt pour ce stage. Nous avons hâte de découvrir ton profil ! 👇&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LIAB1,20&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre place est chez Burson :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre vision est de faire de Burson la référence en matière de formation pour les professionnels de la communication créative et les leaders de demain. Nous offrons un environnement de travail stimulant où les collaborateurs motivés et ambitieux peuvent développer leurs compétences, étendre leur réseau et élaborer des stratégies innovantes pour les plus grandes marques. Notre engagement envers le développement de nos talents se traduit par des opportunités de formation, des programmes de mentorat avec des leaders du secteur, et une culture d&#39;entreprise stimulante et inclusive qui encourage la collaboration et l&#39;innovation. Nous avons également mis en place des programmes de reconnaissance et de fidélisation pour nos meilleurs talents. Nous investissons dans nos collaborateurs car nous sommes convaincus que leur réussite est aussi la nôtre.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Burson, nous sommes une agence d&#39;apprenants permanents. Nous savons que l&#39;excellence en créativité et en communication exige une compréhension fine et nuancée. C&#39;est pourquoi nous recherchons des collaborateurs talentueux de tous horizons et de toutes cultures. Ces talents sont essentiels pour concevoir des idées audacieuses, favoriser un dialogue constructif, créer des expériences enrichissantes et stimuler l&#39;innovation pour nos clients. Votre point de vue unique, votre talent, fait de vous une #BursonPerson.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En cliquant sur « Soumettre la candidature », vous nous transmettez les informations saisies. Avant de le faire, veuillez consulter notre politique de confidentialité en matière &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;de recrutement. &lt;/a&gt;Les candidats résidant &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;en Californie. &lt;/a&gt;sont invités à consulter notre politique de confidentialité californienne pour le recrutement. Ce document détaille l&#39;utilisation de vos données personnelles lors de votre candidature et explique comment les mettre à jour ou les supprimer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Burson France is seeking an accomplished and visionary &lt;strong&gt;Head of Technology Practice &lt;/strong&gt;to lead and grow our dynamic technology portfolio. This pivotal leadership role is responsible for driving the strategic direction, growth, and operational excellence of Burson&#39;s Technology practice across France. Reporting directly to the CEO/Managing Director of Burson France, you will be critical in identifying and securing new business opportunities, ensuring high-quality client delivery, fostering team development, and championing innovation within the Burson brand. You will play a key role in protecting and promoting Burson&#39;s distinct approach to technology communications, directly contributing to the practice&#39;s revenue targets and elevating our reputation as a market leader.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic growth and business development:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive technology revenue growth across France, identifying, securing, and expanding high-value client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead market-facing new business development, proactively originating opportunities, opening doors with net-new clients, and personally leading major pitches and conversions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Burson’s technology proposition in France, expanding our footprint with existing clients, scaling multi-market engagements, and integrating broader Burson capabilities to deliver greater client value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Client leadership and financial management:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted senior advisor to France&#39;s most influential technology clients, providing strategic counsel to C-suite and senior stakeholders on complex communication challenges and program implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for overall profitability, quality, relationship management, and client satisfaction for all technology accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage practice finances, including budget development, management, resourcing, and forecasting for the technology practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team leadership and talent development:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, lead, and inspire a high-performing Technology team in France, creating a culture of collaboration, inclusion, and excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the right capabilities are in place to support growth, providing mentorship, identifying development gaps, and implementing training initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thought leadership and innovation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion innovation and modern delivery, embedding emerging technologies, AI-enabled solutions, and new IP into client offerings to enhance impact, efficiency, and differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess an excellent understanding of the evolving media landscape and demonstrate the ability to collaborate effectively with multiple internal stakeholders, including Burson’s regional and global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of building, growing, and leading a technology practice or significant technology portfolio in France (or a similar mature European market), ideally within a communications, consulting, or professional services environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior client advisory gravitas, with the ability to counsel, influence, and build trust with C-suite and senior government or enterprise stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable success in new business origination and growth, with experience winning complex, high-value mandates in competitive and fast-evolving markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the French business and cultural landscape, with the credibility and networks to operate effectively across diverse markets and client environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal communication skills and proven people leadership experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise and curiosity within the technology sector, with a clear view of emerging trends, innovation, and disruption shaping client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native-level fluency in French (written and spoken) and professional fluency in English (written and spoken) is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Burson: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LIAB1,20&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ About the role :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DataDome, security is a core part of how we build and scale. Our security team already covers GRC, SecOps, and security leadership, and we are now looking for a senior individual contributor to strengthen the engineering-facing side of the function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As DataDome evolves from a single product into a broader platform, our security scope is expanding across product, infrastructure, internal systems, and AI-enabled workflows. At the same time, our regulatory and assurance requirements are becoming more demanding, including ISO 27001 and SOC 2.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Security Engineer with a strong technical background, able to work closely with engineering teams and bring practical security expertise to product security, cloud security, application security, secure software supply chain, security tooling, and AI security topics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports directly to the Head of Security. It is a pure individual contributor position with no management responsibilities. Impact comes from technical depth, hands-on execution, and cross-functional influence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 &lt;strong&gt;You will be more specifically in charge of things like...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Product, cloud, and application security&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to architecture, design, and implementation reviews for new features, services, platform changes, and cloud initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pragmatic threat modeling and secure-by-design practices across APIs, services, data flows, workloads, and platform components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise engineering teams on application security, cloud and infrastructure security, and secure software supply chain topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help teams make sound security trade-offs and support remediation on complex or high-priority topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;AI security and enablement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the security of AI-related product capabilities, including model, pipeline, data flow, and integration considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess technical security risks related to internal AI usage, including data exposure, acceptable use, and vendor-related concerns, in partnership with the GRC function where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify practical opportunities to leverage AI in security workflows, including threat analysis, remediation support, security reviews, and compliance-related automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Technical risk and security enablement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring strong technical depth to security and risk discussions by helping identify realistic attack paths, assess practical impact and likelihood, and translate findings into pragmatic remediation priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the GRC function to ensure risk assessments are supported by strong technical input and connected to concrete engineering actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain risks, trade-offs, and recommendations in a way that drives action across engineering and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make secure practices easier to adopt through clear guidance, repeatable patterns, automation, and pragmatic support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Security tooling improvement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to improving and evolving our security tooling, in close collaboration with SecOps, with a focus on making security signals, posture insights, and remediation workflows more useful for Security and Engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop use cases, dashboards, workflows, and integrations that help teams better understand, prioritize, and remediate security issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👤 &lt;strong&gt;It would be great if...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring a strong technical security foundation (+7 years) across application security, cloud and infrastructure security, and secure software supply chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have worked in a SaaS or internet-scale product environment where security had to move at engineering speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are comfortable working close to engineering teams: reviewing designs, challenging assumptions, supporting remediation, and turning security needs into practical improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You enjoy going deep into security tools and using them to improve visibility, prioritization, remediation, and engineering workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring hands-on security expertise to identify meaningful risks, evaluate practical impact, and guide pragmatic remediation priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are comfortable stepping in on urgent or high-impact security topics when needed, including incidents, emerging threats, complex remediations, and fast-moving cross-functional issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You thrive in a small team setup — where you own a broad scope, move fast without heavy process, and adapt when priorities shift.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;French and English proficiency (working language is English, remote-friendly with occasional presence in Paris).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SOC 2 Type II and third-party risk management in a SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI governance topics or security implications of AI tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flex Life:&lt;/strong&gt; While we offer remote, hybrid, &amp;amp; in-office options each position specifies the level of flexibility. Our Parisian office is located next to the Opera Garnier. You will also receive a 500€ stipend to help you set up your ideal workspace if you work hybrid or remotely.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are full remote, the SNCF dicount card is paid for you to come to our office to visit us &amp;amp; your team!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Health Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; We have partnered with Kenko for your healthcare needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 100€ annual allowance is provided for a leisure activity of your choice in Sports or Culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual allowance of €200 if you come to the office by bike to cover maintenance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Development&lt;/strong&gt;: #Weaimhigh is part of our DNA, therefore we have invested in an internal Learning and Development platform and offer the opportunity to request additional training and support via your manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Events &amp;amp; Team building: #We care and we have fun!&lt;/strong&gt; We organise ****Annual Company-Offsite, Events, Drinks, Winter Party, Lunch &amp;amp; Learns and much more are part of our Culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parent Care:&lt;/strong&gt; Gift &amp;amp; care packages for parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PTO:&lt;/strong&gt; Based on the country you are based from (e.g. 25 days in France).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are the next steps?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Talent Acquisition Manager : first interview and cultural fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Engineering Manager Damien : technical and cultural fit + Take-home technical challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Team: Presentation and review of your &quot;technical proposal&quot; with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You x Member of the leadership team - Discussion about DataDome vision and &quot;raison d&#39;être&quot;!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Now you really met everyone! Welcome to DataDome :)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DataDome stops cyberfraud and bots in real time, outpacing AI-driven fraud from simple to sophisticated across your sites, apps, and APIs. Named a Leader in the Forrester Wave for Bot Management, the DataDome platform is built on a multi-layered AI engine that focuses on intent, not just identity. Because it’s not about knowing who’s real, it’s about what they intend to do. With thousands of AI models that adapt to every fraudulent click, signup, and login, DataDome blocks fraud in less than 2 milliseconds, without compromising performance. DataDome is fully automated and integrates seamlessly into any tech stack. Backed by a 24/7 SOC team of advanced threat researchers, DataDome stops over 350 billion attacks annually. Experience protection that outperforms with DataDome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DataDome is an equal opportunity employer, and proud to be committed to diversity and inclusion. We will consider all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, nationality, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, disability or age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Présentation du poste :&lt;/strong&gt; Au sein de l’équipe Data Analytics d&#39;Artefact, vous rejoignez un pôle clé couvrant le dashboarding, l&#39;analytics engineering, la mesure marketing et le low-code data science. Dans un environnement à forte croissance, vous intervenez auprès de grands comptes pour transformer leurs enjeux business grâce à une collecte, un traitement et une visualisation de données performants.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce qu’on attend de vous :&lt;/strong&gt; En tant que profil Senior, vous garantissez l&#39;excellence technique et la qualité de la valeur livrée sur vos projets analytiques. Vous jouez un rôle de conseiller de confiance auprès des clients, tout en mentorant des profils plus juniors et en intégrant les derniers usages d&#39;IA Générative appliqués à l&#39;analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Piloter la livraison de projets Analytics de bout en bout : du cadrage des cas d&#39;usage avec les équipes métier jusqu&#39;au déploiement de dashboards, pipelines et produits data décisionnels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concevoir et implémenter des architectures analytiques scalables en appliquant les pratiques modernes d&#39;Analytics Engineering (modélisation de données, tests, qualité de code).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exploiter les développements récents en GenAI pour maximiser la valeur délivrée à nos clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extraire des insights stratégiques et les restituer de manière claire et actionnable pour accompagner la prise de décision des parties prenantes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agir en expert référent auprès des clients : construire une relation de confiance et apporter des recommandations sur les meilleures pratiques d&#39;analyse de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorer les Data Analysts juniors, partager les meilleures pratiques (ateliers, documentation) et participer à la création d&#39;accélérateurs internes et à la veille technologique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil recherché :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience &amp;amp; Mindset :&lt;/strong&gt; 3 ans ou plus d&#39;expérience concrète dans un environnement data-driven, avec autonomie, rigueur et curiosité intellectuelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domaines d&#39;expertise (au moins 1) :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dashboarding &amp;amp; Dataviz (Power BI, Looker, Tableau, Superset)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics Engineering (dbt sur BigQuery, Snowflake, Databricks)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing Analytics &amp;amp; Mesure (CDP, MMM, attribution, Clean Rooms)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-Code / No-Code Data Science (Dataiku, Copilot Studio)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Socle Technique :&lt;/strong&gt; Solide maîtrise de SQL et Python, bases en Git et principes d&#39;ingénierie logicielle (versioning, tests), ainsi qu&#39;une expérience sur les environnements Cloud (GCP, Azure, AWS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posture &amp;amp; Communication :&lt;/strong&gt; Capacité avérée à faire le pont entre équipes techniques et métier, accompagnement des profils juniors et communication claire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Call :&lt;/strong&gt; Échange initial sur votre parcours, vos motivations et l&#39;adéquation culturelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Interview :&lt;/strong&gt; Évaluation approfondie de votre socle technique (SQL, Python, Cloud) et de vos expertises Analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Interview :&lt;/strong&gt; Mise en situation sur la résolution de cas d&#39;usage business et la restitution analytique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fit Interview :&lt;/strong&gt; Échange final de projection opérationnelle et de fit culturel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération :&lt;/strong&gt; Package : 53 000 € à 63 000 € brut annuel (fixe) + 5 000 € de variable, selon expérience et séniorité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Présentation entreprise&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact est un cabinet de conseil spécialisé en data et en intelligence artificielle, qui accompagne les entreprises pour transformer ces technologies en impact business concret et mesurable. A la croisée du conseil, de la data et de la technologie, nos 2 500 collaborateurs dans 27 pays mettent leurs expertises en commun pour concevoir, développer et déployer des solutions qui répondent aux enjeux de transformation de nos clients. Envie d&#39;en savoir plus? Découvrez Artefact, nos expertises et notre culture : &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.artefact.com/?utm_source=gemini&quot;&gt;https://www.artefact.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous sommes convaincus que la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des perspectives fait la richesse de nos équipes. Nous nous engageons à offrir un environnement inclusif et des opportunités équitables, où chacune et chacun peut évoluer et exprimer pleinement son potentiel. Nos recrutements reposent sur les compétences, le potentiel et l&#39;adéquation avec le rôle.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;DigiCert is a global leader in intelligent trust. We protect the digital world by ensuring the security, privacy, and authenticity of every interaction. Our AI-powered DigiCert ONE platform unifies PKI, DNS, and certificate lifecycle management, to secure infrastructure, software, devices, messages, AI content and agents. Learn why more than 100,000 organizations, including 90% of the Fortune 500, choose DigiCert to stop today’s threats and prepare for a quantum-safe future at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.digicert.com/&quot;&gt;www.digicert.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Job summary&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Senior Solutions Engineer for DigiCert France, you will combine technical expertise with strong sales acumen to identify, qualify and close new business across a portfolio of customer and partner accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working alongside our France-based Account Managers, you will lead technical engagements, contribute to bids and tenders, and deliver tailored solutions throughout the sales cycle. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a trusted advisor, you will engage confidently with executives, both customers and internally, connecting technical solutions to business outcomes. You will also work closely with product teams and subject matter experts to align solutions with customer needs. Expected travel is approximately 20%.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will do&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Working in the Solutions Engineering team is an exciting blend of technology and sales, with real-world impact, diverse challenges and continuous learning. At DigiCert, we are evolving our Solutions Engineering team to the next level: not just engineering experts, but business value champions and advocates for our prospects and customers. You will be at the forefront of emerging trends like post-quantum cryptography, AI driven organizations, IoT security, zero trust architecture, and digital identity and automation.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your day to day will include:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Customer Engagement and Technical Discovery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Conduct technical discovery calls to understand customer requirements, pain points, and existing infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:30,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:30}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead or participate in product demonstrations, showing how solutions meet client-specific needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:30,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:30}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Translate complex customer requirements into actionable technical solutions or configurations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:30,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:30}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
