&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Pension and retirement benefits (location dependent)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life insurance and income protection coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness support, including medical coverage (where applicable), gym reimbursement, and mental wellbeing resources&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Employee Assistance Program with 24/7 confidential support for employees and their families&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Generous paid time off, including holidays and&amp;nbsp;additional&amp;nbsp;leave options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Family-friendly leave policies, including maternity, paternity, and other supportive leave programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Education&amp;nbsp;assistance&amp;nbsp;and professional development opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Access to LinkedIn Learning and continuous learning resources&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Employee referral bonus program and&amp;nbsp;additional&amp;nbsp;company&amp;nbsp;perks&amp;nbsp;and discounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Internal rewards and recognition platform (Motivosity) to celebrate and acknowledge project wins, milestone achievements, and the outstanding contributions of our colleagues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Business travel insurance and global employee support programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To protect candidate information and maintain a secure hiring process, all applications must be submitted through our careers portal. Resumes or CVs sent directly via email will not be reviewed or considered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-MG1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Underlined SCXW779494 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW779494 BCX0&quot;&gt;Compensation Transparency:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW779494 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The total on-target earnings (OTE) for this role, including base salary and variable incentive compensation&amp;nbsp;(at 100% target performance), are outlined below.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Each candidate’s compensation offer will be&amp;nbsp;determined&amp;nbsp;based on factors including experience, skills, qualifications, performance expectations, business needs, and location. Actual earnings may vary based on individual performance. This role may also be eligible for&amp;nbsp;additional&amp;nbsp;compensation and benefits, which will be discussed during the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are committed to fair and transparent pay practices and&amp;nbsp;comply with&amp;nbsp;all applicable pay transparency requirements. If you would like more information about compensation or benefits, we are happy to provide&amp;nbsp;additional&amp;nbsp;details during the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information&amp;nbsp;regarding&amp;nbsp;our comprehensive benefits,&amp;nbsp;see the benefits section.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;OTE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€110.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€130.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€77.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Incentive Compensation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€33.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€39.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1 class=&quot;first-token&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Corporate Operations is looking for a Software Integration Engineer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Within the Corporate Operations division of the Decathlon Group and the IT United network,&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt; the Corporate Operations team (100 teammates) designs,&lt;/span&gt; deploys, and ensures the performance of our digital solutions for Finance and Human Resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Our day-to-day mission:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;Optimize the daily operations of our Finance &amp;amp; HR teams (accounting close, procurement management, financial performance management, employee data flows, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;Accelerate digital transformation by pioneering tomorrow&#39;s technologies (automation, APIs, data-centric approaches, AI, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Your Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;As part of the major transformation of our HR and Finance ecosystems, we are looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;91&quot;&gt;Software Integration Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Your main mission will be to analyze, design, develop, and maintain complex interfaces and data flows between our existing systems (Legacy IT / ERP) and the Workday platform, while ensuring technical quality, security, and overall operability. As such, you will be the Owner of the integration layer across our HR and Finance ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;This role strikes a balance between operational maintenance (&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;61&quot;&gt;RUN&lt;/strong&gt;) and development projects (&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;92&quot;&gt;BUILD&lt;/strong&gt;), driven by a mindset of continuous improvement and user satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;As a technical subject matter expert, you will be the Owner of the technology exporting data from Workday to our internal IT landscape. You will design the architecture supplying all third-party systems consuming HR data, core reference data (Jobs, Organizations), payroll, as well as Workday Finance data via specialized integrations (PECI, WICI, and WQL orchestration).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Your key responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Assessment &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze the technical environment, identify custom development needs, and define the optimal integration strategy (high-level design, data flow mapping, IT architecture).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Design &amp;amp; Specifications:&lt;/strong&gt; Draft technical requirements, micro-detailed specifications, and design integration test suites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Development, Configuration &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee and execute integration developments or configurations, enforce core security principles (authorizations, encryption), conduct unit/integration testing, and validate compliance with functional requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deployment &amp;amp; Expert Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead data migrations, manage post-go-live Hypercare phases, structure technical documentation/runbooks, and provide Tier-3 expert support for recurring incidents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively partner with the Digital Product Manager, Workday (vendor), service centers, and cross-functional technical teams (Data Flows, Authorizations, Job Scheduling). You will be responsible for building complex reports (WQL) and owning a specific Workday functional domain (e.g., Compensation, Absence, Time Tracking) alongside dedicated functional teams. You will also play a pivotal role in knowledge sharing and creating integration playbooks to upskill the broader team on integration standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI Watch &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore artificial intelligence capabilities (Workday AI Agents, Workday Extend, and our internal AI platforms) to automate processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;Your Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Soft Skills &amp;amp; Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;You hold an Engineering degree or equivalent, backed by proven experience in integration engineering or technical product management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;You demonstrate strong leadership and the ability to organize, unite, and coordinate multidisciplinary stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analysis &amp;amp; Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Curious and accountable, you perform root-cause analysis to deliver sustainable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Translation:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in a team environment and know how to bridge the gap between technical and functional teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;English:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional working proficiency (B2 minimum), comfortable communicating in an international setting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,5,0&quot;&gt;You resonate with our commitment to positive impact (#Tech4Good).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Skills &amp;amp; Environment:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Data exchange technologies (REST/SOAP APIs, Middleware, ETL, flat files/XML/JSON), data flow architecture, and security/authorization principles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Preferred Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with Workday (EIB, Workday Studio, Core Connectors) and/or Legacy ERPs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Ecosystem Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; JD Edwards EnterpriseOne (Oracle ERP), OneStream, Jira, Confluence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Monitoring &amp;amp; Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Prometheus, Grafana, Datadog, Dynatrace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,0,0&quot;&gt;Hybrid working arrangement;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,1,0&quot;&gt;Hardware provided in line with your role and our sustainability commitments (Mac or Windows);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,2,0&quot;&gt;A local project team within a global network (international career opportunities);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,3,0&quot;&gt;Skill development and career support (diverse projects, internal and external training, etc.);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17,4,0&quot;&gt;Comprehensive compensation package (employee shareholding plan, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Inclusion and Accessibility&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams, and we continuously strive to foster and cultivate an inclusive and equitable workplace—which is why Inclusion is one of our Human Fundamentals. We encourage people of all backgrounds and abilities to apply, as we firmly believe that diverse perspectives, cultures, identities, and lived experiences make us stronger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Decathlon is also committed to providing an inclusive and accessible recruitment process for all candidates. If you require any accommodations, you may submit a confidential request via the application form. Such requests will have no bearing on the outcome of the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing Manager – In-Store - f/m/d&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Lille or Paris&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Decathlon Digital, we are building the world&#39;s biggest digital sports platform. Within the &lt;strong&gt;In-Store domain&lt;/strong&gt;, our mission is to digitize and enable the elevation of the physical retail experience across our thousands of stores worldwide. We build the digital tools that empower our store teammates and provide a seamless, frictionless omnichannel journey for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt; with a strong Go-To-Market focus to maximize the business and operational impact of our in-store digital solutions. Your flagship challenge will be orchestrating the global rollout of our &lt;strong&gt;next-generation checkout system&lt;/strong&gt;, a highly strategic transformation aimed at reducing friction, empowering teammates, and bridging the gap between digital and physical commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Go-To-Market (GTM):&lt;/strong&gt; Plan, orchestrate, and fully own the global launch strategies for critical in-store solutions (especially the new checkout system). You will design scalable GTM playbooks to ensure smooth deployment and high adoption across all geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge product &amp;amp; retail operations (Enablement):&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the ultimate facilitator between central digital teams and local store operations. You will simplify complex technical changes, build educational frameworks, and empower our retail leaders to drive sustainable adoption on the shop floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feed the roadmap with insights:&lt;/strong&gt; centralize feedback from store teammates and customers. You will deliver actionable market and user insights (e.g., checkout friction analysis, retail tech benchmarks) to the Product teams to ensure our solutions perfectly match the physical retail reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure &amp;amp; optimize:&lt;/strong&gt; participate in the&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tracking of the operational impact of new in-store features (e.g., checkout time reduction, teammate satisfaction), gather field feedback, and ensure continuous iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM &amp;amp; PMM Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; proven experience in executing complex, high-impact Go-to-Market strategies, ideally for physical retail, omnichannel, or point-of-sale (POS) environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail affinity:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a deep understanding of physical retail dynamics and the specific challenges faced by store teammates and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence &amp;amp; pedagogy:&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at aligning Product, Business, and Retail Operations teams, turning technical complexity into clear, actionable pedagogy for the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; analytical mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to turn operational KPIs and in-store feedback into concrete product recommendations and activation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent English is mandatory for this international role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work organization in our Lille or Paris tech hubs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-impact role at the heart of Decathlon’s omnichannel transformation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equipment provided (Mac or Windows) in line with our societal commitments;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and development (technical certifications, internal training);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remuneration package (employee profit-sharing, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our commitment to inclusion and accessibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams. We encourage people of all backgrounds and abilities to apply. Selection process adjustments can be requested confidentially via the application form.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La Corporate Operations recherche un·e Software Integration Engineer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de la direction &lt;strong&gt;Corporate Operations&lt;/strong&gt; du groupe Decathlon et du réseau IT United, l’équipe &lt;strong&gt;Corporate Operations&lt;/strong&gt; (100 coéquipier·ères) conçoit, déploie et garantit la performance de nos solutions digitales pour la Finance et la Ressource Humaine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre mission au quotidien :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimiser le quotidien de nos équipes Finance &amp;amp; RH (clôture comptable, gestion des achats, pilotage économique, flux de données collaborateurs, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accélérer la transformation digitale en faisant émerger les technologies de demain (automatisation, API, approche data-centric, IA, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton Rôle &amp;amp; tes Missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans le cadre de la transformation majeure de nos écosystèmes RH et Financier, nous recherchons un·e &lt;strong&gt;Software Integration Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Ta mission principale sera d&#39;analyser, concevoir, développer et maintenir les interfaces et flux de données complexes entre notre système existant (SI Legacy / ERP) et la plateforme &lt;strong&gt;Workday&lt;/strong&gt;, tout en garantissant la qualité technique, la sécurité et l&#39;exploitabilité globale. Tu seras ainsi le/la garant·e (Owner) de la couche d&#39;intégration de notre écosystème RH et Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le rôle équilibre une dimension de maintien en conditions opérationnelles (&lt;strong&gt;RUN&lt;/strong&gt;) et de projets d&#39;évolutions (&lt;strong&gt;BUILD&lt;/strong&gt;), dans une démarche constante d’amélioration continue et de satisfaction utilisateurs.&lt;br&gt;En tant que référent·e technique, tu seras le/la « Owner » de la technologie qui exporte les données de Workday vers le SI interne. Tu concevras l&#39;architecture permettant d&#39;alimenter tous les systèmes tiers qui consomment les données RH, les référentiels (Jobs, Organisations), la paie, ainsi que les données de Workday Finance via des intégrations spécifiques (PECI, WICI, et l&#39;orchestration WQL).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes responsabilités clés :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Étude &amp;amp; Stratégie Technique :&lt;/strong&gt; Analyser l&#39;environnement technique, identifier les besoins de développements spécifiques et définir la stratégie d&#39;intégration la plus adaptée (macro-design, cartographie des flux, urbanisation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conception &amp;amp; Spécifications :&lt;/strong&gt; Rédiger les cahiers des charges techniques, les spécifications micro-détaillées et concevoir les jeux de tests d&#39;intégration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement, Paramétrage &amp;amp; Qualité :&lt;/strong&gt; Suivre et réaliser les développements ou paramétrages des flux, appliquer les principes clés de sécurité (autorisations, chiffrement), réaliser les tests unitaires/d&#39;intégration et valider la conformité aux exigences fonctionnelles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Déploiement &amp;amp; Support Expert :&lt;/strong&gt; Piloter les migrations, assurer la phase d&#39;HyperCare post-mise en production, structurer la documentation technique/books d&#39;exploitation et intervenir en support de niveau expert sur les incidents récurrents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Animation :&lt;/strong&gt; Interagir activement avec le Digital Product Manager, l&#39;éditeur Workday, les centres de services et les équipes techniques transverses (Flux, Autorisations, Ordonnancement). Tu seras responsable de la création de reportings complexes (WQL) et auras la charge d&#39;un périmètre fonctionnel Workday (ex. : Rémunération, Absence, Time Tracking) avec l’appui des équipes fonctionnelles chargées de la thématique. Tu auras aussi un rôle clé en matière de partage de connaissances et de création de playbooks d&#39;intégration pour faire monter en compétence le reste de l&#39;équipe sur les standards d&#39;intégration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veille IA &amp;amp; Automatisation :&lt;/strong&gt; Explorer les capacités d&#39;intelligence artificielle (Workday AI Agents, WD Extend, et nos plateformes internes IA) pour automatiser les processus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences Humaines &amp;amp; Posture (Savoir-être) :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu possèdes &lt;strong&gt;une formation d&#39;ingénieur·e ou équivalent, avec une expérience réussie &lt;/strong&gt;en ingénierie d&#39;intégration ou gestion de produit technique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu fais preuve de &lt;strong&gt;leadership et as la capacité d&#39;organiser, fédérer et animer &lt;/strong&gt;des parties prenantes pluridisciplinaires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse &amp;amp; Résolution de problèmes : &lt;strong&gt;Curieux·se et responsable&lt;/strong&gt;, tu analyses les problématiques à la racine pour proposer des solutions durables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Vulgarisation : &lt;strong&gt;Tu aimes le travail en équipe et sais faire le pont entre les équipes techniques et fonctionnelles.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anglais : Niveau professionnel (B2 minimum), à l&#39;aise pour échanger dans un contexte international.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu te reconnais dans notre engagement à impact positif (#Tech4Good).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences Techniques &amp;amp; Environnement :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connaissances clés :&lt;/strong&gt; Technologies d&#39;échange de données (API REST/SOAP, Middleware, ETL, fichiers plat/XML/JSON), architecture de flux et principes de sécurité/autorisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience appréciée :&lt;/strong&gt; Connaissance de Workday (outils d&#39;intégration EIB, Studio, Core Connector) et/ou d&#39;ERP Legacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outils de l&#39;écosystème :&lt;/strong&gt; Jd Edwards EnterpriseOne (ERP Oracle), OneStream, JIRA, Confluence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supervision &amp;amp; Monitoring :&lt;/strong&gt; Prometheus, Grafana, Datadog, Dynatrace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Package de rémunération (actionnariat salarié, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L&#39;INCLUSION ET DE L&#39;ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tenstorrent is leading the industry on cutting-edge AI technology, revolutionizing performance expectations, ease of use, and cost efficiency. With AI redefining the computing paradigm, solutions must evolve to unify innovations in software models, compilers, platforms, networking, and semiconductors. Our diverse team of technologists have developed a high performance RISC-V CPU from scratch, and share a passion for AI and a deep desire to build the best AI platform possible. We value collaboration, curiosity, and a commitment to solving hard problems. We are growing our team and looking for contributors of all seniorities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Our Tensix team is building custom AI compute cores, RISC-V CPUs, and chiplet-based architectures for datacenter, edge, and automotive AI. Design Verification Engineers on this team validate compute IP and subsystems and build scalable DV infrastructure to keep verification fast, automated, and production-grade.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot;&gt;This role is hybrid, based out of Toronto, ON, Austin, TX or Belgrade, Serbia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot;&gt;We welcome candidates at various experience levels for this role. During the interview process, candidates will be assessed for the appropriate level, and offers will align with that level, which may differ from the one in this posting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in modern verification methodologies with strong SystemVerilog skills and exposure to structured testbench development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working from block-level to system-level verification and reasoning about microarchitecture behavior from specs and waveforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Linux environments with Python, or Bash scripting for automate builds, parse logs, manage CI pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in coverage-driven verification and confident debugging across RTL, testbench, and workload scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated by AI hardware and eager to learn verification strategies for new architectures and domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;1&quot; data-border-radius-top-cap=&quot;0&quot; data-border-radius-bottom-cap=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to verification of Tensix IP and subsystems from early planning through tape-out, owning coverage goals and driving them to closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reusable verification environments, agents, scoreboards, and supporting infrastructure in SystemVerilog and Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop constrained-random and directed tests and close functional, code, and assertion coverage using data-driven approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug complex issues across RTL and testbench while collaborating with design, firmware, compiler, and architecture teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evolve DV infrastructure including regression flows, CI/CD integration, EDA compute environments, and reproducible setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Exposure to functional safety (FuSa) verification concepts for automotive AI workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Familiarity with formal verification methodologies, SVA (SystemVerilog Assertions), or formal property verification for complex control logic and microarchitectural corner cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;1&quot; data-border-radius-top-cap=&quot;0&quot; data-border-radius-bottom-cap=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How Tenstorrent verifies AI-native compute architectures including Tensix cores, RISC-V CPUs, matrix units, vector units, and datapath.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How simulation, emulation, and software-driven workloads combine to validate both functional correctness and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How numerical precision formats such as BF16, FP4, and INT8 and on-chip dataflow impact verification complexity and coverage strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to build scalable DV infrastructure across hybrid compute environments including containerized regression systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How data analytics and modern AI tooling can enhance verification workflows and accelerate convergence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Compensation for all engineers at Tenstorrent ranges from $100k - $500k including base and variable compensation targets. Experience, skills, education, background and location all impact the actual offer made.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tenstorrent offers a highly competitive compensation package and benefits, and we are an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This offer of employment is contingent upon the applicant being eligible to access U.S. export-controlled technology. &amp;nbsp;Due to U.S. export laws, including those codified in the U.S. Export Administration Regulations (EAR), the Company is required to ensure compliance with these laws when transferring technology to nationals of certain countries (such as EAR Country Groups D:1, E1, and E2). &amp;nbsp; These requirements apply to persons located in the U.S. and all countries outside the U.S. &amp;nbsp;As the position offered will have direct and/or indirect access to information, systems, or technologies subject to these laws, the offer may be contingent upon your citizenship/permanent residency status or ability to obtain prior license approval from the U.S. Commerce Department or applicable federal agency. &amp;nbsp;If employment is not possible due to U.S. export laws, any offer of employment will be rescinded.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗠𝗮𝗸𝗲𝘀 𝗖𝗹𝗼𝘂𝗱𝗯𝗲𝗱𝘀 𝗨𝗻𝗶𝗾𝘂𝗲&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cloudbeds.com/&quot;&gt;Cloudbeds&lt;/a&gt;, we&#39;re not just building software, we&#39;re transforming hospitality. Our platform powers hotels across 150 countries, processing billions in bookings annually. From boutique properties to large hotel groups, we help hoteliers transform operations and uplevel their commercial strategy through a unified platform that integrates with hundreds of partners. And we do it with a completely remote team. Imagine working alongside global innovators to build AI-powered solutions that solve hoteliers&#39; biggest challenges. Since our founding in 2012, we&#39;ve continually been recognized for excellence, most recently earning top honors at the 2026 HotelTechAwards for Best Hotel Management Software and landing on Deloitte&#39;s Technology Fast 500 again, but we&#39;re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;𝗟𝗼𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Remote (Europe)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗠𝗮𝗸𝗲𝘀 𝗨𝘀 𝗨𝗻𝗶𝗾𝘂𝗲:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cloudbeds, we&#39;re not just building software, we’re transforming hospitality. Our intelligently designed platform powers properties across 150 countries, processing billions in bookings annually. From independent properties to hotel groups, we help hoteliers transform operations and uplevel their commercial strategy through a unified platform that integrates with hundreds of partners. And we do it with a completely remote team. Imagine working alongside global innovators to build AI-powered solutions that solve hoteliers&#39; biggest challenges. Since our founding in 2012, we&#39;ve become the World&#39;s Best Hotel PMS Solutions Provider and landed on Deloitte&#39;s Technology Fast 500 again in 2024 – but we&#39;re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗛𝗼𝘄 𝗬𝗼𝘂&#39;𝗹𝗹 𝗠𝗮𝗸𝗲 𝗮𝗻 𝗜𝗺𝗽𝗮𝗰𝘁:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a 𝗦𝘁𝗮𝗳𝗳 𝗦𝗼𝗳𝘁𝘄𝗮𝗿𝗲 𝗘𝗻𝗴𝗶𝗻𝗲𝗲𝗿 in Revenue Intelligence, you will shape the technical direction of systems that help hospitality businesses understand demand, identify revenue opportunities, and make better pricing and commercial decisions. You will work across customer-facing applications, backend services, data pipelines, analytical stores, recommendation workflows, and cloud infrastructure. This is a hands-on leadership role: you will solve complex engineering problems directly while establishing architecture, improving reliability and security, reducing systemic technical debt, and aligning multiple teams around durable technical decisions. Your impact will extend beyond individual features to the quality, scalability, operability, and long-term evolution of the Revenue Intelligence platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗢𝘂𝗿 𝗥𝗲𝘃𝗲𝗻𝘂𝗲 𝗜𝗻𝘁𝗲𝗹𝗹𝗶𝗴𝗲𝗻𝗰𝗲 𝗧𝗲𝗮𝗺:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Revenue Intelligence team builds products and platforms that turn hospitality data into practical decisions for hoteliers, including pricing recommendations, demand insights, reporting, automation, and commercial opportunities. Our systems span frontend experiences, APIs, distributed services, data processing, machine-learning workflows, and production infrastructure. We value pragmatic engineering, strong ownership, evidence-based decisions, and technical leaders who raise the effectiveness of the people and systems around them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗬𝗼𝘂 𝗕𝗿𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝘁𝗼 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗧𝗲𝗮𝗺:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and evolve the technical strategy for RMS, translating product and business goals into coherent architecture and executable engineering plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and delivery of complex capabilities across customer-facing web applications, backend APIs, event-driven services, data pipelines, analytical storage, and recommendation workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve systemic risks in scalability, reliability, security, data quality, observability, and operability before they become recurring customer or engineering problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive modernization of legacy systems and infrastructure through incremental, well-reasoned migrations that preserve delivery momentum and production stability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Data Science, Infrastructure, Security, and engineering leaders to define boundaries, contracts, ownership, and long-term platform direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the codebase through implementation, technical spikes, design reviews, debugging, incident response, and the most consequential or ambiguous engineering work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the technical effectiveness of the wider organization through mentoring, architecture guidance, engineering standards, documentation, and constructive challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗦𝗲𝘁𝘀 𝗬𝗼𝘂 𝗨𝗽 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗦𝘂𝗰𝗰𝗲𝘀𝘀:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience, including significant technical leadership across complex production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on expertise with backend and data engineering technologies. Our stack includes .NET/C#, Python, PostgreSQL, Redshift, Kafka/Debezium, Airflow, gRPC, AWS (EKS, S3, SQS, Batch), Terraform, Helm/Argo CD, and Datadog, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architecture and distributed-systems fundamentals, including API design, event-driven workflows, CDC and streaming, data archiving, and batch compute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep PostgreSQL experience at scale, including performance tuning, partitioning, and large online migrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of rebuilding production data syncs and pipelines incrementally, keeping them idempotent, reconciled, and running throughout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cloud and platform engineering experience across AWS, Kubernetes, Terraform, CI/CD, observability, and secure production operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated ability to lead through influence, create alignment across teams, communicate complex tradeoffs clearly, and drive decisions from ambiguity to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong record of improving engineering quality through testing strategy, operational readiness, incident learning, security, documentation, and sustainable technical standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product judgment and customer empathy, with the ability to connect technical investments to measurable outcomes for hoteliers and the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level English fluency and experience collaborating effectively in a remote, globally distributed organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-IK1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗼𝗿𝗸 𝗔𝘂𝘁𝗵𝗼𝗿𝗶𝘇𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻: Please note that applicants must be currently authorized to work in the location where the position is located without requiring visa sponsorship. At this time, Cloudbeds is unable to provide sponsorship for work visas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝘁𝗼 𝗘𝘅𝗽𝗲𝗰𝘁 - 𝗬𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗝𝗼𝘂𝗿𝗻𝗲𝘆 𝘄𝗶𝘁𝗵 𝗨𝘀&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behind Cloudbeds&#39; revolutionary technology is a team redefining what&#39;s possible in hospitality. We&#39;re 650+ team members across 40+ countries, bringing together elite engineers, AI architects, world-class designers, hoteliers, and hospitality veterans to solve challenges others haven&#39;t dared to tackle. Our diverse team speaks 30+ languages, but we all share one language: a passion for innovation and travel. From pioneering breakthroughs in machine learning to revolutionizing how hotels operate, we&#39;re not just watching the future of hospitality unfold – we&#39;re coding it, designing it, writing it, and shipping it. If you&#39;re ready to work alongside some of the brightest minds in tech who are obsessed with using AI to transform a trillion-dollar industry, this is your chance to be part of something extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more online at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cloudbeds.com/&quot;&gt;cloudbeds.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗖𝗹𝗼𝘂𝗱𝗯𝗲𝗱𝘀 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cloudbeds.com/press/?press_type=company-news&amp;amp;news_category=awards&quot;&gt;𝗔𝘄𝗮𝗿𝗱𝘀&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Winner – Hotel Management Software | HotelTechAwards (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overall 10 Best Places to Work | HotelTechAwards (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overall Top 10 Hotelier&#39;s Choice | HotelTechAwards (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finalist – Property Management Systems (PMS) &amp;amp; Channel Managers | HotelTechAwards (2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Most Loved Workplace® Certified (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deloitte Technology Fast 500 (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗗𝗶𝘀𝗰𝗼𝘃𝗲𝗿 𝗼𝘂𝗿 𝗕𝗲𝗻𝗲𝗳𝗶𝘁𝘀:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote First, Remote Always&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PTO in accordance with local labor requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office stipend based on country of residency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development courses in Cloudbeds University&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to professional development, including manager training, upskilling, and knowledge transfer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;𝗘𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘆𝗼𝗻𝗲 𝗶𝘀 𝗪𝗲𝗹𝗰𝗼𝗺𝗲 - 𝗔 𝗖𝘂𝗹𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲 𝗼𝗳 𝗜𝗻𝗰𝗹𝘂𝘀𝗶𝗼𝗻&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudbeds is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer that celebrates the diversity in our global team! We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudbeds is committed to the full inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, Cloudbeds will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations in the hiring process. We encourage deaf, hard-of-hearing, deaf-blind, and deaf-disabled individuals to apply. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process or to perform essential job functions, please contact our HR team by phone at (858) 201-7832 or via email at &lt;a ---------- Cloudbeds will provide an American Sign Language (ASL) interpreter where needed as a reasonable accommodation for the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To all Staffing and Recruiting Agencies: Our Careers Site is only for individuals seeking a job at Cloudbeds. Staffing, recruiting agencies, and individuals being represented by an agency are not authorized to use this site or to submit applications, and any such submissions will be considered unsolicited. Cloudbeds does not accept unsolicited resumes or applications from agencies. Please do not forward resumes to our jobs alias, Cloudbeds employees, or any other company location. Cloudbeds is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes/applications.&lt;/p&gt;
