&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a data and AI services company with around 2,500 people across 36 offices. We are part of Anthropic&#39;s Claude Partner Network and have rolled out Claude across our own organization, so our advice to clients comes from running it ourselves first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DeployCo is Artefact&#39;s team dedicated to deploying Claude at scale inside enterprises. It works through three levers. Deployment and adoption gets organizations from a few early adopters to company-wide use. Process reimagination redesigns core workflows around agentic AI. Agent production ships working agents into client systems. Forward Deployed Engineers are the builders behind the third lever and the technical backbone of the other two.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an FDE you join a client&#39;s own AI or engineering team as a builder, not an advisor. You design, code, and ship production-grade Claude solutions directly inside their stack, following their conventions, repositories, and CI. You also leave the capability behind, so that when the engagement ends the client&#39;s engineers can extend and maintain what was built without us.&lt;br&gt;The work ranges from short, intense engagements, like standing up a governed Claude Code deployment in a few weeks, to longer embeds where you become the technical anchor of a multi-agent portfolio and a larger Artefact pod grows around you. This is a senior role, and we expect you to own technical direction on an engagement from the first week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build production agents. Design and deploy Claude-based agents and workflows that run in production, with the engineering standards that implies. That means tests, error handling, monitoring, and cost control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect Claude to enterprise systems. Build custom MCP servers and connectors to business applications and data sources, enforcing the client&#39;s own access rules. This includes permissions, traceability, and segregation of rights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineer the context layer. Contribute to Artefact&#39;s context platform approach, including deterministic authentication before data reaches the model, user-level context injection, and observability for token spend and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and govern Claude Code. Set up SSO and role-based access, managed settings, approved MCP servers and plugin marketplaces, permission modes, sandboxing, and OpenTelemetry-based usage monitoring. Help clients choose between deployment options (Team, Enterprise, cloud providers, gateways) based on security, data residency, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable skills. Turn client workflows into Claude Skills and shared skills libraries that teams can find, reuse, and build on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable client engineers. Pair program, review code, document patterns, and deliver hands-on Claude Code training and labs, sometimes to cohorts of dozens of developers and sometimes to CTOs and engineering leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed the product loop. Capture deployment pitfalls and product feedback from the field and share it with Anthropic through our partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior-level experience in software engineering or data science, with production systems you have shipped and operated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recent, hands-on work with the GenAI stack, going beyond prototypes. This includes tool use, agent design, retrieval, evaluation, and prompt and context engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated depth with Claude in particular, such as Claude Code, the Claude API, Skills, or MCP, and a point of view on how the stack is evolving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python or TypeScript, and solid grounding in enterprise integration, including APIs, identity and access management (SSO, OAuth, SCIM), and cloud platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence in client-facing settings, explaining technical trade-offs to engineers and to non-technical stakeholders, and running a workshop when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anthropic certification (Claude Certified Developer or Architect) is welcome but not expected, since it is usually only available through a partner company. We support you in earning it once you join.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and securing MCP servers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in security, observability (OpenTelemetry), or FinOps for AI workloads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated industries such as banking, asset management, or pharma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of teaching or technical training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct work with Anthropic&#39;s partner and applied AI teams, including co-delivered labs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Varied, high-impact engagements across EMEA in finance, retail, industry, and consumer goods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear path from FDE to technical anchor of a full AI delivery pod&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certification support and dedicated learning time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet all the criteria! &lt;/strong&gt;At Artefact, we value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else.If you are excited about shaping the future of AI and ready to make a real impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at Artefact &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;gt; We believe that unique perspectives fuel innovation. At Artefact, we are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive. We welcome and consider all applications purely based on merit, skills, and potential - regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, religion, age, background, or disability. Come as you are!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the next step? &lt;/strong&gt;Please submit your CV showcasing your experience and passion for this role as a Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) - Anthropic (m/f/d). We look forward to receiving your application!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you have any questions, feel free to send us a message at -----<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Warsaw, Berlin or Vienna&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Kubernetes, Terraform/OpenTofu, Helm, Kyverno/OPA, GitHub Actions, Cloud IAM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; B2B (Poland), Full-Time (Vienna or Berlin)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🚀&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Join fiskaly! Help Us Build Trust in Compliance &amp;amp; Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our squads ship fast, with AI-assisted tooling, on a regulated fiscalization platform that customers trust with their compliance. We want security to keep pace with that speed, not stand in front of it. We are looking for a Senior Security Engineer (Application &amp;amp; Platform Security) to be our founding security engineer in a company of about 150 people. This is a builder&#39;s role: you will write the controls that make the secure path the fast path, then prove they work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💼&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;As a Senior individual contributor, you will own the secure baseline for cloud, Kubernetes and application delivery, and you will express it as code rather than documents. You will bring threat modelling into squad design reviews, buy and steer external testing, and act as our named security incident commander. You will work closely with Compliance by supplying the technical facts they need, while the regulatory relationship stays with them. You will have read access to all repositories and staging environments, with break-glass production access under audit. You will have no direct reports; you will influence through standards, coaching and well-argued written advice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🛠️&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Baseline as Code:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and maintain the secure baseline for cloud, Kubernetes and application delivery as policy-as-code and archetype defaults, so squads inherit the control instead of waiting for a review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Threat Modelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Run threat modelling inside squad design reviews for changes that touch data flows, authentication, authorisation or cryptography.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Own assurance end to end: scope external tests, triage findings, drive remediation to a verified fix and run the retest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Command:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as named security incident commander. Maintain the severity model and runbook, coordinate response, preserve evidence and supply the facts for Compliance&#39;s notification decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Assisted Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate our AI-assisted security testing programme: run it, score it, tune it, and decide when it is not worth the triage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champions &amp;amp; Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Re-charter and run the security champions guild, and turn recurring squad friction into platform improvements together with Foundational Infrastructure, Observability, Compliance and Delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Data Review:&lt;/strong&gt; Review external vendor changes that would put customer data in a new place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure &amp;amp; Publish:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the security metrics, including publishing the function&#39;s own misses, and measure the friction security adds to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;✨&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Controls Shipped as Code:&lt;/strong&gt; You have shipped security controls as code (policy, CI checks, IaC guardrails), not only advised on them. You have hands-on experience with Kyverno or OPA and with GitHub Actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Security Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong grounding in threat modelling, authentication, authorisation, cryptography misuse and injection classes, plus data classification and redaction design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Kubernetes Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; You read Terraform/OpenTofu, Kubernetes manifests and Helm without assistance, and you know cloud IAM and Kubernetes security boundaries well enough to write a baseline engineers can actually implement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pentest Ownership as the Client:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience scoping and running penetration tests from the buying side: writing the scope, judging the report and driving remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First-Security-Hire Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have been the first or only security person somewhere, ideally in a regulated or otherwise high-trust environment, and you can describe what you deliberately did not do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Enough familiarity with the German regulatory landscape to sit in a BSI / KassenSichV conversation without owning the programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; You use AI tooling for drafting, triage and policy generation with review discipline, and you can say where it fails. You understand AI-specific attack surface: prompt injection against agents that read code, agent credential scope and model supply chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Writing &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; You write more than you talk, and prefer a one-page decision note to a 20-slide deck. You bring a proposed control with an adoption plan and a cost, never a mandate. You are comfortable saying &quot;that is advice, not a veto&quot;, and you build relationships with squad engineers before asking them to change anything.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💡&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;High-Impact Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Administrative authority over cloud landing zones, network devices, bare-metal hosts, and core routing services to shape the foundation of our platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A Culture of Engineering Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; An environment that values clean topology modeling, resilient routing, and automation over manual configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; A highly collaborative setup working alongside Platform Engineering and product squads to deliver secure, foundational capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Opportunities to lead massive infrastructure projects and migrations with high visibility and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proactive Over Reactive Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; A focus on scaling architecture and capacity proactively, ensuring the network remains stable without constant firefighting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Modern tooling, structured operational readiness checks, and a strong culture of autonomy and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🌍&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Why fiskaly?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not just building tech,&amp;nbsp; we’re shaping the future of digital compliance. At fiskaly, we believe in trust, shared vision, and celebrating success together. If you want to grow your career where security meets innovation, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

