&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will be reporting to the VP Media Relations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated and skilled &lt;strong&gt;Senior Media and Communications Officer (All Genders)&lt;/strong&gt; to support our growing communications team. Based in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;, the successful candidate will play a key role in building the company’s reputation across Germany and internationally, with a particular focus on media relations, content development, and strategic messaging.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and implement media strategies that support the company’s objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proactively pitch stories and manage relationships with German and international media outlets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Draft press releases, op-eds, briefings, Q&amp;amp;As, and reactive statements in both English and German&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Monitor media coverage and provide regular analysis and insight to internal stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Support the delivery of major announcements, media events, and leadership engagements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure message consistency across all external communications, including alignment with corporate narrative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work with other internal teams to develop content that showcases the company’s technology, partnerships, and impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Act as a key point of contact for media enquiries&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Minimum of 3+ years’ experience in communications, journalism, or media relations, preferably within the defence or security sectors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of the media landscape in Germany and Europe, with a proven track record of securing coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in both German and English (native-level fluency in at least one)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience managing sensitive and high-stakes media moments, including crisis communications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Confident working with senior executives and external stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Able to translate complex technical topics into clear, compelling messaging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Highly organised, proactive, and able to manage multiple priorities under pressure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Central Systems Engineering and&amp;nbsp;Processes, Methods, and Tools (PMT)&amp;nbsp;team establishes the overarching systems engineering framework, technical guidelines, requirements guidance, and software toolchains used by project-specific engineering teams. We act as the central entity for standardization, ensuring all project-specific teams have the tools and methodologies required for efficient, compliant development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As the PMT Architect, you will be the lead architect driving the definition, governance, and rollout of our centralized&amp;nbsp;Processes, Methods, and Tools (PMT)&amp;nbsp;framework. You will design the foundational engineering lifecycle, integrate cutting-edge software toolchains, and standardize global engineering practices. In this role, you will bridge central methodology with execution, providing direct technical, process, and PLM guidance to embedded project teams and Configuration Managers across all active programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Process Architecture: Define and evolve end-to-end V-model development lifecycles to ensure consistency and compliance across all programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Engineering Methods: Establish scalable organizational guidelines and standard practices, incorporating Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Toolchain Integration: Drive the integration, optimization, and governance of multi-disciplinary engineering software tools (3DEXPERIENCE, JAMA…) across the product development lifecycle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;PLM &amp;amp; Configuration Support: Act as the central PLT expert (e.g., 3DEXPERIENCE) and technical anchor for project-embedded Configuration Managers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Enablement &amp;amp; Adoption: Partner with project leads to ensure smooth deployment, adoption, and daily operation of central engineering standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Degree in Aerospace Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Systems Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At least 3–5 years of experience in a Systems Engineering, PMT, or Engineering Toolchain role within complex product development environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience working within the V-Model product development lifecycle and MBSE methodologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong working knowledge of enterprise PLM platforms (such as 3DEXPERIENCE / 3Dx) specifically for defining and managing end-to-end product specifications and configuration workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to translate central technical guidance into actionable operational practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Are collaborative, problem-solver, and a confident communicator capable of driving consensus among diverse teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;WPP steht für kreative Transformation. Mit der Kraft von Kreativität gestalten wir eine bessere Zukunft für unsere Mitarbeitenden, unsere Kunden, unsere Gemeinschaften und unseren Planeten. Genau hier setzt WPP Media an: Als globales Mediennetzwerk von WPP vereinen wir die besten Plattformen, Talente und Partner, um in einer vernetzten Medienwelt neue Chancen für grenzenloses Wachstum zu schaffen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Mit unseren flexiblen Arbeitszeiten &amp;amp; Remote Work gestaltest du deinen Alltag so, wie er zu dir passt. Außerdem kannst du Überstunden ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 30 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;section&gt;Als &lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager Programmatic (Mensch) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;bist du sowohl für die strategische Entwicklung der Programmatic-Aktivitäten sowie die operative Umsetzung dessen für unsere Kund:innen verantwortlich. Du agierst mit deinem Team als Sprachrohr, um programmatische Standards und Guidelines innerhalb der Agentur zu prägen.&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategie:&lt;/strong&gt; Strategisch evaluierst du gemeinsam mit unseren Kund:innen, welche Innovationen und Technologien ihren programmatischen Einkauf am gewinnbringendsten gestalten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zahlenverständnis:&lt;/strong&gt; Mit deinem ausgeprägten Zahlenverständnis entwickelst du den programmatischen Mediaeinkauf kontinuierlich weiter, um gesetzte Ziele und Media-KPIs nicht nur zu erreichen, sondern auch zu übertreffen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kampagnenmanagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Die präzise Umsetzung der zuvor entwickelten Kampagnen-Strukturen und Cases in den verschiedenen DSPs und zugehörigen Technologien fällt in deinen Verantwortungsbereich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Netzwerken:&lt;/strong&gt; Du pflegst eine enge und produktive Zusammenarbeit mit internen Spezialisten-Teams und externen Partnern in einem dynamischen, internationalen Umfeld.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entwicklung:&lt;/strong&gt; Kund:innen berätst du strategisch zu den entscheidenden Vorteilen des programmatischen Einkaufs für ihre Gesamtstrategie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifikation:&lt;/strong&gt; Ein abgeschlossener Hochschulabschluss sowie mind. 3 Jahre nachweisliche Expertise in der operativen Steuerung oder strategischen Beratung programmatischer Kampagnen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Du hast ein Profundes Verständnis der digitalen Media-Landschaft, inklusive DSPs, Datenmanagement-Plattformen, Inventare und Verifikationstechnologien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Neugierde &amp;amp; Lernbereitschaft:&lt;/strong&gt; Stehen zu bleiben ist für dich keine Option! Daher bringst du auch die Ambition mit, dich immer weiterzuentwickeln, damit auch Team Mitglieder, Kund:innen &amp;amp; co. von deinem Fachwissen profitieren können.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Datenaufbereitung:&lt;/strong&gt; Durch deinen präzisen und strukturierten Blick auf Daten in Excel und PowerPoint, kannst du komplexe Sachverhalte klar und strategisch sowie verständlich vermitteln.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprachkenntnisse:&lt;/strong&gt; Die Kommunikation auf deutsch und englisch beherrst du in Wort und Schrift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du:&lt;strong&gt; #teamplayer #kommunikativ #lösungsorientiert&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;WPP steht für kreative Transformation. Mit der Kraft von Kreativität gestalten wir eine bessere Zukunft für unsere Mitarbeitenden, unsere Kunden, unsere Gemeinschaften und unseren Planeten. Genau hier setzt WPP Media an: Als globales Mediennetzwerk von WPP vereinen wir die besten Plattformen, Talente und Partner, um in einer vernetzten Medienwelt neue Chancen für grenzenloses Wachstum zu schaffen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-Life-Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Dank flexibler Arbeitszeiten mit Schwerpunkt auf dem persönlichen Austausch im Office und ergänzender Remote Work passt sich dein Job deinem Leben an. Überstunden kannst du flexible ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 30 Urlaubstage plus einen flexiblen Tag – zusätzlich sind der 24. und 31.12. frei.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen, attraktive Altersvorsorge sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellen deine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen und nutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights wie das Job Ticket, Wellhub oder das Job Bike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Creative Strategist mit Fokus Influencer &amp;amp; Organic Social&lt;/strong&gt; bist du unser kreativer Kopf und strategischer Impulsgeber. Du übernimmst die inhaltliche Führung bei der Entwicklung von Creator-getriebenen Konzepten &amp;amp; Strategien&lt;br&gt;Deine Mission:&lt;strong&gt; Kreative Exzellenz mit Influencer- &amp;amp; Social-DNA!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synergie aus Influence &amp;amp; Media: Dein Fokus liegt auf der Entwicklung kulturell relevanter Kampagnen und Plattform-Konzepte. Du verbindest packendes Creator-Storytelling mit strategischer Mediaplanung und stehst im engen Austausch mit deinen Kolleg:innen aus der Media und dem Influencer Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Konzeption &amp;amp; Strategie: Von der ersten Trend-Idee über das Creator-Briefing bis hin zum fertigen Organic-Social-Format – du übernimmst die konzeptionelle und strategische Führung deiner Projekte und sorgst für Konsistenz und Exzellenz im Output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interdisziplinäre Zusammenarbeit: Du arbeitest Hand in Hand mit Expert:innen aus Social Media, Influencer Marketing, Brand Experience und Media, um ganzheitliche und wirkungsvolle Brand-Erlebnisse zu schaffen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kunden, Pitches &amp;amp; Storytelling: Du begleitest Kundenprojekte strategisch, arbeitest eng mit dem Projektmanagement zusammen und präsentierst deine Ideen &amp;amp; Strategien souverän bei Pitches, Workshops und Kundenterminen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring &amp;amp; Team-Spirit: Du teilst dein Wissen rund um Creator Culture, Trends und Social Strategy proaktiv mit unseren Talenten – von Mid-Level bis zu Werkstudierenden – und entwickelst das Team gemeinsam weiter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trend- &amp;amp; Creator-Gespür: Du lebst Social Media (TikTok, Instagram, YouTube &amp;amp; Co.), verstehst Creator-Culture sowie Plattform-Mechaniken im Schlaf und hast Lust, KI-Tools und neue Formate aktiv auszuprobieren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deine Erfahrung: Ideal sind 4–5 Jahre Erfahrung in den Bereichen Influencer Marketing, Social Strategy, Konzeption oder Copywriting (bevorzugt im Agenturumfeld). Du weißt, wie man Stories schreibt, die sowohl Creators als auch Zielgruppen begeistern, und bringst idealerweise auch Dreherfahrung mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dein Mindset: Du bist eigeninitiativ, strategisch denkend, verantwortungsbewusst und arbeitest lösungsorientiert mit hohem Qualitätsanspruch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deine Skills: Du präsentierst und argumentierst stark auf Deutsch (mind. C1) sowie sehr gut auf Englisch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du: &lt;strong&gt;#teamplayer #motiviert #neugierig&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Optiver, we strive for excellence in everything we do. We are seeking a Data Center Engineer that shares our excellence-only mindset. Because we believe that thoughtfully planned and well-orchestrated data center infrastructure is just as important as the algorithms running on our trading software. Without best-in-class infrastructure, there would be no foundation upon which to build our global market making core business.&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt; &lt;/em&gt;For that reason, we are looking for a Data Center Engineer who can manage our London colocations. You will be responsible for project work, general maintenance and auditing at these sites. We are seeking someone who is committed to continuous improvement and thrives bringing new ideas to the table. This is a chance to take ownership of the physical parts of our trading infrastructure across multiple data centers and thousands of servers, all the while striving for simplicity, performance optimization and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;613&quot;&gt;As a Data Center Engineer, you will be responsible for maintaining and optimizing our global data center environments. You will have the opportunity to combine your knowledge in IT Infrastructure in order to solve business issues and independently work on improvement opportunities. You will be working on projects of all sizes, either as a resource or leading engineer and delivering it from conception all the way to completion in this hands-on, high impact and high performance role. Specifically, your responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1148&quot;&gt;Installing and cabling switches, servers and appliances in our data centers and co-locations;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;Coordinating server and network equipment installation with smart hands in remote locations;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;Managing power and space allocation, including capacity planning and monitoring;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;Maintaining clean and consistent cable management practices;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;Tracking and managing spare parts and cable inventory;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1547&quot;&gt;Performing break-fix repairs, replacing components like hard drives, memory and transceivers;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1644&quot;&gt;Planning and executing data center build-outs, relocations and new equipment installations;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1739&quot;&gt;Packing, shipping, and managing the logistics of equipment for remote co-locations;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1826&quot;&gt;Maintaining comprehensive data center documentation and support the standardization of procedures;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1928&quot;&gt;Contributing to the build and maintenance of our core office IT infrastructure, including the trading floor;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2040&quot;&gt;Troubleshooting and testing cabling (fiber and copper) using cable testers;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2119&quot;&gt;Supporting system builds, configuration, and troubleshooting as needed&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2208&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2229&quot;&gt;Experience working in modern, large-scale data centers;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2288&quot;&gt;Ability to identify basic parts of network equipment (SFPs, line cards, chassis) and servers (memory, network cards, hard drives);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2422&quot;&gt;Knowledge of structured cabling systems (Cat 5, Cat 6, multi-mode, and single-mode fiber);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2516&quot;&gt;Familiarity with power and communications cabling standards;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2580&quot;&gt;Experience with cable testers to troubleshoot both fiber and copper cabling issues;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2667&quot;&gt;An understanding of change control processes;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2716&quot;&gt;Basic server operating system installation and configuration skills;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2788&quot;&gt;Strong documentation skills and a meticulous approach to tracking details&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2866&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Non-Technical Skills&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2866&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or coordinating resources in infrastructure projects, from conception to completion;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2891&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2945&quot;&gt;Creative problem-solving mindset, bringing new ideas to improve data center operations;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3143&quot;&gt;Ability to work both independently and collaboratively in fast-paced environments;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3456&quot;&gt;Willingness to work flexible hours outside of regular business hours, including regular weekend work, to execute physical infrastructure changes;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3593&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel to support regional data center operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2866&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Optiver, our mission is to constantly improve the market by injecting liquidity, providing accurate pricing, increasing transparency and acting as a stabilizing force no matter the market conditions. With a focus on continuous improvement, we participate in the safeguarding of healthy and efficient markets for everyone who participates. As one of the largest market making institutions, we are a trusted partner of 70+ exchanges across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;197&quot;&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 paid vacation days plus all UK public holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily breakfast and lunch, along with support on commuting expenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance, pension scheme, and ClassPass fitness membership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International transfer opportunities for global career growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Apply directly via the form below. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via our &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot;&gt;recruitment inquiry form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We cannot accept applications via email&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/?_gl=1*bh82o8*_up*MQ..&amp;amp;gclid=EAIaIQobChMItNH9v-THiQMVyJZQBh1Kbw3YEAAYASABEgI0z_D_BwE&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Senior Social Media Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Company: VML&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Location: Sea Containers, London, SE1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Working Pattern: Hybrid – Working from home / Sea Containers office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At VML, we are a beacon of innovation and growth in an ever-evolving world. Our heritage is built upon a century of combined expertise, where creativity meets technology, and diverse perspectives ignite inspiration. With the merger of VMLY&amp;amp;R and Wunderman Thompson, we have forged a new path as a growth partner that is part creative agency, part consultancy, and part technology powerhouse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our global family now encompasses over 30,000 employees across 150+ offices in 64 markets, each contributing to a culture that values connection, belonging, and the power of differences. Our expertise spans the entire customer journey building connected brands that drive growth for our clients. We do this by leveraging our 3 core practices; Brand experience, Customer experience and Commerce. Within these practices we offer expertise across communications, commerce, consultancy, CRM, data, production, and technology. We deliver end-to-end solutions that result in revolutionary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The Role: Senior Social Media Manager, Strategy&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced social strategist who will ideate, create, and deliver comprehensive innovative social strategies that help our clients achieve their business objectives in truly social ways. You&#39;ll be keen to understand what the client needs and match that with how we can create and engage, tailored to different social platforms, and always rooted in social audience behaviours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be one of the &#39;go-to&#39; social guardians, helping brands take bold steps to embrace the very best of what social has to offer with our guidance. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to own workstreams and really get under the skin of what makes audiences tick. If you&#39;re passionate about social media, have a keen eye for trends &amp;amp; platform updates, and possess exceptional communication skills, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML Social is growing and this opportunity is primed for someone that&#39;s looking to make great work amongst a team of specialists. We&#39;re very fortunate to offer our clients the full range of social expertise, from influencers, content creators, social data, commerce, and of course… strategists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the development and execution of comprehensive social brand, content, and campaign strategies. Leverage experience to develop broader POVs on specific audiences, trends, or best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Foster strong collaborative relationships with the wider agency, including strategy &amp;amp; planning, data &amp;amp; insights, client engagement, and creative. Integrate social-specific knowledge and align with their diverse expertise, including briefing work and working where social is part of an integrated plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement: &lt;/strong&gt;Steer clients through social strategies, providing guidance, challenging assumptions, and ensuring the best possible outcomes. Proactively uncover new opportunities for the brand&#39;s social execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insights: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify and leverage cultural and social insights relevant to the client and the social space as a whole, to inform strategic recommendations and ensure relevance for brands in social.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Presentation Skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Present strategic recommendations to senior clients and internal teams in a clear, concise, and persuasive manner. Respond spontaneously to issues or questions that arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Channel Understanding: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrate a truly native and broad understanding of everything social from LinkedIn to TikTok; content and trends, platform and functionality updates, and what the brand&#39;s competitors/comparators are doing in social. Share this knowledge proactively with colleagues and clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand Guardianship: &lt;/strong&gt;Understand and embody the needs of the brand, matched with social, and how different aspects of the brand need to show up (from personal to business, and from more serious to more fun).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The ideal candidate will:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a proven track record of developing and implementing successful social strategies for big brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a highly collaborative team player, capable of building strong relationships with clients, internal teams, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a strategic thinker with the ability to &#39;translate&#39; and communicate complex social data and insights into actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a compelling storyteller with excellent presentation and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be comfortable working in a dynamic environment and managing multiple projects simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be passionate about &#39;what&#39;s next&#39; in social, to stay ahead of the curve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be adept at using data and analytics to measure the effectiveness of social campaigns and optimise performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a proactive and results-oriented individual with a strong work ethic and a commitment to excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a social strategy role within an advertising/marketing agency or client team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of social media, with a variety of social platforms, and emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and maintain strong client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cross-functional teams and managing multiple projects simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working on FMCG clients is highly beneficial although not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree of some sort will help us understand your background and point of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sound like you? Then we&#39;d love to talk to you about this super exciting opportunity!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aside from a generous annual leave allowance and pension allowances, you will have access to a whole host of other benefits and activities such as&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BUPA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid-working schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family friendly policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-being Programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eye Care and Glasses Vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season Ticket Loans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WPP Discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also have a clear long-term career development plan and access to our learning and development activities and online learning platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without regard to race, colour, religion or belief, sex, age, national origin, citizenship status, marital status, military/veteran status, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender identity, physical or mental disability. We believe in creating a dynamic work environment that values diversity and inclusion and strives to recruit a diverse slate of candidates to help us achieve that goal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are unable or limited in your ability to access our career site as a result of a disability, we will be happy to assist you. Please contact our People Team at &lt;a ---------- to request an alternate accommodation. Please note that only requests for an employment application accommodation will be returned.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About YLD:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to help our clients keep moving forward. We work with them to build the skills and capabilities they need to stay ahead of the competition, and we know our success only happens when they succeed. We’re a team of curious, talented people, and we’re committed to making YLD a place where great people want to work, grow, and stay. We’re a remote-first consultancy specialising in software engineering, product design, and data. Our teams are based across London, Lisbon, and Porto, and we create digital solutions that continue to deliver value long after our work is done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the role:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer at YLD, you’ll be part of a client team building innovative products. We’re looking for someone curious, passionate, driven, and enthusiastic. You should be skilled in problem-solving and experienced in designing scalable, resilient, and fault-tolerant architectures. You’re also an effective communicator and a strong team player. Together with your team, you’ll thrive in a fast-paced engineering environment, delivering outstanding results and exciting projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Skills:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong backend engineering experience, with Go as a primary or preferred language;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable exploring other languages if needed;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in cloud environments such as AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining APIs and backend services, including SaaS platforms;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern infrastructure and distributed systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of modern deployment practices, including Docker, containers, and Kubernetes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in testing strategies, including TDD, across the full system lifecycle, with a focus on performance optimization;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools to augment your work, applying sound judgement to adopt emerging technologies where they genuinely add value and increase your impact as an engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You should apply if you are:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, proactive and always looking for ways to improve and develop yourself;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good communicator, both in writing and verbally. You’ll be able to explain technical ideas and concepts in business-friendly language;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong problem-solving skills that balance innovation with pragmatic technology choices to solve business needs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Used to working in a team-oriented, collaborative environment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and problem-solving-oriented;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine believer in diversity and fairness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits you’ll receive:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Private Health care (currently provided by Vitality)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced fully paid maternity and paternity leave for up to 6 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days annual holiday (excluding Public Holidays)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;£2000 annual allowance for Training/Conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;£300 annual allowance for additional hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Health support: access to Oli app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meditation/Sleep support: Headspace or Calm app subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus (depending on Company performance and results)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company laptop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous referral schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our typical Recruitment Process looks like this:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1st Interview with someone from the Talent team (30/45 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Interview with our Senior Developers (1h30)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/yld.io/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get a glimpse of what it&#39;s like working at YLD! 🤳&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/yld/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check out our LinkedIn page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We live and breathe our values, and know you will too:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Including everyone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationships built on honesty and ethics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspiring solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Winning together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal-opportunity employer and value diversity in all its forms. We do not discriminate based on race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, pregnancy or maternity, age, marital status, or disability. We also offer a remote-first working environment, with flexible working and work–life balance as standard for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;The Sales Development team at AlphaSense sits at the forefront of our company’s prospect engagement and pipeline generation efforts. We identify potential prospects, leverage diverse outreach strategies, engage in strategic conversations with stakeholders, and collaborate with Account Executives to expand our footprint within new and existing accounts, ultimately generating revenue for the organization. At our core, we are a dynamic team of highly motivated self-starters who are passionate about the AlphaSense product. We rely on product and industry knowledge to communicate the value of our solution and convert interested prospects into qualified leads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are looking for a passionate, data-driven Senior Sales Development Manager to help accelerate pipeline generation and drive new business growth. This individual will attract, retain, and cultivate exceptional Sales Development talent and future Account Executives within our team. Your leadership will be key in ensuring our team achieves ambitious goals and continues to thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role, 3 days per week in our London office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate Trainer and Coach:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a deep passion for training, coaching, and developing sales talent, ensuring your team reaches their highest potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Problem Solver: &lt;/strong&gt;You excel at identifying new and innovative ways to drive top-of-funnel growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Thinker: &lt;/strong&gt;You leverage data to make informed decisions and recommendations, ensuring strategies are backed by solid evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Natural Motivator: &lt;/strong&gt;You inspire and motivate your team to achieve ambitious goals, fostering a culture of excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable and Resilient: &lt;/strong&gt;You remain composed and adaptable in a fast-paced, ever-changing environment, quickly adjusting strategies as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor the team to secure high-quality meetings with senior executives, driving the team to meet or exceed KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish effective sales development strategies that scale as the team grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner on the go-to-market strategy, including email, phone, and social messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively track and analyze key trends to inform data-driven decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and execute professional development programming to enable team members to succeed as Sales Development Representatives and prepare them for future roles in the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Talent Acquisition to identify and attract Sales Development talent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;The Financial Services Strategic Sales team focuses on the global growth &amp;amp; expansion of the Largest &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;130 Financial Services clients. Working collaboratively within a Global Pod of other sales &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;professionals, the team is focused on delivering best-in-class sales execution &amp;amp; customer experience &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;through building executive-level relationships and constructing business cases to support Enterprise &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;deployments of AlphaSense.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p2R_mc5&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role: &lt;/strong&gt;Help investment professionals find the information they need to make better-informed decisions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;p2R_mc5&quot; class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;As a Strategic Account Executive at AlphaSense, you’ll grow relationships with some of our largest financial services clients across the UKI and European (EMEA) regions. You’ll work with asset managers, hedge funds, investment banks and sell-side research teams to expand how they use AlphaSense for investment research, due diligence and market monitoring.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner with internal professional services (Customer success &amp;amp; account management) colleagues to shape account strategy. You’ll own expansion across your accounts, from winning over individual investment teams to making the business case for firmwide adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute account plans to grow existing relationships and uncover upsell and cross-sell opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect into new teams within existing accounts, build relationships with investment professionals and senior decision-makers, and develop a strong pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full sales cycle, from discovery and tailored demos through product trials, negotiation and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales Development, Product Specialists, Account Management and Customer Success to drive adoption and expand accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accurately, deliver against quota and share client feedback with Product and Content teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of B2B SaaS sales experience, with a network across buy-side or sell-side financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of exceeding sales quotas and meeting six- or seven-figure annual revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex enterprise sales and building trust with both day-to-day users and senior executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative approach and the ability to connect product capabilities to investment workflows and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel regularly to meet clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What is the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Platform Infrastructure provides the infrastructure, tooling, processes and services that more than a thousand Elastic engineers depend on. We are about 110 people across ten teams in three groups: Core Infrastructure, Reliability Engineering, and Engineering Productivity &amp;amp; Developer Experience. We run the multi-cloud platform underneath Elastic Cloud Hosted and Serverless, the shared Kubernetes platform other Elastic teams build on, the observability estate that shows Cloud engineers what production is doing, and the release path the whole Elastic Stack ships through.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an SRE here you take an engineering approach to reliability. You write the Go, Python and Terraform that replaces manual work, you carry the on-call rotation for what your team runs, and you work with Cloud engineering to close the gaps you find.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic is expanding its Serverless offerring, and most of what we build sits underneath it. Current work includes packing hundreds of customer projects onto shared clusters, PrivateLink and static IPs, new regions, a single identity layer across the stack, and new government regions. We are also replacing manually managed services with code-managed systems, which lets the platform grow without the on-call load growing with it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why join us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The scale is large. We run across multiple cloud providers and many regions, and some teams operate 200+ production deployments of our own product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are customer zero for Elastic Cloud Hosted, Serverless and the observability and security products, so new features land on our systems first and our feedback goes back to the product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The engineers who use what you build are a thousand colleagues you can go and talk to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-call follows the sun, which keeps the burden outside working hours small.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are fully distributed across EMEA, NASA and APJ and the work happens in writing, so you control how you run your day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You own systems end to end as the DRI on a project, and you break the work down yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the outcome of projects on your team’s roadmap as the DRI, breaking the work down and pulling in help when you need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate and harden the infrastructure that other Elastic engineers depend on, managed as code with Terraform, Go and Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build tools and services that remove manual work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry the on-call rotation for what your team runs, drive incidents to resolution and write RCAs that lead to lasting fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve observability, runbooks and documentation so the on-call load gets lighter over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code and designs, and act as a second set of eyes on production changes to critical infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise risks and ideas without being asked, and mentor engineers with less experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give feedback to the Elastic product teams on the features that reach our systems first.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years in SRE, platform engineering or infrastructure engineering, including real time operating what you built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Terraform at multi-workspace scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals in Go or Python, the languages most of what we build is written in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience carrying on-call, resolving incidents under pressure and writing RCAs that hold up under review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How you work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take an ambiguous project, come back with a plan and own it to the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You say when an estimate or a sequence is wrong before the team commits to it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write clearly, because we work across nine time zones and the work happens in tickets and channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay calm when something is broken, communicate while you work and write the follow-up that stops it happening again.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We love pets - which is why we’re on a mission to make the world a better place for pets and their parents.&amp;nbsp; We offer pet insurance policies with generous pet health benefits that are designed with their needs in mind. We’ve helped half a million pets stay happy and healthy since 2017 - and many more customers throughout the world are joining us every day.&amp;nbsp; Our company is respectful, fun-loving and passionate about pets and their wellbeing.&amp;nbsp; Throughout our business you&#39;ll meet people who think differently, aim for impact, and love to try new things.&amp;nbsp; Want to join our pack?&amp;nbsp; Join us. Love every moment. Love ManyPets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role and purpose mandate&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ManyPets is continuing to evolve as it scales, with increasing organisational complexity and a need for strong People partnership that enables leaders to build high-performing, engaged and effective teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior People Advisor plays a critical role in aligning people priorities with business goals, partnering with senior leaders to shape organisational capability, improve performance, strengthen manager capability and support sustainable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines advisory partnership with practical delivery across organisational effectiveness, employee relations, workforce planning, leadership capability, engagement, wellbeing and data-led decision making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with designated senior leaders and management teams to deliver effective people plans and solutions, ensuring they land well, are embedded within the teams you support, and contribute directly to business performance, employee experience and our values-led culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;A day in the life&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for providing employee relations advise to designated business areas, supporting leaders with organisational design, workforce planning, performance, engagement and complex people matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on support, coaching leaders through ambiguity and ensuring People activity is commercially grounded, legally sound and aligned to company priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support People Advisors, ensuring consistent, high-quality advice and operational delivery across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;People Partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior leaders to translate business priorities into clear, practical and measurable people plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide trusted advice on organisational change, leadership effectiveness, team health, engagement, performance and culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use people data, engagement insight and employee relations trends to identify risks, opportunities and areas for action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach leaders to make balanced, inclusive and commercially grounded people decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a values-led People experience is felt by teams and delivered in line with business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Change Management &amp;amp; Engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and lead the People elements of change projects that improve business performance and align with strategic goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leaders and managers to ensure change is understood, communicated effectively and embedded well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support change initiatives including organisational design, redeployment, ways-of-working changes and team restructures, ensuring risks are identified and mitigated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior leaders on timely communication and engagement plans for upcoming change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help managers and teams understand engagement results, identify themes and agree practical actions to improve future engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Employee Relations, Risk &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead on complex employee relations matters, ensuring fair, consistent, legally sound and values-led outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on performance, conduct, absence, grievance, disciplinary and change-related matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify people risk and escalate appropriately, balancing employee experience, policy, legal requirements and business need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build manager capability to handle people matters confidently, consistently and with awareness of the impact on individuals, teams and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a proactive focus on wellbeing risks, including mental health, and ensure inclusion and wellbeing principles are considered across the employee journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support positive employee relations, helping to maintain a healthy working environment, morale and regrettable turnover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Data, Reward &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draw insight from people metrics to inform and advise stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data-driven insight to continuously improve people strategies, processes and interventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide insight and support on reward processes, including benchmarking where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure people data, reward activity and related processes are accurate, well managed and compliant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain awareness of GDPR, data protection requirements and relevant internal policies and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support a regulated business environment by balancing innovation, fairness, employee experience and appropriate governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;People Advisor Support &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support People Advisors, providing direction, coaching and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the quality and consistency of advice provided to managers and employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritise and allocate casework, ensuring effective workload management and timely resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve people processes, guidance, templates and manager self-service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure People activity is delivered consistently, accurately and in line with policy, employment law and company values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Measures of success&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business leaders receive proactive, commercially grounded and trusted people partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People plans support organisational priorities, performance and capability needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change activity lands well, is clearly communicated and is embedded effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee relations matters are managed fairly, consistently and with appropriate risk mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manager capability improves, particularly in performance, engagement, change and employee relations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People risks and wellbeing themes are identified early and addressed pragmatically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People Advisors are well supported, effective and delivering high-quality advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People data and insight are used to inform better decisions and improve outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthens the connection between business strategy and people priorities, helping leaders build effective teams and make better people decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improves organisational effectiveness, manager capability and employee experience through consistent, high-quality People partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a People Advisor, ideally in a fast-paced, scaling, operational or customer-service-led environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with senior leaders and managers through periods of change, transformation or organisational complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong employee relations expertise and a deep understanding of UK employment law and best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded, delivery-focused and able to balance business priorities with fairness, empathy and sound judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident using people data and insight to diagnose issues, influence decisions and improve outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with reporting, Excel and larger data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to influence senior stakeholders, challenge constructively and coach leaders effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing, coaching or developing People Advisors or HR colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, high standards of accuracy and a commitment to quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, pragmatic and able to translate complex people matters into clear, practical advice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CIPD qualified or able to demonstrate equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a regulated financial services environment is essential, with a good understanding of SM&amp;amp;CR or similar regulatory expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£60,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£70,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Ways of working&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On a typical day you’ll be working from a laptop with a screen, mouse, keyboard, and headset.&amp;nbsp; You’ll be meeting your colleagues on Zoom and keeping in touch regularly via email and Slack too – we’d expect you to be using your computer for around seven hours a day.&amp;nbsp; We’d ask that you have a distraction-free work area and a reliable internet connection with a speed of 25Mbps so you can work effectively.&amp;nbsp; We’ll make sure you have the right home set-up that supports you in the role by providing best-in-class technology, money towards a desk, and vision support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion at ManyPets&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We promise to give you the same opportunities as everyone else and we won’t discriminate against you at any point in the process. This includes how we source talent, our interview process, our conditions of employment (including pay) and feedback. &amp;nbsp;If you&#39;d like to read more about this, please download our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/6htm7c3glth8e7x3sm5xe/Our-Approach-to-Inclusion-Policy-ManyPets-May-24.pdf?rlkey=d0fjswa0v1h6r582kn9mubl9j&amp;amp;st=no0ket4o&amp;amp;dl=0&quot;&gt;Approach to Inclusion&lt;/a&gt; policy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Reasonable adjustments and support&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any help, support, or advice at any point during the hiring process please email &lt;a ---------- If you want to ask any questions or request an adjustment, please let us know and we&#39;ll do what we can to flex our approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Connect with us!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/manypets&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.co.uk/Overview/Working-at-ManyPets-EI_IE2165347.11,19.htm&quot;&gt;Glassdoor&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://uk.indeed.com/cmp/Manypets/about&quot;&gt;Indeed&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.feefo.com/en-GB/reviews/bought-by-many?displayFeedbackType=SERVICE&amp;amp;timeFrame=YEAR&quot;&gt;FeeFo&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/boughtbymany.com&quot;&gt;Trustpilot&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ManyPetsUK&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/manypets_UK&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/manypetsuk&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/manypets_uk&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@manypets_UK&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We love pets - which is why we’re on a mission to make the world a better place for pets and their parents.&amp;nbsp; We offer pet insurance policies with generous pet health benefits that are designed with their needs in mind. We’ve helped half a million pets stay happy and healthy since 2017 - and many more customers throughout the world are joining us every day.&amp;nbsp; Our company is respectful, fun-loving and passionate about pets and their wellbeing.&amp;nbsp; Throughout our business you&#39;ll meet people who think differently, aim for impact, and love to try new things.&amp;nbsp; Want to join our pack?&amp;nbsp; Join us. Love every moment. Love ManyPets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day in the life&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Platform Engineer, you will initially join our platform squad. We build and maintain the AWS infrastructure, deployment pipelines, tooling and engineering standards that every other squad at ManyPets depends on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role has a strong security focus, and it will become more security focused over time. Much of the work is compliance and assurance: building and running the tooling that checks our cloud estate against our security standards, writing the scripts that turn a manual check into a scheduled one, gathering the evidence we need for ISO 27001 and our other obligations, and supporting the audits that depend on it. Alongside that you will help us tighten access controls across our cloud estate, and take on ownership of the edge and network security tooling that protects our services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over time this role moves across to work directly with our Head of Security as we build out a dedicated security function at ManyPets. You will help shape what that function does and how it works, rather than inheriting something already built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our environment is fast-paced and highly collaborative. You will work closely with your teammates using pair or mob programming, participating in regular workshops and planning sessions, primarily over Zoom, with occasional in-person collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We embrace modern development practices:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;· &lt;/strong&gt;All our services are cloud-hosted on AWS, using serverless and event-driven architectures for scalability and resilience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· We use a fully automated deployment pipeline, allowing you to release to production within minutes, multiple times per day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· We define our infrastructure as code, and we emphasise observability, testing and secure-by-design principles from the start.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a squad we own our work end-to-end, including development, maintenance and support. You will play a key role in ensuring the reliability and quality of what we provide to the rest of engineering, and contribute to a culture of rapid learning and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ü Build and maintain secure platform foundations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;o &lt;/strong&gt;Design, build and maintain the shared cloud infrastructure, tooling and deployment pipelines that other squads rely on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;o &lt;/strong&gt;Define infrastructure as code so our environments are consistent, repeatable and reviewable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o Make secure configuration the default, so squads get it without having to ask for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o Maintain the edge and network security tooling that protects our services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;o &lt;/strong&gt;Share in the day-to-day operational ownership of the platform, responding to requests and issues raised by other squads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make our security posture measurable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;o&lt;/strong&gt; Automate the gathering of evidence for ISO 27001 and our other compliance obligations, so that an audit means pulling a report rather than running a manual exercise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o Write the scripts and small services that turn a manual security check into a scheduled, repeatable one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;o&lt;/strong&gt; Triage findings from our scanning and posture tooling such as Aikido and Ascidian, work out which ones actually matter, and either fix them or get them in front of the team that can.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o Work with our Head of Security to turn written policy into controls that are enforced by tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen access and identity controls&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;o &lt;/strong&gt;Review and tighten access across our cloud accounts, working towards least privilege.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o Improve how we manage secrets, credentials and machine identities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o Make access changes auditable, and straightforward for engineers to request and for us to review.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extend our platform standards beyond AWS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;o &lt;/strong&gt;Help us apply the standards, tooling and controls we have built in AWS to our Google Cloud estate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o Work with the teams who use Google Cloud to understand their needs and where the gaps are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;o &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with other squad members and stakeholders to align on goals and solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o Support engineers across other squads who use our platform, and take their feedback seriously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o Proactively build shared understanding across the team through pairing, discussions, and reviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o Document your work clearly to support knowledge sharing and future maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;o &lt;/strong&gt;Take ownership of your learning journey and technical development plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o Approach challenges with curiosity and a growth mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;o Learn from your peers and actively seek feedback and mentorship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Your skills and experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for someone with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Commercial experience building and maintaining cloud infrastructure on a major cloud provider (AWS, Google Cloud or Azure).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Hands-on experience defining infrastructure as code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Experience building and maintaining continuous integration and deployment pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· A good working understanding of cloud security fundamentals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Proficiency in at least one scripting language, ideally Python.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Comfort working in a regulated environment. We are FCA regulated and take our ISO 27001 commitments seriously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will also need at least one current associate-level cloud certification:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· AWS: Solutions Architect Associate, Developer Associate or SysOps Administrator Associate. We would also be interested in the AWS Certified Security Speciality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Google Cloud: Associate Cloud Engineer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Microsoft Azure: Administrator Associate (AZ-104) or Security Engineer Associate (AZ-500).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entry-level certifications such as AWS Cloud Practitioner, Google Cloud Digital Leader and Azure Fundamentals do not meet this on their own. Please include the certification name and your credential ID or badge link with your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We would also like to see at least one of the following. You do not need both, and we will support you to build the other:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· A security specialism, where you can tell us about security or compliance tooling you have built and what it caught.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Experience across more than one cloud provider, ideally both AWS and Google Cloud.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position has a four-stage interview process, which will be held via Zoom.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Stage 1 - an initial conversation with a member of our Talent team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Stage 2 - an informal meeting with the hiring manager for about 45 minutes. We will explain more about the role and explore how your experience matches up with what we need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Stage 3 - a longer interview, up to an hour, with the hiring manager and two engineers from the team. We will ask some competency questions and work through a technical scenario together. There is no take-home exercise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Stage 4 - an informal conversation with our Head of Security.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;About the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The EPD (&quot;Engineering, Product and Design&quot;) team operates with a squad system and Agile ways of working within quarterly terms - and we really enjoy working collaboratively. We hold regular ‘Hack Weeks’ to look at products and address problems relating to the business, and we get the chance to highlight and work on things we’re interested in and feel passionately about.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our tech stack&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are on a mission to become the best we can be, constantly challenging ourselves to achieve and learn. You will be supported to learn new technology – both in breadth and depth - and encouraged to challenge our ways of thinking with new and innovative ideas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our “north star” is to become an elite performer as defined by the 4 key DORA metrics. To drive towards elite status, we apply and continually inspect and adapt the best Agile frameworks and practices inspired by DevOps, SRE, Scrum, XP and Lean. We are a highly collaborative environment and regularly practice Mob and Pair based programming which we believe improve our quality of delivery and share understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We take our operational performance, security, and reliability as seriously as our quality and development practices. We are cloud hosted and highly automated, primarily on AWS with some critical services running on Google Cloud.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some specific technologies we use include: AWS | Google Cloud | Python | MongoDB | Aikido | Ascidian | Cloudflare&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary range:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£55,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£65,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Ways of working&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On a typical day you’ll be working from a laptop with a screen, mouse, keyboard, and headset.&amp;nbsp; You’ll be meeting your colleagues on Zoom and keeping in touch regularly via email and Slack too – we’d expect you to be using your computer for around seven hours a day.&amp;nbsp; We’d ask that you have a distraction-free work area and a reliable internet connection with a speed of 25Mbps so you can work effectively.&amp;nbsp; We’ll make sure you have the right home set-up that supports you in the role by providing best-in-class technology, money towards a desk, and vision support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion at ManyPets&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We promise to give you the same opportunities as everyone else and we won’t discriminate against you at any point in the process. This includes how we source talent, our interview process, our conditions of employment (including pay) and feedback. &amp;nbsp;If you&#39;d like to read more about this, please download our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/6htm7c3glth8e7x3sm5xe/Our-Approach-to-Inclusion-Policy-ManyPets-May-24.pdf?rlkey=d0fjswa0v1h6r582kn9mubl9j&amp;amp;st=no0ket4o&amp;amp;dl=0&quot;&gt;Approach to Inclusion&lt;/a&gt; policy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Reasonable adjustments and support&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any help, support, or advice at any point during the hiring process please email &lt;a ---------- If you want to ask any questions or request an adjustment, please let us know and we&#39;ll do what we can to flex our approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Connect with us!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/manypets&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.co.uk/Overview/Working-at-ManyPets-EI_IE2165347.11,19.htm&quot;&gt;Glassdoor&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://uk.indeed.com/cmp/Manypets/about&quot;&gt;Indeed&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.feefo.com/en-GB/reviews/bought-by-many?displayFeedbackType=SERVICE&amp;amp;timeFrame=YEAR&quot;&gt;FeeFo&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/boughtbymany.com&quot;&gt;Trustpilot&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ManyPetsUK&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/manypets_UK&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/manypetsuk&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/manypets_uk&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@manypets_UK&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Toast is driven by building the restaurant platform that helps restaurants adapt, take control, and get back to what they do best: building the businesses they love. As an &lt;strong&gt;Inside&lt;/strong&gt; Sales Account Executive, you will be part of a team that is transforming the way restaurants operate. Using a consultative approach, you will prospect, build relationships, and sign up new restaurateurs across the UK by understanding their unique needs, you will develop a customized solution that helps their business thrive. We need your passion and expertise to help us build the Toast brand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid role with 3 days in our London office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London W1W 8BJ, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;roll&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*?&amp;nbsp; (Responsibilities)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate list of prospective restaurants and manage the entire sales cycle from initial call to close &lt;strong&gt;(experience with self-sourcing clients is a huge plus)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct demos and develop a solution that best meets the prospect’s needs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with teams across the business to ensure that expectations set during the sales process are met in delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage Salesforce (our CRM) to manage all sales activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the competitive landscape and determine how to best position Toast in the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do you have the right &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;ingredients*&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;? (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience in a sourcing or closing sales role, restaurant operations, or a relatable field and industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, organisational and presentation skills with the ability to sell and negotiate at all decision-making levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of success in meeting and exceeding goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced, entrepreneurial and team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, creative, and flexible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General technical proficiency with software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce CRM is a nice to have&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at Toast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Toast, one of our company values is that we&#39;re hungry to build and learn. We believe learning new AI tools empowers us to build for our customers faster, more independently, and with higher quality. We provide these tools across all disciplines, from Engineering and Product to Sales and Support, and are inspired by how our Toasters are already driving real value with them. The people who thrive here are those who embrace changes that let us build more for our customers; it’s a core part of our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Total Rewards Philosophy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to provide competitive compensation and benefits programs that help to attract, retain, and motivate the best and brightest people in our industry. Our total rewards package goes beyond great earnings potential and provides the means to a healthy lifestyle with the flexibility to meet Toasters’ changing needs. Learn more about our benefits at &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/toast-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/toast-benefits&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/toast-benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Toast Uses AI in its Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Throughout the hiring process, our goal is to get to know you. We use AI tools to support our recruiters and interviewers with tasks like note-taking, summarization, and documentation of interviews to ensure they can be fully focused on your conversation. All hiring decisions are made by people. We ask that you complete interviews and assessments on your own, without real-time AI tools, recording, or transcription bots, unless we tell you otherwise in advance. To learn more: &lt;a class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/ai-in-hiring&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/ai-in-hiring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Approach to Hybrid Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We embrace a hybrid work model that fosters in-person collaboration while valuing individual needs. Our goal is to build a strong culture of connection as we work together to empower the hospitality community, regardless of location. Please visit the Locations page on our career site to learn more about our in-office expectations by region:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-link&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.toasttab.com/locations-toast&quot;&gt;https://careers.toasttab.com/locations-toast&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Are the Secret Ingredient in Our Recipe for Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Toast, our employees are our secret ingredient—when they thrive, we thrive. The restaurant industry brings together people with a wide range of backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we value that same breadth at Toast. We strive to build a culture grounded in authenticity, respect, and humility, where every Toaster has a real opportunity to grow, contribute, and do their best work—raising the bar in delivering exceptional experiences for our customers and each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Toast is committed to creating an accessible and inclusive hiring process. As part of this commitment, we strive to provide reasonable accommodations for persons with disabilities to enable them to access the hiring process. If you need an accommodation to access the job application or interview process, please contact &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;------&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For roles in the United States, it is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Insight Enterprises, Inc. is a Fortune 500 Solutions Integrator helping organizations accelerate transformation by unlocking the power of people and technology. We architect, build and manage solutions for complex IT environments to deliver outcomes that contribute to our clients&#39; success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our portfolio of digital transformation services includes deep expertise in cloud, data, AI, cybersecurity and intelligent edge. These services, augmented by Insight&#39;s longstanding relationships with 6,000+ technology partners across the globe, enable us to deliver the right technical solutions quickly and effectively. We&#39;re rated as a Great Place to Work, a Forbes Best Employer for Diversity and a Forbes World&#39;s Top Female-Friendly Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE ARE AMDARIS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Amdaris, we bring together exceptional talent to deliver custom software solutions and drive digital transformation. Our acquisition by Insight last year has only solidified our standing in the market to become the leading provider of software solutions and paving the way for an exciting growth trajectory with ambitious future goals in AI Consulting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our expertise spans software development, cloud computing, IT strategy, and digital innovation, helping businesses optimise their technology and achieve their strategic objectives. With cutting-edge projects and a dynamic team, there has never been a better time to join us and be part of our journey to shape the future of technology.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will lead the review of client applications and their technology and product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will monitor emerging technologies, including AI, GenAI and machine learning trends, assessing their relevance and potential application within client solutions and strategies, and provide recommendations on adoption and integration opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will produce detailed reports providing guidance on enhancements, best practice, and risk mitigation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with clients, you will interact with senior stakeholders to understand the business objectives and strategy; uncover and challenge technical requirements, technology approaches, methodology, security and tech stack decisions in line with business goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will review and interpret architectural approach, infrastructure and data flows; assessing advising on best practice SDLC methodology and ways of working.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigation will include the review of architecture diagrams and technical documentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will maintain effective internal relationships with sales, technical, product and delivery colleagues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be confident in providing technical support during sales pitches and proposals and will help to identify and promote additional value add services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SOLUTIONS ARCHITECT (APPS &amp;amp; AI) REQUIREMENTS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in software, application, and/or enterprise architecture methods and approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and improving architectures, and linking decisions to business objectives and technology strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on delivery of GenAI solutions (LLMs, prompt engineering, AI features).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, deploying, and operating cloud solutions, including the operational impact of design choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to review client applications, architecture, documentation, data flows, technology stacks, and SDLC/Agile practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on credibility across languages, APIs, data stores, and integration patterns sufficient to challenge technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify and mitigate security, privacy, data, operational, and AI-specific risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engaging senior clients, challenging assumptions, and influencing technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to produce decision-ready architecture reports covering findings, risks, and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting pitches and proposals, shaping credible solutions, and identifying additional client value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LIFE AT AMDARIS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Medical Cover&lt;/strong&gt; ✨ &lt;em&gt;Your health is a priority and we’ve got you covered!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work from Anywhere Policy (EMEA) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flexibility to work from wherever inspires you!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible and Hybrid working &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧑‍💻&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;A balance between office days and home comfort.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Employer Pension contributions &lt;/strong&gt;💼 &lt;em&gt;We invest in your future, today.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cycle to work scheme, Electric car scheme, Gym discounts&lt;/strong&gt; 🚴 &lt;em&gt;and many more flexible benefits to use at your leisure&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing app &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧘&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Access mindfulness tools, positivity boosts, and wellness support anytime&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monthly social and charitable events &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💙&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Build connections and give back while having fun.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beer on Tap!! &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍻&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raise a glass to celebrate the wins.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More About&amp;nbsp;The&amp;nbsp;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;This role&amp;nbsp;sits within the&amp;nbsp;Corporate&amp;nbsp;Sectors&amp;nbsp;and Public&amp;nbsp;Affairs&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;at Burson as a Social &amp;amp; Content&amp;nbsp;Strategist&amp;nbsp;(Account Director). You will&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;as part of a global social media team for a leading technology company,&amp;nbsp;as well as supporting&amp;nbsp;other key accounts,&amp;nbsp;creating social-first content for&amp;nbsp;Instagram, TikTok,&amp;nbsp;LinkedIn,&amp;nbsp;Facebook&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;X.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will&amp;nbsp;be responsible for&amp;nbsp;developing social&amp;nbsp;strategies that&lt;u&gt;:&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;connect audience&amp;nbsp;behaviour&amp;nbsp;with brand&amp;nbsp;objectives.&amp;nbsp;You will partner&amp;nbsp;closely&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;creative&amp;nbsp;teams, account leaders, and clients to guide the direction of&amp;nbsp;campaigns&amp;nbsp;across platforms.&amp;nbsp;Your work will influence&amp;nbsp;content planning, creative development,&amp;nbsp;community engagement, and measurement approaches.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who&amp;nbsp;is passionate &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;about&amp;nbsp;social platforms,&amp;nbsp;embraces&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;content&amp;nbsp;formats&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;and with strong client management skills and the flexibility to work across different types of social platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement robust, data-driven social media&amp;nbsp;and digital engagement&amp;nbsp;strategies by conducting in-depth&amp;nbsp;reputational&amp;nbsp;analysis, trend forecasting, and&amp;nbsp;stakeholder&amp;nbsp;/ audience&amp;nbsp;mapping, ensuring these strategies are not only clear and compelling but also directly aligned with overarching business&amp;nbsp;objectives&amp;nbsp;and measurable KPIs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;and optimise strategic social platform planning for both large-scale, time-bound campaigns and continuous &#39;always-on&#39; engagement initiatives, meticulously defining channel-specific content ecosystems, targeting parameters, and maximising reach and impact across the relevant digital landscape.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate performance data, intelligence, and&amp;nbsp;stakeholder&amp;nbsp;sentiment into actionable strategic recommendations that directly inspire and inform innovative creative development, campaign optimisation, and future content planning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persuasively present complex strategic frameworks, insights, and actionable plans to both internal stakeholders and external clients, instilling confidence and securing buy-in through clear, compelling communication and a proven executive presence.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At the client level:&amp;nbsp;Leverage&amp;nbsp;our suite of tools to&amp;nbsp;anticipate&amp;nbsp;threats&amp;nbsp;and inform innovative strategic pivots&amp;nbsp;for our clients&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;build&amp;nbsp;reputation, strategic&amp;nbsp;relevance&amp;nbsp;and competitive advantage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At the practice level:&amp;nbsp;Proactively&amp;nbsp;monitor&amp;nbsp;and interpret evolving social media trends, platform evolutions, and shifts in audience behaviour to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;emerging opportunities&amp;nbsp;for our clients, teams and to keep Burson ahead of the curve.&amp;nbsp;You will join a&amp;nbsp;vibrant&amp;nbsp;community of Social&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Content&amp;nbsp;contributors across our London office, working together to grow and innovate the offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed&amp;nbsp;seamlessly into our Corporate and Public Affairs&amp;nbsp;team, working across our specialisms to understand our clients and the&amp;nbsp;factors shaping reputation across&amp;nbsp;stakeholders,&amp;nbsp;media,&amp;nbsp;policy, regulation, issues and more.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate&amp;nbsp;with creative teams, guiding the development of concepts and content designed to authentically connect with and deeply resonate&amp;nbsp;with target stakeholders,&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;ensuring messaging is&amp;nbsp;reputationally&amp;nbsp;relevant and highly engaging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating&amp;nbsp;effective&amp;nbsp;content briefs&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;our design team,&amp;nbsp;developing copy and making recommendations on assets&amp;nbsp;and overseeing digital editorial calendars.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively&amp;nbsp;monitor&amp;nbsp;and interpret evolving social media trends, platform evolutions, and shifts in audience behaviour to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;emerging opportunities,&amp;nbsp;anticipate&amp;nbsp;competitive&amp;nbsp;threats, and inform innovative strategic pivots that&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;brand&amp;nbsp;relevance and competitive advantage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate and persuasively present complex strategic frameworks, insights, and actionable plans to both internal stakeholders and external clients, instilling confidence and securing buy-in through clear, compelling communication and a proven executive presence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating content briefs to feed into our design and editing team, developing&amp;nbsp;copy&amp;nbsp;and making recommendations on assets and content structure&amp;nbsp;and overseeing the management&amp;nbsp;social calendar across multiple regions for a global LinkedIn company page&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing client communications including leading content development workstreams, updating WIPs and calendars, internal communication with colleagues&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;This role sits within Burson’s Corporate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and Public Affairs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;team. As a Senior Account Executive,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Social &amp;amp; Content,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;you will play&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;an important role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;in the day-to-day delivery of social media activity for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;number of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;high profile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;brands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Working as part of a global team, you will support client relationships, coordinate multiple workstreams and help deliver high-quality, social-first content across LinkedIn,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and X, with opportunities to work across Instagram and TikTok. We are looking for someone with strong agency experience, excellent organisational and communication skills, and a proactive approach to client and project management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;27&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Take day-to-day ownership of assigned client workstreams, managing timelines, deliverables,&amp;nbsp;approvals&amp;nbsp;and next steps from brief through to delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;27&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build day-to-day client relationships, supporting meetings, preparing agendas and action points, and keeping clients updated on progress.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;27&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coordinate content development across internal teams, including design, editing, creative and social specialists.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;27&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contribute to content planning, editorial&amp;nbsp;calendars&amp;nbsp;and the development of new, platform-relevant ideas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;27&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Write,&amp;nbsp;edit&amp;nbsp;and proofread social media copy, content briefs, presentation&amp;nbsp;materials&amp;nbsp;and client communications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;27&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop recommendations for assets, formats, messaging and content structure across LinkedIn, Facebook,&amp;nbsp;X&amp;nbsp;and other relevant platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;27&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;7&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Maintain WIPs, project trackers, content&amp;nbsp;calendars&amp;nbsp;and status updates, ensuring activity&amp;nbsp;remains&amp;nbsp;organised and on schedule.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;27&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;8&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Monitor social media platforms, cultural trends and best practice, bringing proactive ideas and insights to the team and clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
