&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;This role sits within Burson London’s Corporate and Public Affairs division, a team of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;eighty plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;problem solvers who partner with brands, organisations, and governments to navigate complex reputational, policy,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;problem solvers who partner with brands, organisations, and governments to navigate complex reputational, policy and regulatory challenges.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;As an Associate Director / Senior Associate Director, you will play a leading role in shaping and delivering high-impact internal communications and employee engagement programmes for global&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;and UK&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;clients&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Operating as a trusted advisor, you will translate complex business challenges into clear, compelling strategies that drive engagement, support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;transformation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and strengthen organisational culture, championing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;creativity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and challenging accepted norms to reimagine how employee engagement is done.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;You will lead client relationships and take ownership of key programmes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;overseeing everything from strategic development through to execution and evaluation. This includes designing integrated employee engagement campaigns, advising senior stakeholders, managing content and channel strategies, and ensuring all work is delivered to the highest standard, on time and on budget.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;thrive in a fast-paced agency environment, juggling multiple clients and priorities while&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;maintaining&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;quality and attention to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;detail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;. You will also play an active role in growing the business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;identifying&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;opportunities, contributing to new business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;pitches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and helping to expand existing client relationships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;Internally,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;lead and mentor teams, contribute to the development of the practice, and take a proactive role in shaping our employee engagement offer. A key part of the role is being willing and able to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;lead employee engagement initiatives end-to-end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;, bringing energy, creativity and strategic rigour to everything you do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
