&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Über 130.000 Fahrzeuge im Jahr, quer durch Europa. Jede Route, jeder Stellplatz und jeder Transportpartner ist eine Entscheidung mit Preisschild. Neben deinem Studium lernst du, wie diese Entscheidungen mit Daten vorbereitet werden, und bringst deine eigenen Analysen ein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standort:&lt;/strong&gt; Am Postbahnhof 14, 10243 Berlin (nahe Ostbahnhof) – Hybrid, 3 Tage Office, 2 Tage Homeoffice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Über uns&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CarOnSale ist die KI-gestützte Plattform für den B2B-Gebrauchtwagenhandel in Europa. Über 40.000 Käufer aus mehr als 20 Ländern handeln auf unserer Plattform – und 85 % des Inventars ist exklusiv bei uns. Wir verbinden Software, Pricing-Intelligenz, Logistik und Finanzierung in einer Schicht – als Betriebssystem für eine ganze Branche.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One Platform. One Profit Engine.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistikstrategie:&lt;/strong&gt; Du unterstützt bei der Weiterentwicklung unserer Logistikstrategie und hilfst, sie an den Unternehmenszielen auszurichten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prozesse:&lt;/strong&gt; Du unterstützt bei der datenbasierten Optimierung interner Logistikprozesse und wirkst bei der Ableitung konkreter Verbesserungsmaßnahmen mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools und Dashboards:&lt;/strong&gt; Du wirkst bei der Entwicklung von Tools und Dashboards mit, die Lager- und Transportoptionen vergleichbar machen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnermanagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Du unterstützt beim Onboarding neuer Transportunternehmen und hilfst bei Dokumentation und Reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Du hilfst beim Erstellen von Management-Präsentationen zu Logistik-Performance und strategischen Initiativen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Was du mitbringst&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist während deiner gesamten Werkstudententätigkeit an einer Hochschule eingeschrieben, mindestens im 4. Fachsemester, in BWL, Wirtschaftswissenschaften, (Wirtschafts-)Ingenieurwesen, Logistik, Data oder einem verwandten Fach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du kannst in der Vorlesungszeit bis zu 20 Stunden pro Woche arbeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast bereits ein Praktikum oder eine Werkstudententätigkeit im Büro- oder Projektumfeld absolviert&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytisches, strukturiertes Denken und ein sicherer Umgang mit Zahlen; Excel und PowerPoint sind selbstverständlich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du nutzt KI-Tools wie Claude, ChatGPT oder Gemini aktiv im Alltag. Nenn in deinem Lebenslauf ein konkretes Beispiel, etwa ein Projekt, eine Automatisierung oder einen Workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deutsch C1 und Englisch C1, beide Sprachen gehören zum Arbeitsalltag&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du lebst in Berlin oder ziehst hierher, denn du arbeitest regelmäßig bei uns im Büro&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Studienschwerpunkt Logistik, Supply Chain oder Transportwesen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL oder erste Erfahrung mit BI-Tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erste Erfahrung im Consulting, in Operations oder in einem datengetriebenen Umfeld&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Was dich bei uns erwartet&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strukturiertes Onboarding mit Buddy-Programm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regelmäßige Feedbackzyklen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frisches Obst und Getränke im Büro&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laptop für mobiles Arbeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10 Tage „Work from Anywhere&quot; pro Jahr&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Urban Sports Club-Zuschuss&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mitarbeiterangebote: exklusive Rabatte bei hunderten Partnern wie AboutYou und Expedia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gelebte Vielfalt: aktives Frauennetzwerk, Meditations- &amp;amp; Gebetsraum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bewirb dich jetzt – dein Lebenslauf reicht.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of Wolt’s Platform department (Core Group), you’ll help improve and automate operations for our storage access platform - our real time database abstraction layer solution designed with scale and resiliency in mind . The product you will build enforces best practices by design, abstracts database infrastructure, and supports Multi-Region architecture through data sharding and replication. You join a team of highly skilled engineers in designing, building and optimizing this platform and ensuring smooth developer onboarding, constant improvement and optimization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an engineer on the Storage access platform team, you’ll work on platform features such as UI for developer teams, storage abstraction layer, database automation, client SDK and proxy, Change Data Capture pipelines, caching and ephemeral storage, Hot &amp;amp; Cold storage management and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be a great fit for this role if you have the following skills and experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong developer-to-developer mindset, with a genuine enjoyment of building for internal customers and treating other engineers as your primary users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptability and strong motivation for working with distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven approach to decision-making and a collaborative mindset, with the ability to navigate disagreements constructively and deliver consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy in dynamic, fast-paced environments with frequent change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product- and platform-oriented approach to engineering challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to engage effectively with stakeholders and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative spirit and experience contributing to diverse and inclusive work environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Technical proficiencies:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in NoSQL databases, particularly Cassandra or DynamoDB.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with large-scale distributed systems, emphasizing both velocity and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SRE principles; however, a background in Backend Development is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge of Kubernetes, including EKS, as an end user.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t need to tick every box, but if you see yourself in many of these points, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Wolt, we’re committed to building an environment where engineers can make an impact while enjoying meaningful challenges. As a member of the the team you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on solutions that support millions of users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solving complex problems in performance, reliability and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and inclusive culture that supports your professional and personal well-being&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also offer flexible work arrangements, competitive compensation, and ongoing learning opportunities to help you thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc?si=FzuwoSOLcv5WZVRN&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tenstorrent is leading the industry on cutting-edge AI technology, revolutionizing performance expectations, ease of use, and cost efficiency. With AI redefining the computing paradigm, solutions must evolve to unify innovations in software models, compilers, platforms, networking, and semiconductors. Our diverse team of technologists have developed a high performance RISC-V CPU from scratch, and share a passion for AI and a deep desire to build the best AI platform possible. We value collaboration, curiosity, and a commitment to solving hard problems. We are growing our team and looking for contributors of all seniorities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Field Application Engineer who’s wired for AI/ML, fluent in real-world problem-solving, and excited to build with the people actually using what we make. You will collaborate closely with the sales team and enterprise customers, leveraging your deep technical knowledge in AI to drive the adoption of our products and solutions. This is a customer-facing role that requires both technical expertise and excellent communication skills to convey complex technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is&lt;strong&gt; remote&lt;/strong&gt; based out of Munich, Germany.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome candidates at various experience levels for this role. During the interview process, candidates will be assessed for the appropriate level, and offers will align with that level, which may differ from the one in this posting.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve lived in the AI/ML trenches, whether as a field engineer, a solutions architect, or the one tapped in when things needed to “just work.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You speak both machine and human. Whether it’s a researcher or a skeptical executive, you know how to break things down and bring them to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re fired up about generative models, LLMs, and the edge of what’s possible when software meets purpose-built silicon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with customers in meetings, presentations, and workshops to understand their technical challenges and provide effective solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with sales operations and product teams to provide feedback from customers and help shape future product enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer-facing skills with 5+ years of relevant technical, enterprise experience (such as Sales Engineer, Solutions Engineer, or Technical Account Manager).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your field insight will help shape our roadmap, our features, and the way we show up for developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise in AI technologies and frameworks, including machine learning, deep learning, natural language processing (NLP),computer vision, PyTorch or TensorFlow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with embedded systems, FPGA Architecture or AI accelerators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of data center, server architecture and deployment, thermal/power, and infrastructure management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to explore and push the boundaries of AI performance on custom silicon and help developers do the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What it’s like to build the future from scratch, working alongside teams creating hardware, software, and everything in between.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To master the craft of fine-tuning LLMs, optimizing vision models, and building AI pipelines that run at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of why field roles drive real impact turning on-the-ground insight into product breakthroughs and platform momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tenstorrent offers a highly competitive compensation package and benefits, and we are an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This offer of employment is contingent upon the applicant being eligible to access U.S. export-controlled technology. &amp;nbsp;Due to U.S. export laws, including those codified in the U.S. Export Administration Regulations (EAR), the Company is required to ensure compliance with these laws when transferring technology to nationals of certain countries (such as EAR Country Groups D:1, E1, and E2). &amp;nbsp; These requirements apply to persons located in the U.S. and all countries outside the U.S. &amp;nbsp;As the position offered will have direct and/or indirect access to information, systems, or technologies subject to these laws, the offer may be contingent upon your citizenship/permanent residency status or ability to obtain prior license approval from the U.S. Commerce Department or applicable federal agency. &amp;nbsp;If employment is not possible due to U.S. export laws, any offer of employment will be rescinded.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tenstorrent is leading the industry on cutting-edge AI technology, revolutionizing performance expectations, ease of use, and cost efficiency. With AI redefining the computing paradigm, solutions must evolve to unify innovations in software models, compilers, platforms, networking, and semiconductors. Our diverse team of technologists have developed a high performance RISC-V CPU from scratch, and share a passion for AI and a deep desire to build the best AI platform possible. We value collaboration, curiosity, and a commitment to solving hard problems. We are growing our team and looking for contributors of all seniorities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tenstorrent builds open, scalable AI compute, and Europe is a priority market for revenue growth. As BD Executive, Europe, you will own business development across the UK, Germany, France and other EU countries, deepening existing engagements and opening new ones with enterprise and government clients and system integrators. You will work with the International GTM team, partners and customers to turn technical interest in our hardware into commercial opportunities. This is a senior role on a team that may grow as the region does.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is remote, based out of London, Frankfurt, or another major EU city with required travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome candidates at various experience levels for this role. During the interview process, candidates will be assessed for the appropriate level, and offers will align with that level, which may differ from the one in this posting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales or business development leader with 10+ years of experience in solution selling for AI hardware, HPC or similar technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted by government and enterprise clients and system integrators, with strong relationships you can bring into new conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven in building pipeline and closing commercial opportunities, from first meeting through signed deal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English, with German, French or another EU language as a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage pipeline across the UK, Germany, France and other EU countries, growing existing engagements and opening new ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own client relationships with enterprise, government and system integrator accounts, coordinating several stakeholders per initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across borders with GTM, partner and technical teams so each opportunity has the right support to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on region pipeline and market trends so the team can focus on the deals most likely to land.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How Tenstorrent&#39;s open, scalable AI hardware fits enterprise, government and sovereign compute needs in Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ways to build a regional business at a fast-moving AI compute company, with room for the team to grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical depth on AI systems and software, with training from our GTM and field engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where AI infrastructure demand is heading across the European market, from data center to cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tenstorrent offers a highly competitive compensation package and benefits, and we are an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This offer of employment is contingent upon the applicant being eligible to access U.S. export-controlled technology. &amp;nbsp;Due to U.S. export laws, including those codified in the U.S. Export Administration Regulations (EAR), the Company is required to ensure compliance with these laws when transferring technology to nationals of certain countries (such as EAR Country Groups D:1, E1, and E2). &amp;nbsp; These requirements apply to persons located in the U.S. and all countries outside the U.S. &amp;nbsp;As the position offered will have direct and/or indirect access to information, systems, or technologies subject to these laws, the offer may be contingent upon your citizenship/permanent residency status or ability to obtain prior license approval from the U.S. Commerce Department or applicable federal agency. &amp;nbsp;If employment is not possible due to U.S. export laws, any offer of employment will be rescinded.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Rithum™ is the world’s most trusted commerce network, accelerating how brands, suppliers, and retailers work together to deliver seamless e-commerce experiences. We provide an unmatched platform for brands and retailers, enabling them to accelerate growth, optimize operations across channels, scale product offerings and enhance margins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, more than 40,000 companies trust Rithum to grow their business across hundreds of channels, representing over $50 billion in annual GMV. Using our commerce, marketing, and delivery solutions, our customers create optimized consumer shopping journeys from beginning to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Strategic Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you own the development and growth of a portfolio of assigned strategic accounts within your designated region. You build and execute strategic sales plans, develop trusted relationships with senior executives and key stakeholders, and identify opportunities to expand Rithum&#39;s value across complex client organizations. You are accountable for meeting or exceeding financial targets by leading consultative, value-based sales engagements and securing high-value, multi-year software and services agreements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rithum empowers employees across all roles to leverage AI and technology to work smarter, move faster, and create scalable ways of working. In this role, you will use AI and data-driven insights to strengthen account strategy, identify opportunities, improve sales effectiveness, and deliver more relevant and impactful client engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strategic Account Growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute account plans aligned to client priorities, commerce strategies, and growth objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet or exceed sales targets by identifying, developing, and closing software and services opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand Rithum’s footprint across client brands, business units, geographies, channels, marketplaces, and capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build qualified pipeline by identifying whitespace and new opportunities within assigned accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Executive &amp;amp; Value-Based Selling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted, multi-threaded relationships with senior executives and key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand client priorities and position Rithum’s capabilities against business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead consultative, value-based conversations and develop compelling business cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex buying groups and build consensus across decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deal Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex sales opportunities from discovery through negotiation and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop deal strategies that address client priorities, competitive dynamics, commercial considerations, and barriers to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead negotiations across pricing, terms, procurement, legal, security, and other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply the Rithum Way of Selling to opportunity strategy, qualification, progression, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipeline, Forecasting &amp;amp; AI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a disciplined pipeline and deliver accurate, timely forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high-quality CRM data and use insights to prioritize accounts and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI and sales technologies to strengthen research, account planning, client engagement, and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional deal teams, bringing together the expertise needed to advance opportunities and deliver client value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Client Success, Solutions Engineering, Professional Services, Product, Partnerships, Legal, Finance, and other teams as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share client, market, and competitive insights with Product and business leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of B2B software, SaaS, or technology sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in a closing role selling to strategic or enterprise accounts, or 2+ years selling Rithum solutions to enterprise clients, with quota attainment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in a full cycle quota carrying role; from strategic territory planning, prospecting, developing &amp;amp; closing complex 6 figure transactions (minimum 100k deal size)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent recent quota attainment (100%+ for 4+ consecutive quarters) in a competitive, metrics-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success developing and growing strategic accounts through new opportunities, expansion, cross-sell, upsell, or new use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex sales cycles involving senior executives, multiple stakeholders, and commercial negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of structured, value-based sales methodologies (e.g., MEDDICC, Challenger, SPIN, Miller Heiman, Value Selling, Solution Selling) with evidence of pipeline progression and forecast accuracy, translating solutions into measurable business outcomes and leading cross-functional deal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build pipeline through self-generated outbound prospecting, with measurable activity standards (e.g., 40–60+ daily touchpoints)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to develop account plans, identify whitespace, build pipeline, and maintain accurate forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disciplined use of CRM and sales tools (Salesforce preferred) and sales engagement platforms (e.g., Outreach, Salesloft, HubSpot, LinkedIn Navigator, ZoomInfo) for pipeline, activity, and conversion tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to leverage AI, data, and modern sales technologies to improve sales effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently and travel as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of B2B SaaS, software, or technology sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling enterprise commerce, e-commerce, marketplace, retail technology, or related solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to large brands, retailers, manufacturers, or enterprises with complex buying environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling integrated solutions across multiple products, capabilities, or services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with partner- or channel-influenced sales motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience positioning data-driven or AI-powered solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Marketing, Communications, or a related field preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Up to 25%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that this job description is not designed to cover or contain a comprehensive listing of activities, duties or responsibilities required of the employee for this job. Duties, responsibilities, and activities may change at any time with or without notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What it’s like to work at Rithum&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join Rithum, you can expect to work with smart risk-takers, courageous collaborators, and curious minds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Rithum team, you are valued, supported, and included. Guided by a transparent culture and accessible, approachable leadership, we offer career opportunities aligned to your ambitions and talents. To ensure work and life balance works for you, we also offer an array of resources to support you and your families, including comprehensive benefits and wellness plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rithum you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the leading brands and retailers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect with passionate professionals who will help support your goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an inclusive, welcoming work atmosphere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve work-life balance through remote-first working conditions, generous time off, and wellness days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive industry-competitive compensation and total rewards benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
