&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment (PlayStation) is seeking a Change &amp;amp; GTM Commercial Manager to shape and deliver strategic e-commerce initiatives at global scale. &amp;nbsp;This role goes beyond project delivery: you will turn customer, market, and trading insights into clear commercial strategies and own the end-to-end go-to-market lifecycle - from opportunity sizing and value proposition through launch, adoption, retention, and continuous optimization. You will help improve how players discover, evaluate, purchase, and engage with PlayStation products and services across the Direct to Consumer (D2C) business. You will partner with Product, Engineering, Merchandising, Marketing, Analytics, Data Science, Finance, Legal, and Operations to deliver measurable customer and commercial value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a commercially minded, data-savvy operator who can frame ambiguous problems, work hands-on with data, influence strategic choices, and translate insight into execution with pace and agility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape e-commerce and GTM strategy - define the customer problem, size the opportunity, identify priority segments, and shape the value proposition, market sequencing, channel approach, and commercial roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive analytical decision-making - analyse customer journeys, growth funnels, trading performance, and behavioural data to identify opportunities, diagnose performance gaps, and recommend clear actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build commercial cases and KPI frameworks -&amp;nbsp;forecast and monitor outcomes including traffic, acquisition, conversion, basket size and average order value, purchase frequency, repeat purchase, LTV, and incremental revenue; use the evidence to guide investment and prioritization choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed experimentation and personalization -&amp;nbsp;partner with Product, Marketing, Analytics, and Data Science to design A/B tests, apply segmentation and predictive insights, and improve customer relevance and conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full GTM lifecycle - connect commercial strategy to launch planning, customer activation, market readiness, adoption, retention, learning, and continuous optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create performance visibility - build dashboards, decision-ready reporting, and review rhythms that turn data into recommendations, owners, and measurable performance improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional orchestration and change - align global teams around customer outcomes, commercial goals, decisions, risks, dependencies, and business readiness; influence stakeholders through clear analysis and compelling narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable e-commerce playbooks - codify repeatable approaches for segmentation, proposition development, launch, experimentation, adoption, optimization, and transfer into business-as-usual ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5 years of experience&amp;nbsp;in management consulting, commercial strategy, e-commerce, digital commerce, growth, product, or GTM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting transactional e-commerce, digital storefronts, D2C, technology, games, or entertainment is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial modelling experience&amp;nbsp;including opportunity sizing, forecasting, scenario analysis, business-case development, and assessing incremental revenue and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on analytical capability&amp;nbsp;including working with SQL, Tableau or similar BI tools, spreadsheets, KPI modelling, segmentation, funnel diagnostics, and AI-enabled analytical tools to generate actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, hypothesis-driven problem-solving&amp;nbsp;with the ability to bring clarity to complexity, test assumptions, and make practical recommendations from incomplete information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with experimentation and optimization&amp;nbsp;including A/B testing, test design, measurement, and using results to improve customer journeys and commercial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong e-commerce and customer-lifecycle understanding&amp;nbsp;including digital storefronts, merchandising, offers and promotions, acquisition, conversion, checkout, basket value, repeat purchase, and personalized customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to connect strategy to execution&amp;nbsp;translating insight into clear choices, roadmaps, operating plans, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional leadership&amp;nbsp;with the communication, facilitation, and stakeholder-management skills to influence product and business decisions at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading business readiness and change&amp;nbsp;for new digital capabilities, customer propositions, or commercial operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product management or agile delivery experience&amp;nbsp;is a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On Site Gym&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised Café&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free soft drinks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On site bar&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to cycle garage and showers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our Candidate Privacy Notice (where applicable) for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly strategic, operational, and empathetic &lt;strong&gt;Senior Director, Human Resources – Field Operations (Europe)&lt;/strong&gt;. In this critical leadership role, you will serve as the principal HR Business Partner to the SVP of Europe Operations while providing strategic direction and mentorship to a distributed team of Site HR professionals across our European fulfillment centers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bridge the gap between high-level operational strategy and on-the-ground employee experience. The ideal candidate thrives in a fast-paced, complex logistics or manufacturing environment, deeply understands European labor dynamics, and possesses the executive presence to challenge, coach, and partner with senior supply chain leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Business Partnering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the dedicated HR Business Partner and trusted advisor to the SVP, Europe Operations, aligning human capital strategy with broader business and operational goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive organizational design, workforce planning, and change management initiatives across the European operations network to ensure scalable, efficient, and agile structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and guide senior operational leadership on talent density, performance management, succession planning, and inclusive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field HR Leadership &amp;amp; Team Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a high-performing team of Site HR Managers, Directors, and HRBPs embedded within our local fulfillment centers across multiple European countries (e.g., Germany, UK, Netherlands, France, Sweden, and Norway).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a cohesive, collaborative HR community across the region, ensuring best-in-class HR service delivery, consistency in policy application, and a unified company culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear KPIs and metrics for the Field HR team, utilizing data to track retention, engagement, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Labor Relations, Works Council &amp;amp; Employee Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect a proactive employee relations strategy tailored to a blue-collar, high-volume operational workforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex European labor laws, partnering with local HR and legal teams to manage relationships with representation wherever applicable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead engagement and retention initiatives for frontline workers, ensuring a safe, inclusive, and rewarding workplace environment in our fulfillment centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational HR Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Centers of Excellence (Talent Acquisition, Total Rewards, Shared Service) to build customized programs for Field Operations, including competitive hourly wage structures, peak-season hiring strategies, and frontline leadership training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardize and optimize core HR processes across European sites while respecting local nuances and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion HelloFresh’s data-driven culture by analyzing employee feedback, turnover data, and absenteeism trends to implement targeted interventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 12+ years of progressive HR leadership experience, with a minimum of 5 years leading HR functions in high-volume, multi-site Supply Chain, Fulfillment, Manufacturing, or Logistics environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Partnering:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of operating as a strategic HRBP to C-suite or SVP-level operations leaders, with the ability to influence without authority and drive systemic change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pan-European Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of European labor laws, compliance standards, and significant experience negotiating and collaborating with Works Councils and trade unions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional team leadership skills with experience managing, scaling, and empowering remote/distributed HR teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; A heavily data-driven approach to HR. You rely on metrics and analytics to identify root causes, build business cases, and measure the success of people initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agility &amp;amp; Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, and dynamic environment where ambiguity is common and speed is critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Business fluency in English is required; proficiency in an additional European language (e.g., German, Dutch, French) is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the future of food:&lt;/strong&gt; Play a key role in transforming how millions of people eat as we grow into a global food solutions company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive transformational change:&lt;/strong&gt; Your decisions will have a direct and immediate impact, helping to shape strategy, scale teams, and redefine leadership in a rapidly evolving business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a global brand:&lt;/strong&gt; Create deeper, more sustainable connections with our customers, putting them at the heart of every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefit from long-term wealth creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Your compensation is heavily weighted toward equity, directly aligning your personal success with the company&#39;s future through our Virtual Stock Option (VSO) and Restricted Stock Unit (RSU) plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrive in a high-performance environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with ambitious, intellectually curious peers on a global scale, enjoying an environment built for empowerment and speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GAQ327R300&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Databricks is seeking a Senior Counsel to scale our international Public Sector compliance program by providing practical, risk-balanced compliance and integrity advice for priority EMEA and other international markets. In this role you will partner closely with our in-region Public Sector contracting legal team and cross-functional stakeholders to enable responsible growth, and develop scalable guidance that works across jurisdictions.&amp;nbsp; You will also localize other elements of our global compliance program, advising in-region business teams and leading investigations as needed in compliance with local requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a trusted advisor to Public Sector stakeholders by providing timely, business-oriented compliance guidance that helps unblock deals and GTM execution across international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead localization of our Public Sector compliance guidance for priority countries/regions, translating global principles into locally workable approaches while keeping standards consistent across jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally to deliver clear guardrails and options that support growth while appropriately managing risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable playbooks, templates, and enablement so that teams can move faster with greater confidence and less reinvention across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead internal investigations as needed–this is anticipated to be a smaller portion of the role but may vary by business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define ‘how we work’ internationally by improving consistency and clarity across jurisdictions, so stakeholders know what to do, when to escalate, and how to proceed responsibly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified attorney in good standing in an EMEA jurisdiction with several years of post qualification experience (mix of in-house/law firm experience preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising on public sector procurement/government contracting or related compliance issues in EMEA; comfortable navigating multi-jurisdiction complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong builder mindset: you enjoy turning complex fast-moving ambiguous issues into scalable guidance and systems (templates, playbooks, enablement) that teams can actually use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigations experience is a plus (scoping, interviews, evidence management, clear written outputs), with sensitivity to local requirements and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, executive-ready communicator who can frame risk, options and recommendations; strong cross-functional influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2190 - Software Engineer - Web Platform (Mid-level)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Code, we create digital experiences with heart - blending creativity, technology and insight to build products people love and businesses rely on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not just building software; we’re helping our partners shape better digital futures through collaboration, experimentation and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Professional / Mid-Level Software Engineer, you’ll join a cross-disciplinary product team responsible for building and evolving modern web platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on engineering role with a strong focus on &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;C#/.NET,&lt;/strong&gt; working across the services, APIs, integrations and application architecture that power modern websites and digital products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll contribute production code, collaborate closely with experienced engineers and help deliver accessible, secure, observable, performant and maintainable software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams build distributed, composable web applications using technologies including: TypeScript, Node.js, C#/.NET, React and cloud services, predominantly within &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Azure&lt;/strong&gt;. You don’t need to be a specialist in every part of the stack, but you should be comfortable understanding how the pieces of a modern web platform fit together - from browser and application code through APIs, integrations and the cloud infrastructure they run on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work alongside other engineers, designers, delivery managers and client stakeholders, supported by experienced engineers while continuing to develop your technical skills, engineering judgement and understanding of modern software delivery practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evolve modern, cloud-hosted web platforms using TypeScript and C#/.NET.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop APIs, backend services, server-side applications and integrations with third-party and SaaS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the web stack, contributing where appropriate to TypeScript and React applications as well as the services behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate technologies such as headless CMS, search, personalisation, analytics and other composable platform services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help design and evolve distributed and composable web architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and contribute to how applications are deployed, configured, monitored and operated in Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cloud infrastructure and services such as application hosting, serverless functions, storage, networking, monitoring and secrets/configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to engineering practices including automated testing, CI/CD, code quality, observability and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to cloud-native applications using modern DevOps and Infrastructure as Code practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help ensure platforms are accessible, performant, secure, resilient, observable and operationally supportable in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineers, designers, delivery managers, strategists and client stakeholders as part of a cross-disciplinary product team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with experienced engineers to develop your technical capability and contribute to technical discussions, implementation decisions and architectural thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the wider engineering discipline at Code by sharing knowledge, learning from others and helping improve how we build and deliver technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’d Love to See Experience With:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial experience building modern web applications or web platforms using TypeScript and/or C#/.NET. - &lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working knowledge of both TypeScript and C#/.NET, with stronger experience in at least one. - &lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing APIs, backend services and integrations.- &lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of how modern web applications work across the browser, application, API and infrastructure layers.- &lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience working with applications hosted in Microsoft Azure or a comparable cloud platform.- &lt;strong&gt;Knowledge Essential, Experience desired&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of cloud infrastructure concepts such as application hosting, serverless compute, networking, identity, configuration, secrets, logging and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD, modern DevOps practices and Infrastructure as Code.-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern web technologies such as Node.js and React.- &lt;strong&gt;Desired, not essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of engineering fundamentals including testing, maintainability, performance, security, observability and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with distributed or composable architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with headless CMS, search, personalisation or similar web platform technologies is desirable but not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within collaborative cross-disciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a willingness to learn from and support others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for building thoughtful, well-engineered digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team and Culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join one of our cross-disciplinary product teams, working alongside Product Strategy, UX, Engineering and Delivery specialists to create meaningful digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Code, we value collaboration, curiosity and continuous improvement. We aim to create an environment where engineers can do their best work, grow their skills and contribute to shaping how we build technology together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3996 - SEO Associate Director - Organic Search, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The SEO Associate Director - Organic Search&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;leads end-to-end SEO and AI search strategy across enterprise-level client accounts, taking ownership of performance, strategic roadmaps and delivery while acting as a trusted senior partner to clients. Working closely across Content, Digital PR, Editorial, PPC, Media and Analytics, the role ensures strategies are integrated, commercially focused and deliver measurable results. They will also oversee forecasting, billing and scopes of work, identify opportunities for account growth, develop junior and mid-level talent, and ensure clients and teams stay ahead of the evolving SEO and AI search landscape.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an SEO Associate Director,&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end SEO and AI search strategy across key enterprise-level client accounts, ensuring best-in-class delivery aligned with commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of SEO performance, reporting and strategic roadmaps, driving implementation and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide senior leadership in client meetings and QBRs, building trusted relationships with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the delivery of SEO/GEO deliverables, ensuring exceptional quality and strategic relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Content, Digital PR, Editorial, PPC, Media and Analytics teams to ensure integrated campaign delivery and clear, actionable briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own account forecasting, billing and scopes of work, proactively identifying growth opportunities and supporting new business initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line-manage, coach and develop junior and mid-level team members, providing clear guidance, career development support, and quality assurance across their work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of SEO and AI search developments, translating emerging trends into actionable recommendations, while supporting internal training, knowledge sharing and process development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years’ experience in specialist SEO roles, ideally agency-side with exposure to enterprise-level clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on knowledge of all SEO disciplines: technical SEO, content optimisation, internal linking, authority-building, and advanced analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client-facing experience with the ability to communicate complex concepts clearly to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience leading SEO strategy, forecasting performance, and influencing broader marketing activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven line management experience, with the ability to coach, develop and delegate effectively while maintaining high standards of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to brief and collaborate with cross-channel teams including Digital PR, content, CRO, paid media and UX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisational skills with the ability to manage multiple workstreams, timelines and resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, solutions-focused mindset with the ability to anticipate challenges and mitigate risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial understanding, including forecasting, billing, scopes of work and resource management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A drive for excellence, continual learning, and staying ahead of the evolving SEO and AI-search landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4148 - Senior Associate, AV – Reckitt&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a diligent buyer withTV buying experience and has some knowledge across other AV channels such as Online Video, Addressable TV, OOH TV, Cinema and Radio, so they are equipped to work on one of the UK’s biggest and most forward-thinking advertisers – Tesco. There will also be opportunities to be involved in the planning across these channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some experience in TV buying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the UK TV marketplace, along with other AV media such as Radio, Cinema and VOD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail is key&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and be able to prioritise tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and enthusiasm to work on huge clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of industry media buying tools (all media e.g. BARB, Media Ocean, Caria, Prisma and Jet)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pro-actively forge relationships with media owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially astute and excellent negotiation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and good communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and ability to build strong relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent numeracy skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all billings are accurate and all financial queries and issues are resolved in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicating booked plans to implementational planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driven &amp;amp; committed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi skilled in media buying&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3648 - Senior Associate, Planning, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fantastic opportunity to join the team as an Senior Associate. This is an extremely autonomous role giving you the chance to enhance your expertise as a media planner, working across a range of award-winning brands. You&#39;ll have the chance to input heavily into the strategic planning and delivery of multiple multichannel campaigns and will be given a range of planning responsibilities that will help you grow into an excellent, well-rounded planner. Aside from this, you&#39;ll be part of an extremely strong team who always strive to deliver best-in-class planning work, pushing industry boundaries whilst maximising returns for our clients’ businesses so this is an excellent team to learn and develop in if you are looking to take the next step in your career.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the principles of marketing and advertising, as well as an understanding of media concepts and terms, creative and budget requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in developing media strategy skills as well as experience implementational media delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem solving skills and a desire to find a “better way”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to multi-task, prioritise and manage expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Honesty and integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm under pressure and able to juggle multiple projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be enthusiastic, helpful and collaborative, and be seeking an environment where you can learn, develop, and actively contribute to the evolution of a key agency account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally you would have been working for at least two years a similar role at another agency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3719 - Director, SEO, Global Client Solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About OpenMind&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: A Leading WPP Media Brand&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenMind by WPP is an integrated agency model drawing on talent from across WPP. It has been created to accelerate the European transformation for Nestlé’s media function. Core to the solution is the advanced best data and technology capabilities, fuelled by WPP’s investment in AI, to maximise the impact of Nestlé media investment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenMind oversees Nestle&#39;s media activity in Zone Europe. With dozens of countries, +450 team members, and regular new product launches, the account is looking for an AI Discoverability Lead to provide strong SEO and GEO leadership for Nestle categories, supporting Nestlé&amp;nbsp;Search Leads and AI Leads. Being above-market, the role offers plenty of variety, with an enjoyable balance between driving growth for brands, strategic consultancy and laying the framework for excellence, ensuring we’re delivering change at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will spearhead efforts to ensure elevated AI Discoverability across categories. You will be a regional champion of Nestle’s success framework in this space, overseeing the implementation of the theory into both strategic and activation level layers. You will ensure universal understanding of the above at every level of our teams above-market and in-market, partnering with digital specialists, media planners and category leads. You will be a conduit point between teams which impact AI Discoverability, ensuring scopes are aligned in purpose through to effective completion. Operationally, there will be a focus on partnering with categories to ensure each has a respective plan in place which is best-in-class, utilising latest available resources efficiently in a prioritised manner, focussed on the generation of measurable end results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a unique opportunity to raise the bar for AI discoverability across ZEUR, working with some of the biggest brands on the planet eager to showcase their supremacy online. As the AI Discoverability Lead in the Above Market Zone team, you’d be leading a group of AI / GEO / Search specialists holding authority across the Zone. You will be partnering with brands to ensure they have a clear strategy in place to maximize on the visibility opportunity available, which will include working with brands at varied stages of digital maturity. A key part of this role is developing your sizeable supporting team of specialists who will be practically involved at every level, crawling sites, assessing data and developing solutions to achieve enhanced AI visibility. You will help drive the education of the wider Local Market teams on the approach to ensure the same principles ring true across the region, driving excellence further still. As such, excellent operational team management is essential to ensure all stakeholders are working in unison towards the strategic vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build operational AI discoverability excellence across ZEUR, managing varied stakeholders to ensure the successful running of a significant total client budget across above-market and in-market teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-level GEO / SEO KPI management and market governance to effectively track performance across Zone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dominate the delivery of best in-class strategies at a zone level to maximise performance across Nestle Europe. These strategies then need to be adapted and rolled out for specific business units. It is vital we’re taking advantage of the short-term opportunities for Nestle whilst laying strong foundations for future changes in search.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the ZEUR Nestle Search and AI Leads to ensure the strategic focuses align with those of the specific business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective, positive management of a few direct reports and a wider team of AI, GEO and SEO specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build up a constructive, positive rapport with senior client contacts and third-party enablers including content agencies and development teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A confident presenter with the ability to take what can often be quite complicated concepts, distilling them down into key actions and outcomes for relevant stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to progressing initiatives focused on driving share of voice and positive consumer experiences on-site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date on the latest trends in all things AI discoverability (SEO / GEO / LLM) and adapting the strategy accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Knowledge &amp;amp; Abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impressive track record of delivering multimarket SEO strategies and charting subsequent improved business performance. We view our clients’ businesses as our own and we expect you to as well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with businesses which are made up of multiple business units and the complexity of how those businesses overlap from a search perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge across all areas of GEO from technical to content and Digital PR. Depending on the market and the business units, the best opportunities will vary, as will the subsequent requirements from the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and supporting multilayer operations across above market, clusters, and in-market. With the focus on ensuring consistent excellence and delivery of the overall strategy at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to demystify all things SEO / GEO / LLM to ensure clients and the wider team understand what actions are required to achieve compelling results. An ability to craft and deliver powerful stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing a talented, multi-faceted team united in a common effort to produce best in class activity as a cohesive, positive unit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Digital more broadly, engaging with the specialism in a passionate, intellectual capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a wide range of AI / SEO / GEO tools. Experience working with partners to drive enhancements to get the most from the tool suites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience using PowerPoint and delivering presentations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm under pressure and able to always think about the bigger picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
