&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-life-balance:&lt;/strong&gt; Teamwork and personal collaboration in the office are central to us, but we also offer a regular remote work day for added flexibility. In addition, you can compensate for overtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on:&lt;/strong&gt; You receive 26 days of paid leave plus an additional 4 compensation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first:&lt;/strong&gt; Health benefits and dedicated Mental Health Awareness Days put your health and well-being front and center.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect:&lt;/strong&gt; Grow through our diverse training programs and leverage internal career initiatives for your personal development across the WPP network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job:&lt;/strong&gt; Look forward to unforgettable team events, exclusive employee discounts, and many more highlights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself:&lt;/strong&gt; Everyone is warmly welcome here – diversity and equal opportunities are at the core of who we are.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is what you move:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Manager Media Solutions | Engagement (m/f/d),&lt;/strong&gt; you are the key contact for our agencies on programmatic and Media Solutions topics. You collaborate closely with internal teams, drive product adoption, and support agencies in identifying new business opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Acting as the main programmatic contact for assigned agencies, providing guidance, building strong relationships, and supporting their daily programmatic activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Team Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Working closely with your fellow Engagement Manager, Product Management, and Campaign teams to ensure seamless coordination, shared responsibilities, and reliable agency support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Development &amp;amp; Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborating with Product Management to develop and enhance Media Solutions products, understanding their functionalities, and introducing new solutions to agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; Knowledge Sharing:&lt;/strong&gt; Preparing and delivering engaging onboarding sessions, product trainings, and workshops to strengthen agency expertise and drive product adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Business &amp;amp; Strategic Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Supporting agencies in new business opportunities and pitches, conducting competitor and benchmark analyses, and identifying opportunities for growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Communication &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Keeping relevant stakeholders informed about product developments, progress, and roadmaps while preparing clear, insightful reports and presentations when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The following qualities distinguish you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Media Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; At least 3–4 years of professional experience in digital media, ideally with exposure to programmatic advertising, media technology, or agency collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media &amp;amp; Programmatic Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of the digital media landscape, marketing concepts, and programmatic advertising, combined with a genuine interest in emerging media technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Presentation &amp;amp; Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong ability to explain complex topics clearly, deliver engaging presentations and workshops, and communicate confidently with different stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; A structured, solution-oriented mindset with the ability to analyze information, identify opportunities, and develop practical recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational &amp;amp; Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Confident use of Microsoft Excel, PowerPoint, and Outlook, with strong attention to detail and the ability to maintain quality in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; Collaboration Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent English and German, combined with a collaborative, proactive approach and enthusiasm for working with agencies and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Furthermore you are: &lt;strong&gt;#media-tech-enthusiast #solution-finder #team-player&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this job sounds exciting to you, we strongly encourage you to apply, even if you don&#39;t have every qualification listed above.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our privacy policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for Germany, Austria and Switzerland for further information on how we process the data you provide. #LI-Promoted 14520&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Staff System Architect to be fully dedicated to the SNSPD product line, with a strong focus on leading the technical architecture and roadmap for our next-generation rack-mountable SNSPD (Superconducting Nanowire Single-Photon Detector) platform. This role is critical to defining and guiding the technical evolution of our cutting-edge cryogenic photon detection systems, ensuring architectural coherence across hardware, software, and integration domains while supporting our product vision and market requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a proven architect of complex, multi-domain instruments, whether from space systems, astronomical instrumentation, scientific or medical imaging, electron or advanced optical microscopy, semiconductor equipment, or comparable fields who can bring that system-level rigour to our platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW3980620 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243108471 BCX0&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be an integral part of the development process for IDQ&#39;s SNSPD platform, with applications across quantum computing, networking, and sensing. You will be at the intersection of quantum photonics, cryogenic systems engineering and embedded systems to create scalable, maintainable architectures for autonomous 24/7 detector operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will take ownership of the end-to-end system architecture of the SNSPD platform, ensuring alignment with a shared long-term product vision while translating product requirements into clear system-level designs and specifications. This includes defining system structure, interfaces, and key architectural decisions, as well as driving critical trade-offs across performance, cost, scalability, and integration. You will also align engineering execution with the architectural vision, guiding system integration and resolving complex cross-domain design challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, you will play a key role in shaping the technology roadmap and driving the evolution of the platform, continuously evaluating and introducing new technologies where relevant to maintain innovation and competitiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead system architecture, design decisions, and cross-functional alignment to ensure a scalable and high-performing SNSPD platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technology roadmap, integration, and innovation by evaluating and implementing new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced professional with a Master&#39;s degree (PhD preferred) in physics, electrical engineering, photonics, or a related field, and 7+ years of experience in the design of complex, multi-domain systems, with demonstrated ownership of system architecture. The ideal candidate has architected instruments or platforms of comparable complexity, combining optics or photonics with electronics, mechanics or thermal design, and embedded or software components and has proven experience integrating these technologies into cohesive, high-performing products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will demonstrate strong technical leadership across multidisciplinary teams, with the ability to clearly communicate complex system architectures to a wide range of stakeholders. This includes ensuring alignment, supporting informed decision-making, and driving successful collaboration across functions to deliver robust and scalable system designs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in system architecture and multi-domain integration, with strong system-level thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven technical leadership and communication skills, enabling alignment and effective decision-making across diverse teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in domains of comparable complexity: space instrumentation, astronomy, high-end microscopy or imaging, semiconductor or scientific equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with photonics, low-noise electronics, cryogenics, or vacuum systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SNSPDs, single-photon detection, or quantum systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience bringing industrialized or rack-mountable systems to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform Engineering team builds, secures and operates scalable infrastructure supporting cloud-managed SaaS products with on-premises components deployed at customer sites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Staff DevSecOps Engineer, you will provide the technical leadership for our software factory, defining how software is built, secured and released across the organisation. You will own the roadmap, architecture and tooling that enable every engineering team to deliver software securely, consistently and at scale, while remaining hands-on with automation, infrastructure and platform engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Architecture, Site Reliability Engineering, Cloud Operations and Product Development, you will drive an automation-first culture where secure software delivery, developer experience and operational excellence are embedded into every stage of the software lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define and evolve the software factory, including CI/CD platforms, release engineering, developer tooling, Infrastructure as Code, dependency management and software supply-chain security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver secure-by-default engineering practices through automated security controls, policy enforcement, vulnerability management, compliance automation and AI-driven workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mentor engineers, establish engineering standards and collaborate across technical teams to deliver scalable, secure and highly automated development platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the design, implementation and operation of the organisation&#39;s DevSecOps platform, ensuring software moves securely and efficiently from commit to production. You will develop reusable CI/CD pipelines, Infrastructure as Code modules and self-service developer capabilities that improve productivity whilst maintaining the highest security standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own release management, dependency and supply-chain security, security operations and hybrid infrastructure consistency across cloud and on-premises environments. You will also drive the adoption of agentic automation and AI-enabled workflows to reduce manual effort, improve operational efficiency and enhance software delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the software-factory roadmap, CI/CD platform, release engineering, Infrastructure as Code, internal developer platform and software supply-chain security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Embed security throughout the delivery pipeline through automated scanning, policy enforcement, vulnerability management, secrets management and continuous compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop agentic automation for pipeline operations, dependency management, release processes and operational support, while providing technical leadership, mentoring and engineering governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are an experienced DevSecOps or Platform Engineering leader with more than eight years of production engineering experience and recent hands-on responsibility for building and operating enterprise-scale CI/CD platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have designed production Infrastructure as Code, embedded security into delivery pipelines and delivered measurable improvements across software delivery, release management, dependency governance or vulnerability remediation. You are passionate about automation and continuously removing manual effort through tooling, scripting and intelligent workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8+ years of production engineering experience with recent hands-on responsibility for enterprise-scale CI/CD platforms, Infrastructure as Code and production automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience embedding security into software delivery through automated scanning, policy enforcement, vulnerability management and measurable operational improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong scripting and automation skills, with a demonstrated ability to simplify complex operational processes through reusable tooling and automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have deep expertise in modern software supply-chain security, internal developer platforms and secure software delivery. You understand how to balance developer productivity with governance, compliance and operational resilience, while creating platforms that engineering teams enjoy using.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring practical experience of AI-enabled software delivery, modern release engineering and cloud-native platform design, with a passion for building secure, scalable and highly automated engineering ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven expertise in software supply-chain security, including artefact signing, Software Bills of Materials (SBOMs), provenance and SLSA principles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing internal developer platforms, self-service engineering capabilities and release management processes, including expedited production releases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with agentic automation, AI or LLM security, and intelligent workflow orchestration within modern DevSecOps environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is based onsite in Geneva, Switzerland.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; 1919&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Staff Cryptography Engineer to join our team building post-quantum cryptography (PQC) hardware acceleration for HSM and network-appliance products. You will implement the software side of modern post-quantum algorithms: reference models, optimised implementations, and the test infrastructure that proves they are correct. This is a hands-on development role at the heart of applied cryptography, working with some of the most experienced cryptographic engineers in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will implement and maintain reference and bit-accurate models of ML-KEM, ML-DSA and SLH-DSA/LMS in C/C++/Rust and Python, develop constant-time software implementations of cryptographic functions, and build out the known-answer-test and test-vector tooling (NIST ACVP) used for verification and CAVP certification. You will contribute to the decomposition of algorithms into hardware-friendly building blocks (Keccak, NTT and polynomial arithmetic, samplers, encode/decode), support RTL and firmware engineers with algorithm questions and debugging, and help evaluate third-party cryptographic libraries, working under the guidance of our senior cryptography engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement reference models, optimised software and test-vector infrastructure for ML-KEM, ML-DSA and SLH-DSA/LMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support hardware and firmware teams with algorithm expertise, debugging and certification-oriented tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a candidate with a Master’s degree (PhD a plus) in Cryptography, Mathematics, Computer Science or a related field and at least five years of experience implementing cryptographic algorithms or security-critical software in C/C++ or Rust. You have solid understanding of modern cryptographic primitives and ideally first exposure to post-quantum schemes (lattice-based or hash-based) and their underlying mathematics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You care about correctness and write well-tested, readable code; you understand what constant-time implementation means and why it matters. Familiarity with NIST test-vector formats, CAVP/ACVP or certification-oriented development is a plus. Fluency in English is required; French or German is an advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on developer of cryptographic or security-critical software with strong C/C++/Rust skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid cryptographic foundations with the ambition to build deep post-quantum expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You want to grow into a world-class applied cryptographer by working on real products with demanding correctness and security requirements, and you enjoy the discipline of code that must be provably right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role at one of the fastest growing and most exciting quantum companies in the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive compensation scheme, benefits package, and equity plan designed to reward excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work models that let you balance your life, your family, and your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing training and development to keep your skills sharp and your growth on track&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A career development plan within the IonQ group’s companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic, close-knit environment where you collaborate with a global team of experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-driven culture built on trust, teamwork, and shared ambition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;What to expect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support the next phase of growth of its SNSPD platform, IDQ is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;R&amp;amp;D Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; to join its team in Geneva. This role targets a highly motivated PhD-level candidate with a strong background in experimental physics, optics, or engineering, and a drive to rethink and scale testing methodologies for advanced photonic devices. The position focuses on developing and implementing next-generation testing and metrology approaches to enable scalable, reliable, and high-throughput characterization of SNSPD technologies. The successful candidate will work at the intersection of device physics, optical testing, and system-level thinking, in close collaboration with R&amp;amp;D, engineering, and industrialization teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of advanced testing strategies for SNSPD devices, with a focus on scalability and throughput.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rethink and optimize existing characterization methodologies, including possibly the transition toward wafer-level testing approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and operate optical and cryogenic measurement setups for device characterization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse and interpret complex datasets to guide device design and process improvements while driving experimental investigations to understand performance limits and variability across devices and wafers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with fabrication, packaging, and system teams to ensure test compatibility with manufacturing flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document methodologies, results, and best practices in a structured and transferable way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in Physics, Engineering, or a closely related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in experimental physics or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in hands-on experimental work or engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience testing and characterizing optical or photonic systems (e.g., optoelectronic devices, waveguides, or similar platforms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of measurement science and metrology principles, with experience designing or improving experimental setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong data analysis skills, with the ability to extract meaningful insights from complex measurements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work autonomously while collaborating effectively across multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English, with French considered a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A PhD or Master’s degree in Physics, Engineering, or a closely related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong hands-on background in optics or photonics experimental work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working in industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is based onsite in Geneva, Switzerland.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; 1893&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ID Quantique (IDQ), part of IonQ, is a global leader in quantum-safe communications. We provide solutions to protect governments, telecommunication infrastructures, and banking &amp;amp; financial institutions from the “harvest-now, decrypt-later” threat, delivering both terrestrial and space-based quantum-safe networks in live operation globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Staff Cryptography Engineer to join our team building post-quantum cryptography (PQC) hardware acceleration for HSM and network-appliance products. You will implement the software side of modern post-quantum algorithms: reference models, optimised implementations, and the test infrastructure that proves they are correct. This is a hands-on development role at the heart of applied cryptography, working with some of the most experienced cryptographic engineers in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will implement and maintain reference and bit-accurate models of ML-KEM, ML-DSA and SLH-DSA/LMS in C/C++/Rust and Python, develop constant-time software implementations of cryptographic functions, and build out the known-answer-test and test-vector tooling (NIST ACVP) used for verification and CAVP certification. You will contribute to the decomposition of algorithms into hardware-friendly building blocks (Keccak, NTT and polynomial arithmetic, samplers, encode/decode), support RTL and firmware engineers with algorithm questions and debugging, and help evaluate third-party cryptographic libraries, working under the guidance of our senior cryptography engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement reference models, optimised software and test-vector infrastructure for ML-KEM, ML-DSA and SLH-DSA/LMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support hardware and firmware teams with algorithm expertise, debugging and certification-oriented tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a candidate with a Master’s degree (PhD a plus) in Cryptography, Mathematics, Computer Science or a related field and at least five years of experience implementing cryptographic algorithms or security-critical software in C/C++ or Rust. You have solid understanding of modern cryptographic primitives and ideally first exposure to post-quantum schemes (lattice-based or hash-based) and their underlying mathematics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You care about correctness and write well-tested, readable code; you understand what constant-time implementation means and why it matters. Familiarity with NIST test-vector formats, CAVP/ACVP or certification-oriented development is a plus. Fluency in English is required; French or German is an advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on developer of cryptographic or security-critical software with strong C/C++/Rust skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid cryptographic foundations with the ambition to build deep post-quantum expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You want to grow into a world-class applied cryptographer by working on real products with demanding correctness and security requirements, and you enjoy the discipline of code that must be provably right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role at one of the fastest growing and most exciting quantum companies in the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive compensation scheme, benefits package, and equity plan designed to reward excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work models that let you balance your life, your family, and your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing training and development to keep your skills sharp and your growth on track&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A career development plan within the IonQ group’s companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic, close-knit environment where you collaborate with a global team of experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-driven culture built on trust, teamwork, and shared ambition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is based at our Geneva, Switzerland office, with the option to work two days a week remotely.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Up to 10%&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; 1771&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;within the Quantum Platform – Devices division, you will play a key role in supporting a growing portfolio of cutting-edge products by taking ownership of day-to-day product operations. You will ensure product features are clearly defined, tracked throughout every stage of the product lifecycle and delivered successfully across cross-functional teams. Working closely with Engineering, Industrialisation, Production and Marketing, you will translate market and customer insights into product features for refinement by engineering teams, while leading the triage, planning and coordination of special customer projects. You will help optimise product lifecycle processes, ensuring efficient collaboration, smooth feature delivery and successful execution from concept through to launch.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own product operations, ensuring features are defined, tracked throughout the product lifecycle and delivered across cross-functional teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Translate market and customer insights into product features, while triaging, planning and coordinating special customer projects.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with Engineering, Industrialisation, Production and Marketing to optimise product lifecycle processes and drive efficient product delivery.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You will take ownership of the operational delivery of product management, ensuring products and features progress efficiently from validated requirements through development, industrialisation and commercialisation. Acting as the day-to-day product decision-maker within defined boundaries, you will drive cross-functional alignment, maintain product data integrity and coordinate delivery across multiple teams to ensure products are launched on time and to a high standard. This role is integral to enabling the Product team to scale effectively, providing operational ownership and supporting the successful delivery of an expanding product portfolio.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the operational delivery of product management, ensuring features progress from validated requirements through development, industrialisation and commercialisation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive cross-functional alignment, maintain product data integrity and coordinate timely delivery across the product lifecycle.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as the day-to-day product decision-maker within defined boundaries, enabling the Product team to scale beyond a single Product Manager.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;In this role, you will take ownership of feature delivery from end to end, defining requirements and acceptance criteria, coordinating engineering handovers, validating delivery and supporting successful commercial launches. You will manage non-standard sales opportunities by assessing feasibility, making configuration decisions within agreed boundaries and documenting exceptions, while ensuring full traceability from customer requests through to delivered capability. Working closely with Engineering, Industrialisation, Production, Marketing and Sales, you will coordinate cross-functional activities to remove blockers, maintain an accurate and prioritised Jira backlog, and respond to product enquiries from Sales. You will also prepare products for launch through documentation, training, pricing and sales enablement, maintain up-to-date product documentation, communicate complex photonic, cryogenic and networking architectures to a range of stakeholders, and represent the product in customer-facing activities including pre-sales support, technical discussions and trade shows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own end-to-end feature delivery, from requirements definition and engineering handover through to delivery validation, commercial launch and ongoing product documentation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coordinate cross-functionally with Engineering, Industrialisation, Production, Marketing and Sales, while managing Jira backlog integrity, product enquiries and non-standard sales opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support successful product adoption by communicating complex technical architectures, ensuring launch readiness, providing pre-sales support and representing the product in customer discussions and at trade shows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit with:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The ideal candidate will hold a Master&#39;s degree in Engineering, Physics, Photonics, Microengineering or a related technical discipline, combined with an action-oriented mindset and the confidence to make decisions in an environment of uncertainty. You will be able to understand and reason about complex hardware products involving photonics, cryogenics and networking technologies, while communicating effectively with both technical and commercial stakeholders. You will be comfortable representing products in customer-facing situations, including technical discussions, pre-sales meetings and trade shows, and have a strong understanding of manufacturing environments, including industrialisation constraints, production realities and supply chain considerations. You will also be confident resolving conflicting priorities, negotiating with stakeholders and developing deep expertise in quantum technologies, supported by advanced Jira proficiency, including workflow configuration, automation rules and custom field management.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Master&#39;s degree in Engineering, Physics, Photonics, Microengineering or a related technical discipline, with the ability to make product decisions autonomously within defined boundaries.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong technical, commercial and customer-facing communication skills, with experience discussing complex hardware products and representing products in pre-sales meetings and trade shows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Advanced Jira expertise, manufacturing and industrialisation knowledge, excellent stakeholder management and negotiation skills, and a genuine curiosity for deep-tech and quantum technologies.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is based onsite in Geneva, Switzerland.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; 1892&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ID Quantique (IDQ), part of IonQ, is a global leader in quantum-safe communications. We provide solutions to protect governments, telecommunication infrastructures, and banking &amp;amp; financial institutions from the “harvest-now, decrypt-later” threat, delivering both terrestrial and space-based quantum-safe networks in live operation globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Principal Engineer to own the classical cryptography architecture of our post-quantum cryptography (PQC) hardware acceleration products, targeting hardware security module (HSM) and network-appliance applications. Real-world quantum-safe systems are hybrid systems: classical and post-quantum algorithms operating side by side, with careful key management, crypto agility and migration paths. You will be the senior authority for this classical and hybrid layer, working alongside our PQC architecture leadership. The role demands fluency on both sides of the transition: deep classical mastery combined with a solid working command of the post-quantum algorithms and standards the products are built around.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the architecture and implementation strategy of the classical cryptographic functions of the product line: symmetric ciphers and modes (AES/GCM and beyond), hash functions (SHA-2/SHA-3, HMAC/KDF constructions), RSA/ECC offload, and true random number generation and entropy architecture (SP 800-90A/B/C). You will define the hybrid classical/post-quantum schemes (key establishment, dual signatures, composite certificates) and the crypto-agility mechanisms that allow customers to migrate safely, track the standardisation of hybrid and composite approaches (NIST guidance, IETF work on hybrid key establishment in TLS 1.3 and IKEv2, composite certificates) together with our PQC architects, guide RTL and software engineers implementing classical cores, technically evaluate third-party IP, and support FIPS 140-3 and CAVP certification of the classical algorithm suite. You will also own key-management and key-hierarchy architecture across the product, ensuring interoperability with deployed HSM, TLS and IPsec ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the classical and hybrid cryptography architecture of the product line: symmetric, hash, RSA/ECC, entropy and key management, and classical/PQC hybrid schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define crypto-agility and migration mechanisms that let customers move to quantum-safe deployments without breaking existing infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a candidate with a Master’s or PhD in Cryptography, Computer Science, Electrical Engineering or a related field and at least twelve years of experience implementing and architecting classical cryptography in real products, in hardware, software or both. You have deep command of symmetric and asymmetric primitives, modes of operation, key management and entropy generation, and you have taken cryptographic subsystems through FIPS 140-3 or Common Criteria evaluation. You also bring a solid working knowledge of the NIST post-quantum algorithms (ML-KEM, ML-DSA, SLH-DSA) and their deployment constraints: you do not need to be a lattice specialist, but you must be able to architect hybrid schemes with one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand the practical constraints of deployed security infrastructure (HSMs, PKI, TLS and IPsec ecosystems) and how hybrid classical/post-quantum schemes are standardised and deployed in practice. You write precise specifications, guide implementers effectively, and make sound architecture decisions under real-world interoperability constraints. Fluency in English is required; French or German is an advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven architect of classical cryptographic subsystems with certification experience (FIPS 140-3, CAVP, Common Criteria)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical knowledge of hybrid classical/PQC schemes, crypto agility and key-management architecture, with working command of the NIST PQC standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You believe that quantum-safe security is only as strong as the classical foundations it stands on. You enjoy being the guardian of correctness and interoperability in a programme pushing new technology, and you take pride in migrations that customers barely notice because they simply work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role at one of the fastest growing and most exciting quantum companies in the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive compensation scheme, benefits package, and equity plan designed to reward excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work models that let you balance your life, your family, and your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing training and development to keep your skills sharp and your growth on track&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A career development plan within the IonQ group’s companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic, close-knit environment where you collaborate with a global team of experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-driven culture built on trust, teamwork, and shared ambition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is based onsite in Geneva, Switzerland.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job ID:&lt;/strong&gt; 1891&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ID Quantique (IDQ), part of IonQ, is a global leader in quantum-safe communications. We provide solutions to protect governments, telecommunication infrastructures, and banking &amp;amp; financial institutions from the “harvest-now, decrypt-later” threat, delivering both terrestrial and space-based quantum-safe networks in live operation globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Distinguished Leader to provide the overall technical leadership for our post-quantum cryptography (PQC) hardware acceleration programme, part of our quantum-safe product portfolio targeting hardware security module (HSM) and network-appliance applications. As the most senior technical authority of the programme, you will own the end-to-end architecture, from cryptographic algorithm and standards strategy to an FPGA-based product architecture with a clear path to ASIC, and you will set the technical direction across the cryptography, hardware, software and security disciplines involved. This is a rare opportunity to shape a strategic security product line at one of the few companies where quantum-safe security is the core business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will define the system architecture and microarchitecture of a multi-algorithm PQC accelerator implementing ML-KEM, ML-DSA and SLH-DSA/LMS: hardware/firmware partitioning, throughput and lane sizing derived from real customer traffic models, and a stable core-interface specification that lets cryptographic cores evolve behind a frozen contract. You will own the algorithm and standards strategy (NIST FIPS 203/204/205, CNSA 2.0, FIPS 140-3), drive make/buy and IP-licensing decisions, and shape the security and certification architecture together with our side-channel and compliance specialists. You will set the technical roadmap, arbitrate the hardest cross-domain design decisions, mentor the senior engineers who own each domain, and represent the programme externally with customers, standards bodies, certification laboratories and executive stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end architecture and technical roadmap of a PQC hardware-acceleration product line (algorithms, microarchitecture, interfaces, and security/certification strategy) from concept to shipping product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the programme’s most senior technical authority: set direction across disciplines, mentor senior engineers, and represent the technology with customers, standards bodies and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a candidate with a Master’s or PhD in Electrical Engineering, Computer Science, Cryptography or a related field and fifteen or more years of experience architecting complex digital security hardware, including deep, hands-on exposure to cryptographic implementation with genuine post-quantum depth. You are a recognised authority in your field, evidenced by shipped market-defining security products, contributions to standards, publications or patents, and you have taken accelerators, secure elements or HSM-class systems from specification to production more than once.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are equally credible discussing lattice-based cryptography with a cryptographer, timing closure with an FPGA designer, and certification strategy with a FIPS laboratory, and you can defend an architecture in front of a demanding customer or executive committee. You make well-reasoned build/buy/partner decisions under uncertainty and raise the technical bar of everyone around you. Fluency in English is required; French or German is an advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised architect of cryptographic or security hardware products, with authoritative depth in PQC algorithms and standards (FIPS 203/204/205, CNSA 2.0, FIPS 140-3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distinguished-level technical leadership: sets direction across domains, mentors senior specialists, and represents the company externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You thrive on ambiguity and ownership, turning a strategic mandate into an architecture, a plan and a working product. You lead through technical authority and clarity rather than hierarchy, you hold quality and security to an uncompromising standard, and you are motivated by building products that will help define quantum-safe infrastructure for the next decade.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role at one of the fastest growing and most exciting quantum companies in the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive compensation scheme, benefits package, and equity plan designed to reward excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work models that let you balance your life, your family, and your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing training and development to keep your skills sharp and your growth on track&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A career development plan within the IonQ group’s companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dynamic, close-knit environment where you collaborate with a global team of experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-driven culture built on trust, teamwork, and shared ambition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Register your interest below. This is an expression of interest, not a job application, and it does not start an assessment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Looking to start full-time in 2027? Our Graduate Quantitative Researcher (2027 Start) role is currently open.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.optiver.com/join-us/jobs/quantitative-research-and-machine-learning/amsterdam/graduate-quantitative-researcher-2027-start/?gh_jid=8585609002&quot;&gt; Apply here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy using mathematics and code to investigate difficult questions, you could make a direct contribution to Optiver’s success in global markets. As a Graduate Quantitative Researcher, you’ll work across the full research process, from framing the question and choosing the data to building, testing and deploying models. Machine Learning is central to the work, whether you’re extracting signals, forecasting prices or modelling relationships. Our data, compute and production infrastructure let you test ideas quickly, understand where they fail and decide what to investigate next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our researchers believe in academic discourse and invite fellow researchers, traders and engineers to challenge each hypothesis. Different perspectives help improve the question, the model and how it performs in production. Through constant testing, analysis and refinement, you’ll help our quantitative models adapt as markets evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your onboarding&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll&amp;nbsp;participate&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ONPObMHh-k8&quot;&gt;Global Optiver Academy&lt;/a&gt;, a structured&amp;nbsp;onboarding programme for graduates. It gives new joiners a shared foundation in how Optiver trades, builds systems, and manages risk before they move into their teams.&amp;nbsp;As part of your onboarding,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;gain exposure to the AI tools and technologies that support research and development across the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the team you join, you&#39;ll own the research end to end. That could include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building models for pricing, forecasting and signal discovery, choosing the statistical, mathematical or Machine Learning methods that best fit the problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working across petabytes of market, order-flow and unstructured data to find signals that improve strategies as conditions change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring models in production and using live behavior to refine your assumptions and decide what to investigate next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using deep learning and AI-enabled workflows to shorten the loop from hypothesis to evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with researchers, traders and engineers to shape problems and understand how system constraints affect performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for aspiring Quantitative Researchers who are versatile and creative in innovating and suggesting new solutions. In return, we&#39;ll give you the freedom to pursue your ideas and implement them right into our production systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In terms of skills and qualifications, we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An academic degree in Engineering, Physics, Maths, Econometrics, Computer science or equivalent, with outstanding academic achievements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming experience in any language (preferably Python, but C, C++, Basic, JAVA, etc. are also a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to apply concepts of probability, calculus and linear algebra&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive attitude and eagerness to constantly improve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written English language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talent colleagues, working collaboratively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 50 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 paid vacation days in your first year, increasing to 30 from your second year onwards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training opportunities, discounts on health benefits, and fully paid first-class commuting expenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast, lunch and dinner, world-class barista coffee, bi-weekly chair massages, Friday afternoon drinks, a bicycle to explore Amsterdam and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities, including access to conferences and tech events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive relocation packages and visa sponsorship where necessary for expats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW TO REGISTER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you interested in furthering your career on one of the most dynamic and exciting trading floors in Europe?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Complete the short form below with your details and upload your CV in English. Registering your interest is not a job application, and it does not start an assessment process. We&#39;ll contact you when we have opportunities that match your profile.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kindly note that we do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via our &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot;&gt;recruitment inquiry form.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage applications from candidates from any and all backgrounds, and we welcome requests for reasonable adjustments during the process to ensure that you can best demonstrate your abilities. Please let us know if you would like to request any reasonable adjustments by contacting the Recruitment team via the &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment&quot;&gt;contact form&lt;/a&gt;, selecting &quot;Reasonable Adjustments&quot; as the subject of your inquiry&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For answers to some of our most frequently asked questions, refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.optiver.com/join-us/stories/optiver-europe-recruitment-faq/&quot;&gt;recruitment FAQ&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For applicants based in India, our entry route is via the placement office internship hiring season (July/August).&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At Graviton, we don&#39;t believe the best trading strategies come from following established playbooks. They come from asking better questions. Why does a pattern exist? What is driving it? Is it real or just noise? Can it be explained, modelled and turned into an edge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Quantitative Researcher, you&#39;ll work on those questions every day. You&#39;ll investigate market behaviour, develop quantitative models, build and test hypotheses and turn insights into trading strategies, working alongside researchers and technologists in an environment where an idea on a whiteboard can reach live trading quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a role where the answers are in a textbook. The problems are open-ended, the data is enormous, and finding the answers is the job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal candidates are rigorous thinkers who genuinely enjoy mathematics, programming and figuring out things that aren&#39;t obvious, based in our Singapore, London, Amsterdam or US offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Work On&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across quantitative research and systematic trading, taking ideas through the full lifecycle: question, hypothesis, experiment, model, validation, strategy, production. Depending on your team and research interests, your work would include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discovering predictive patterns and sources of alpha from billions of market events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulating hypotheses about market behaviour and designing experiments to test them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applying probability, statistics, optimization and machine learning to build predictive models and quantitative signals for systematic trading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing robust backtests and statistical tests to distinguish genuine signals from noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with large and complex datasets to uncover patterns that aren&#39;t immediately visible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigating market microstructure and how markets behave at different timescales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluating strategy performance, identifying weaknesses and continuously refining models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing research infrastructure and AI-powered tools and agents that make experimentation faster and analysis deeper&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with technologists to translate research ideas into efficient, production-ready systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exploring new techniques in machine learning, statistics and quantitative finance to uncover new sources of edge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No two research problems are the same. Good research finds patterns. Great research understands why they exist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Successful researchers at Graviton discover new sources of alpha and turn them into robust trading strategies, build models that hold up under real market conditions and not only in backtests, develop a deep understanding of market behaviour, create research frameworks and tools that make the broader team more effective, work with technologists to take ideas from research into production, and communicate complex quantitative ideas clearly and rigorously. Your impact isn&#39;t measured by how many models you build. It&#39;s measured by the quality of the ideas you discover and what those ideas enable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for exceptional problem solvers who genuinely enjoy mathematics, programming and figuring out things that aren&#39;t obvious.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in a quantitative discipline such as mathematics, physics, computer science, statistics, operations research or machine learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No active backlogs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Python and/or C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grounding in probability, statistics, linear algebra and optimization, with experience in machine learning, statistical modelling or data analysis, whether through coursework, research or personal projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with large, complex datasets, and strong analytical thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for applying quantitative thinking and rigorous research to solve open-ended problems in markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to explain complex ideas clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prior exposure to quantitative research, algorithmic trading, market microstructure, competitive mathematics or machine learning is valuable, but we care more about how you think than whether you&#39;ve worked in finance before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Culture&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than specific tools or techniques, we care how you think. We look for people who are curious enough to keep asking why, analytical enough to separate signal from noise, persistent enough to pursue difficult problems, intellectually honest enough to abandon an idea when the evidence says so, and humble enough to keep learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Graviton, researchers sit alongside technologists on specialized trading teams that operate with significant autonomy. You&#39;ll have meaningful ownership of research problems from day one: forming your own hypotheses, challenging existing approaches and following the evidence wherever it leads, with the infrastructure and datasets to test ideas at scale, competitive compensation, and a culture where the best idea wins regardless of who proposed it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Markets are among the most complex systems humans have ever created, and they never stop changing. Neither should our thinking. Every day, someone asks a better question and finds an answer nobody had. That someone could be you.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Jamf, we believe in an open, flexible culture based on respect and trust. Our track record and thriving work environment all stem from the freedom we grant ourselves to get the job done right. We take pride in helping tens of thousands of customers around the globe succeed with Apple.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The secret to our success lies in our connectivity, while operating with a high degree of flexibility. Work-life balance remains our priority while feeling connected is important to maintain our strong culture, achieve our goals, and thrive as #OneJamf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do at Jamf:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise New Logo Account Executive MEA &lt;/strong&gt;is a results-driven hunter responsible for identifying, pursuing, and closing new enterprise logos for Jamf. Focused exclusively on net-new acquisition within the enterprise segment (organizations with 1,000+ employees), this role requires strong prospecting discipline, the ability to manage complex multi-stakeholder sales cycles, and the consultative acumen to position Jamf&#39;s Apple Enterprise Management solutions at the executive level. Success in this role is defined by consistent pipeline generation, new logo attainment, and laying the foundation for long-term customer partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is offered in &lt;strong&gt;The Netherlands only&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably for candidates located in the Randstad and used to travel to MEA&amp;nbsp;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you can expect to do this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Logo Prospecting &amp;amp; Pipeline Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a targeted outbound prospecting motion to identify and engage net-new enterprise accounts within an assigned segment or territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop segment fluency — understanding buyer personas, common objections, industry-specific compliance needs, and Apple ecosystem maturity within target accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing, Business Development, and Channel partners to execute coordinated account-based prospecting that feeds a healthy, qualified pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain consistent pipeline coverage and hygiene, ensuring sufficient volume and stage diversity to meet and exceed quota targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Sales Cycle Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full sales cycle from initial outreach and discovery through proposal, negotiation, and close — navigating the complexity typical of enterprise buying processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and engage multiple stakeholders across IT, Security, Finance, Legal, Procurement, and executive leadership to build multi-threaded relationships within target accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a structured qualification methodology (e.g., MEDDPICC) to assess deal health, prioritize effort, and improve forecast accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate enterprise procurement processes, including security reviews, DPAs, and SLAs, with support from Jamf Legal and internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver compelling business cases, demonstrations, and ROI presentations tailored to the priorities of diverse buying audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Deal Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure initial commercial agreements that are competitive, value-aligned, and appropriately sized to facilitate a strong land — with long-term expansion in mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate contract terms with support from Jamf Legal and Finance, maintaining deal momentum while protecting Jamf&#39;s commercial interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain competitive positioning in deals where incumbents or alternatives are present; articulate Jamf&#39;s differentiated value with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner &amp;amp; Ecosystem Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build productive working relationships with Apple&#39;s enterprise sales team and Jamf&#39;s channel and reseller partners to generate introductions and support deal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage partner resources appropriately to accelerate pipeline and strengthen account access, especially within named accounts or complex organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting, Reporting &amp;amp; Team Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate, up-to-date records in Salesforce, including account activity, pipeline stage, and deal notes, to support individual and team forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide consistent, reliable monthly and quarterly forecasts, with clear visibility into deal status and expected close timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share learnings from the field — win/loss patterns, competitive intelligence, objection themes — to contribute to team and segment knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years of B2B SaaS or technology sales experience with a demonstrated track record of meeting or exceeding quota (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional working proficiency in English is required and Arabic is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex enterprise sales cycles involving multiple stakeholders, including IT and executive-level buyers (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to generate pipeline through outbound prospecting, partner engagement, and marketing collaboration (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with a structured sales qualification methodology (e.g., MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, SPIN) and ability to apply it to assess deal health (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work effectively in both direct and indirect (channel/partner) selling models (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills; able to deliver clear and persuasive presentations to technical and business audiences (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Salesforce or equivalent CRM for pipeline tracking, forecasting, and activity documentation (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultative, solutions-oriented selling approach with the ability to connect technology to business outcomes (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Apple enterprise ecosystem, endpoint management, or SaaS security solutions (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating enterprise procurement processes including DPAs, SLAs, and security reviews (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed and resilient; able to manage long sales cycles and ambiguous buying processes with discipline and focus (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel in the MEA territory around 40%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY AND PRIVACY REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in ongoing security training is mandatory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established security protocols will be adhered to, sensitive data will be handled responsibly, and data protection practices are followed, including understanding relevant privacy regulations and reporting breaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acknowledging the Jamf Code of Conduct, where applicable security and privacy policies can be found, is a requirement of all roles at Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Why Jamf?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Named a Fortune Best Workplace for Millennials, 2021.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We offer a clear and defined sales career path. Our main goal is to help you successfully step into our Account Executive role, but there are many ways to advance your career at Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We train and then we give you the room to grow. Our Jamfs can explore the vertical career path, as well as the horizontal, to discover new interests and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You don’t have to be a techie to be a Jamf. Our best-in-class sales focused Bootcamp training provides you with the technical and product knowledge required to confidently talk with customers about Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We set achievable targets, help each other out, and share best practices across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You will have the opportunity to make a real and meaningful impact for more than 70,000 global customers with the best Apple device management solution in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We put people over profits – which is why our customers keep coming back to us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We encourage you to simply be you. We constantly seek and value different perspectives to ensure Jamf is a place where everyone feels comfortable and can be successful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;23 of 25 world’s most valuable brands rely on Jamf to do their best work (as ranked by Forbes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What it means to be a Jamf?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are a team of free-thinkers, can-doers, and problem-crushers. We value humility and the relentless pursuit of knowledge. Our culture flows from a spirit of selflessness and relentless self-improvement - driving both personal growth and collective progress throughout our company. We unite around common goals while respecting personal approaches, believing that fulfilled individuals create a thriving, vibrant workplace.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our aim is simple: hire exceptionally good people who are incredibly good at what they do and let them do it. We provide the support and resources to let everyone be their authentic, best selves at work, at rest, and at play. We are committed to supporting the continual improvement of Apple in the workplace, the organizations that rely on them and the people who keep it all running smoothly.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above it all, waves our banner of #OneJamf – and the knowledge that when we stand together, we accomplish so much more than we could alone. We seek individuals who share this unwavering journey toward growth to join us in our quest for constant improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does Jamf do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Jamf extends the legendary Apple experience people enjoy in their personal lives to the workplace. We believe the experience of using a device at work or school should feel the same, and be as secure as, using a personal device.&amp;nbsp;With Jamf, customers are able to confidently automate Mac, iPad, iPhone and Apple TV deployment, management, and security – anytime, anywhere – to protect the data and applications used by employees in the workplace, students learning in the classroom, and streamline communications in healthcare between patients and providers.&amp;nbsp;More than 2,500 Jamf strong worldwide, we are free-thinkers, can-doers, and problems crushers who are encouraged to bring their whole selves to work each and every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get social with us and follow the conversation at #OneJamf&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Jamf is committed to creating an inclusive &amp;amp; supportive work environment for all candidates and employees. Candidates with disabilities or religious beliefs are encouraged to reach out if they need additional support or alternative options to our recruiting processes to accommodate their disability or religious belief. If you need an accommodation, please contact your Recruiter or Recruiting Coordinator directly. Requests for accommodation will be handled confidentially by Recruiting and will not be shared with the hiring manager. Jamf is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate against individuals who request reasonable accommodation for disability or religious beliefs. To request accommodations please email us at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Typeform is fully remote by design. For this role, we can hire candidates based in the UK, Ireland, Germany, Portugal, Spain or The Netherlands&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Paid Marketing Strategist to help us rethink how Typeform approaches paid acquisition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll own and grow key channels including TikTok, YouTube, Google Performance Max and Uber Ads, while helping us test new opportunities across areas such as audio and CTV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is a hands on role with real ownership. You’ll manage significant media budgets, build channel strategy, develop campaigns, work closely with our creative teams, and help us understand the true business impact of our investment through MMM, incrementality testing and other measurement approaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll join the Acquisition team within Marketing and partner closely with Creative, Product Marketing, Data, RevOps and Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy and day to day performance of key paid social and display channels, including TikTok, YouTube, Google Performance Max and Uber Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a multichannel strategy that helps Typeform reduce its reliance on paid search and find new sources of efficient growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage six figure monthly media budgets, making decisions based on customer acquisition, revenue, CAC and LTV to CAC performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, launch and optimise campaigns that drive Typeform signups and new paid customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn creative ideas into campaigns by briefing and partnering closely with copywriters and designers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run A/B tests across creative, copy, landing pages, placements, audiences and bidding strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and test new channels such as audio and CTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and develop our paid marketing measurement approach, including Marketing Mix Modelling, incrementality studies and alternative measurement frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design experiments that help us understand the incremental impact of our campaigns rather than relying solely on traditional attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our Tracking and Data teams to strengthen our measurement capabilities as digital advertising continues to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share insights, results and recommendations across Marketing and the wider business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Typeform’s broader full funnel acquisition strategy across demand creation and demand capture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around six or more years of hands on and strategic experience in performance marketing and media buying.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing paid social and video channels, ideally including TikTok, YouTube and Meta.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning campaigns from initial idea and creative brief through implementation, optimisation and measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of managing six figure budgets and delivering efficient performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with MMM, incrementality testing or other measurement methods beyond traditional attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and confidence working with campaign performance, conversion funnels, CAC and LTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of digital measurement, from tagging and attribution through to incrementality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing creative and UGC assets for paid social channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to balance creative thinking with strong commercial judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and a willingness to figure things out. When you do not know the answer, you know how to find it, whether that means speaking to the right person, digging into documentation or using AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working across teams and influencing partners in Creative, Product Marketing, Data and Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating with uncertainty. You are happy testing ideas, learning from the results and changing direction when the data tells you to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in SaaS or B2B lead generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across sales technology or marketing technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing external agencies or digital production partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ad servers and campaign trafficking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job__description body&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;The Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;Grafana Labs is looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Major Account Executive &lt;/strong&gt;based in The Netherlands who will be responsible for managing some of our largest enterprise accounts in the &lt;strong&gt;Benelux region&lt;/strong&gt;. You will identify, nurture and close opportunities within your assigned install base, manage forecasts and track customer data. We&#39;re strong proponents of a consultative sales approach - learn about the customer&#39;s needs first before talking products. Your expertise will be critical in helping articulate the value of our products, work with the customer during the trial phase and hand off a strong relationship to our Growth team. Ideally, you come from a technical background and have sold technical products before.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Identify new opportunities to expand Grafana usage within a set of current customers&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Meet and exceed individual quarterly and annual sales goals&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Manage all aspects of the sales process (prospecting, sales meetings, product demos, proofs of concept, proposals, negotiations and account management)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cultivate sales through outbound prospecting and inbound leads&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Be able to understand and convey the value of both Grafana Cloud and Grafana Enterprise&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Become an expert in managing your sales pipeline in Salesforce&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Manage quote creation, order processing, and day-to-day customer requests&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ Years of experience in infrastructure technology sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated history of consistent goal achievement in a highly competitive environment (top 10% performer)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energetic, upbeat, entrepreneurial, tenacious team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and with demonstrable experience in high velocity technology companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will need to be an excellent communicator in all channels (in person, online, in writing) and able to form strong working relationships both in person and virtually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English &amp;amp; Dutch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with open source technology is a significant advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Command of the Message and MEDD(P)ICC is ideal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Reward&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In the Netherlands, the OTE compensation range for this role is EUR 280,000&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt; - EUR 293,000.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed throughout the interview process. All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Expect open decision-making and regular company-wide updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven&lt;/strong&gt; – Autonomy and support to ship great work and try new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source Roots&lt;/strong&gt; – Built on community-driven values that shape how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Teams&lt;/strong&gt; – High trust, low ego culture that values outcomes over optics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Pathways&lt;/strong&gt; – Defined opportunities to grow and develop your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approachable Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Transparent execs who are involved, visible, and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate People&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team of smart, supportive folks who care deeply about what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person onboarding &lt;/strong&gt;- We want you to thrive from day 1 with your fellow new ‘Grafanistas’ to learn all about what we do and how we do it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance is Key&lt;/strong&gt; - We operate a global annual leave policy of 30 days per annum. 3 days of your annual leave entitlement are reserved for Grafana Shutdown Days to allow the team to really disconnect. &lt;em&gt;*We will comply with local legislation where applicable.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Grafana Labs is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from everyone regardless of race, colour, nationality, origin, caste, sex, gender reassignment identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, religion or belief, disability, veteran status, genetic information, pregnancy, maternity, marital, family or carer status, or any other characteristic which is protected by local law. We believe that equality and diversity build a strong organisation, and we work hard to ensure that is the foundation of our organisation as we grow.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Grafana Labs may utilize AI tools in its recruitment process to assist in matching information provided in CVs to job postings. The recruitment team will continue to review inbound CVs manually to identify alignment with current openings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how your personal data is used once you’ve applied to a job, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/legal/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to become the go-to destination for students across Europe to find a trusted home away from home. We make every step of the rental journey simple and seamless, so students can focus on what really matters: studying, exploring, and growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With HousingAnywhere, Kamernet, and Studapart under our roof, we’re Europe’s largest student rental platform. You’ll find us in Rotterdam, Paris, and Cergy, always guided by our four core values: Ownership, We are enablers, We are changemakers, and We are connectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Engineering Manager at HousingAnywhere, you will play a critical role in leading the evolution&amp;nbsp;of our platform with your vision. You will join the Product Engineering team, leading one of our product&amp;nbsp;teams that owns a key part of the renter journey, from finding and applying to booking, moving in and&amp;nbsp;staying. You will collaborate closely with other product teams and departments, from Sales to&amp;nbsp;Marketing to Customer Support, serving both internal and external customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect you to lead and enable your team to deliver effectively, setting the right technical direction&amp;nbsp;while leveraging the talent present in your team. While we expect you to be technical, your focus will&amp;nbsp;be on strategy and leadership rather than heavy hands-on coding.&amp;nbsp;AI is changing how we build software, and we are going all in. You will lead a team that uses AI in its&amp;nbsp;daily work, from writing and reviewing code to planning, testing and decision-making. We expect you&amp;nbsp;to be a hands-on practitioner who uses these tools yourself and pushes your team to get the most out&amp;nbsp;of them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the Backend we mostly use Go, Postgres, and Redis. At the Frontend we use React, Typescript,&amp;nbsp;and NodeJs. Our infrastructure runs on GCP, and we are heavy users of Kubernetes. Our Architecture&amp;nbsp;is a distributed architecture made of several &quot;Modular Monoliths&quot;. We practise DevOps, Continuous&amp;nbsp;Delivery, Domain Driven Design, and Contract Driven Development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your daily role, your impact will be defined by key pillars: Delivery, Direction, Talent, and Culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead your team to scope and plan projects, identifying bottlenecks and improving processes. You will ensure engineering standards are held high and remove impediments to provide a smooth developer experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direction&lt;/strong&gt;: Create alignment and a sense of urgency through well-crafted strategies and goals. You will direct your team to relate their work to organizational goals and provide a clear sense of purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent&lt;/strong&gt;: Nurture talent with regular feedback and performance reviews, supporting career growth. You will identify skill gaps and execute hiring strategies to acquire top talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead by example to foster ownership, empowerment, and autonomy. You will promote a growth mindset, value diverse perspectives, and address problems to maintain a healthy team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft&lt;/strong&gt;: Equip your team to solve problems with pragmatic, sustainable solutions. You will foster engineering excellence, support knowledge-sharing, and keep the team up to date with the latest technical trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-first engineering&lt;/strong&gt;: Make AI a core part of how your team works, not an experiment on the side. You will drive adoption of AI-assisted development and review, define what good practice looks like, and measure the effect on delivery speed and quality. You will keep the team’s standards high while the way of working changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 years minimum of experience in the field managing a team, focused on building and maintaining complex domains and distributed architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong recent experience in managing high-performing, diverse, and inclusive teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge in Distributed Systems and Domain Driven Design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to set technical direction without getting bogged down in heavy hands-on work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real, recent experience using AI tools in your own day-to-day work and getting your team to do the same. For us AI is central to how we deliver, so if you see it as a nice-to-have, this role is not the right fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holidays, minimum-based not maximum!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position based in our Rotterdam office with hybrid working policy (2 office days).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work remotely for up to 2 months per year!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1,000 EUR personal development budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete coverage for commuting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal equipment, including laptop and ergonomic setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gym membership discount with Wellhub.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dutch/English classes budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Variable pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diverse international community (46+ nationalities).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet-friendly office in Rotterdam city centre.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-building events and after-work drinks every Friday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Purpose&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SentinelOne, we are driven by a clear purpose: to give the advantage to those who secure our future. As AI reshapes how organizations build, operate, and innovate, the responsibility to protect them becomes more critical than ever. When you join SentinelOne, your work helps protect global enterprises, critical infrastructure, and the technologies shaping tomorrow. If you are motivated by meaningful challenges and want your impact to be real, measurable, and global, you will find purpose here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SentinelOne is a company at the intersection of AI and security, pioneering a new operating model for cybersecurity. Our AI-native platform unifies protection across endpoint, cloud, identity, data, and AI systems to deliver autonomous detection and response with clarity and speed. By combining real-time analytics, intelligent automation, and a unified data foundation, we reduce noise, simplify complexity, and empower security teams to focus on what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are builders, problem-solvers, and innovators committed to shaping the future of security. If you are excited to solve hard problems alongside talented, mission-driven people, we invite you to help us build a safer future for humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Are We Looking For?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who are relentlessly curious and committed to continuous learning. AI is reshaping every function across our business, and we enable every team member, regardless of role or level, to build fluency in AI tools and concepts. Those who thrive here actively seek out new solutions, experiment thoughtfully, and apply what they learn to drive better, faster, smarter outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Sales Operations Manager, you will support the EMEA South Go-To-Market team as a trusted advisor to sales leaders, enabling consistent, predictable, and repeatable hyper-growth through sales discipline, streamlined processes, and a strong operating cadence. You will partner with the EMEA South Leadership Team on GTM design, business analysis, and metrics while managing the day-to-day rhythm of the business, with field productivity as your north star. This role is based in Amsterdam, Prague, or Milan, and is ideal for someone who wants to be an active voice driving change rather than a passive spectator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Will You Do?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Primary responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the EMEA South Operations Lead and trusted advisor to key sales leaders, actively participating in the EMEA forecasting process, advising on changing pipeline dynamics, and challenging forecasts to ensure accuracy, predictability, and transparency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Area business metrics including performance, trends, headcount, and investment models, and lead the development of key sales metrics and business review materials, monitoring performance and taking action to optimize business results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the annual sales planning process, including Area, Regional, and District goal assignments, territory management updates, and sales compensation plan changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps in the infrastructure needed to support Sales and develop solutions, with a strong focus on AI, that align to the team’s overall vision, while educating and training teams on key sales processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an active voice that drives change with Area leadership, and align with the Global Revenue Operations team to represent the needs of the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Skills and Knowledge Will You Bring?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 to 10 years of experience in Sales, Revenue, or Field Operations supporting sales teams, with a strong emphasis on enabling teams to be hyper-productive, ideally within organizations selling subscription security software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and scaling processes that support a hyper-growth business model, including documenting key processes in a publicly traded environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven analytical ability to turn disparate datasets into insightful analytics, including developing messaging, data visualizations, and executive-level presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with a key tech stack including Salesforce, Clari, Tableau, MS Office, G-Suite, and AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to influence sales teams, build collaborative relationships across functions, and translate the complex needs of the field. A Bachelor’s degree in Finance, Management, Technology, or Economics is required, and an MBA is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why SentinelOne?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is redefining how the world operates and rewriting the rules of security in real time, and SentinelOne was built for this moment. From day one, we architected an AI-native platform designed to operate at machine speed, not as an add-on to legacy systems but as the foundation itself. If you want to build where innovation and impact move together, this is that place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our Sentinels with comprehensive, competitive benefits designed to support you and your family:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive leave benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-neutral parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance &amp;amp; Financial Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insurance and medical allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Perks &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global home office allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter or work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Lifestyle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
