&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is on a mission to power the connected operations that keep the world moving. As our Senior Corporate Recruiter in EMEA, you will lead G&amp;amp;A hiring across multiple functions and countries. You will partner with VPs and senior leaders, build sourcing strategies that work, and give every candidate a standout experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if these excite you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to impact the industries that run our world:&lt;/strong&gt; Your work helps keep the lights on, get food into grocery stores and workers home safely, as we digitize large sectors of the global economy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Impact Role:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct visibility and influence with regional and global business leaders in a fast-growing organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are the architect of your own career:&lt;/strong&gt; Put in the work and this role won’t be your last at Samsara, with countless opportunities to experiment and master your craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best:&lt;/strong&gt; At Samsara, we win together and support each other, surrounded by a high-calibre team that pushes you to do your best.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cutting-Edge Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with best-in-class, AI-forward recruiting technologies and data-driven strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead G&amp;amp;A hiring across EMEA as a generalist: Support, Marketing, Customer Success, Legal and IT roles, switching context fast to keep every business moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with VPs and senior leaders across regions: calibrate on scope, bar and market reality, and push back with data when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build creative sourcing strategies across LinkedIn, referrals and other channels, tailored to each function and country and backed by EMEA market intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the pipeline from sourcing to onboarding, with an exceptional candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to refine recruiting strategy, forecast hiring needs and influence hiring decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion diversity, equity and inclusion through impactful hiring practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with People, Legal, Finance and Mobility to streamline hiring, including country-specific requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor peers and foster a culture of learning in the recruitment team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed Samsara&#39;s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 6+ years of proven full-cycle recruiting experience, preferably in a tech organisation with a very high hiring bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven generalist experience hiring across several corporate functions (e.g. Support, Marketing, Customer Success, Legal, IT).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have recruited across multiple EMEA regions and understand how markets and employment requirements differ by country.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have exceptional stakeholder management abilities and executive presence, with experience advising and influencing VPs and switching context rapidly and comfortably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a strong communicator: concise, professional and pro-active, with a clear point of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovation mindset: you&#39;re comfortable implementing new tools, technologies, and methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-forward: we would like to see strong analytical skills when looking into hiring data and forecasting hiring needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You optimise the use of the AI tools available to create a better candidate experience and efficient workflows. No AI slop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of EMEA talent market trends, turned into actionable strategies for each function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven outbound sourcing for specialist talent (e.g. Legal, IT) in a competitive market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to shape and build Samsara&#39;s teams across EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-visibility role: build connections and influence with Samsara&#39;s VPs and regional and global business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passionate, innovative and AI-forward team committed to excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we build for the people who keep the global economy moving. We want owners, not passengers, which is why &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;our rewards&lt;/a&gt; are designed to fuel high-impact builders. Our compensation program delivers above-market total compensation through a combination of base salary, performance-based bonus/variable pay, and equity (for eligible roles) in a high-growth public company. We meaningfully differentiate pay for our top performers, who have the opportunity to earn above-market compensation that can outpace the broader market over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond compensation, we provide the foundations that enable long-term success: a flexible, employee-led remote model, a professional development stipend, comprehensive health and parental leave plans, and more. If you’re ready to build for the long term and own the outcome, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Samsara, we embrace a flexible working model that caters to the diverse needs of our teams. Our offices are open for those who prefer to work in-person and we also support remote work where it aligns with our operational requirements. For certain positions, being close to one of our offices or within a specific geographic area is important to facilitate collaboration, access to resources, or alignment with our service regions. In these cases, the job description will clearly indicate any working location requirements. Our goal is to ensure that all members of our team can contribute effectively, whether they are working on-site, in a hybrid model, or fully remotely. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company and in the specified work location, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging at Samsara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, and other characteristics protected by law. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems and want to ensure that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email &lt;a ---------- or &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DrM6DFQUiSgfPtCVA&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Authenticity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href=&quot;https://hiretofu.com/privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;Tofu&lt;/a&gt;, a fraud detection tool, to validate the authenticity of applications and protect against identity fraud. This ensures we are connecting with real people and allows us to prioritize genuine candidates. Please see Samsara’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraudulent Employment Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in ----- ----- or ----- For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is based in London. We combine data, technology, creative content, and paid media to crack brands’ business problems and drive revenue through a variety of digital marketing solutions, from advertising campaigns to augmented reality and chatbots. Our clients include eBay, INEOS, Mammut, Easyjet, PepsiCo, Loreal and Logitech.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creative Strategy Directors at DEPT® are at the heart of growth invention, bringing together brilliant strategic craft, creative thinking, cultural understanding, and a broader perspective on business and technology. We’re looking for someone who has mastered the fundamentals of strategy but isn’t interested in playing by the old rules. Someone shaped by the world&#39;s most renowned creative agencies, with the experience and instinct to challenge convention, connect disciplines, and help define what modern marketing looks like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great strategy is less about following frameworks and more about asking the right questions, finding unexpected connections, and creating the conditions for brilliant work. The playing field is bigger than advertising. It spans culture, commerce, creativity, media, technology, communities, and the ambitions of our clients. We need someone who sees opportunity in all of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the real challenge:&lt;/strong&gt; Get under the skin of our clients&#39; businesses, their audiences, and the world around them. Connect the dots across culture, commerce, company, competition, capability, community, and creative ambition to uncover the opportunities others might miss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find the tension:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn complexity into clarity. Find the sharpest insights, the most interesting tensions, and the questions that unlock new possibilities for brands and businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft the springboard:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop strategic briefs, provocations, narratives, and thought-starters that inspire creative teams, give ideas direction, and make brilliant work possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invent growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Look beyond the brief and beyond the boundaries of traditional marketing. Identify new opportunities for clients, connect disciplines, and help shape bigger, more ambitious growth challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think horizontally:&lt;/strong&gt; Move comfortably across brand, creative, social, digital, media, technology, and experience. You don&#39;t need to be an expert in everything, but you know how to connect the dots and bring the right people together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace what&#39;s next:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore how emerging technologies, AI, and the evolving roles of humans and agents are reshaping customer journeys, business operations, and the opportunities for our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Move at pace:&lt;/strong&gt; Be comfortable with ambiguity, trust your instincts, and get hands-on. You know when to dig deeper, when to challenge the obvious, and when to get a good idea out into the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate the floor:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring your experience, point of view, and curiosity to the wider team. Challenge the thinking, inspire the people around you, and help make the work (and the people around you) better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s the core of it. Beyond that, we&#39;re looking for someone who cares deeply about the craft of strategy, the power of creativity, and the potential of people and businesses. Someone with a point of view, a healthy disregard for convention, and the energy to help build something new.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic craft:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of experience, ideally gained in leading creative agencies. You have strong foundations in brand and creative strategy, and the work to show for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative instinct:&lt;/strong&gt; You know what makes an idea interesting, unexpected, and powerful. You can spot the potential in a thought and help turn it into work people care about.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A broader horizon:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re as interested in what happens beyond advertising as you are in advertising itself. Social, digital, media, technology, business, culture: it&#39;s all part of the picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connected thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t think in silos. You connect the dots between audience, brand, business, culture, competition, capability, and creativity to find opportunities for growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultural fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a deep understanding of British (advertising) culture and an instinct for what&#39;s shifting in the world around us. You&#39;re curious about people, platforms, movements, and the things shaping what comes next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An appetite for what&#39;s next:&lt;/strong&gt; You’re interested in how AI, new technologies, and changing behaviours are creating new opportunities for brands and businesses. You&#39;re willing to explore, experiment, and challenge your own thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurial spirit:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re not waiting for the perfect brief or the next big assignment. You spot opportunities, make things happen, and bring energy to building something new.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A point of view:&lt;/strong&gt; You have your own perspective on strategy, creativity, and the industry. You&#39;re confident enough to challenge convention, open enough to change your mind, and curious enough to keep learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You lead through the work. You&#39;re as comfortable getting stuck into a brief, shaping a thought, or working alongside a creative team as you are guiding a room or presenting a bigger vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team player:&lt;/strong&gt; You know the best work comes from bringing people together. You collaborate generously, challenge constructively, and leave egos at the door. You&#39;re interested in bigger challenges, not bigger titles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, hybrid working policy (2-3 days from the office, depending on location) and the opportunity to work from abroad for 13 weeks a year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24 vacation days per year and the possibility to buy an unlimited number of extra vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DEPT®/YOU Learning Menu and DEPT®/YOU Special Programs. Develop your skills with courses and programs tailored to your needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay happy and healthy with a contribution to your health through the OpenUp platform, gym and wellness discounts, and healthy lunches at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a discount on your lease bike and ride in style. You can also enjoy hassle free-commutes with an NS Business Card.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified B Corp® since 2021, has been named a&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.nl/en/certification/certified/dept&quot;&gt; Great Place To Work since 2022&lt;/a&gt; in the Netherlands and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big, small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with all of them. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can discover even more employee benefits&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/nl-nl/employee-benefits/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

