&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical depth and adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; You have strong expertise in Mobile Development (Android, iOS or both) and can contribute beyond it. You don’t need equal expertise in every layer, but you understand how your work interacts with the wider system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical capability with coding agents:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve used agents to deliver working software and can explain how you guide them, improve unsuccessful approaches and verify their output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code fluency and engineering judgement:&lt;/strong&gt; You can navigate unfamiliar code, trace behaviour, diagnose problems and make precise changes. You can assess an implementation regardless of who — or what — wrote it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product judgement:&lt;/strong&gt; You connect technical choices to user needs, care about the quality of the experience and distinguish a useful reduction in scope from a shortcut that puts users at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You move work forward through uncertainty, explain trade-offs clearly, seek out expertise and take responsibility for the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve led complex projects through ambiguous requirements, made decisions with lasting consequences and helped other engineers develop their judgement while remaining hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mobile teams work with Swift and SwiftUI on iOS, Kotlin and Jetpack Compose on Android, and Rust for cross-platform mobile development. You may bring depth in iOS or Android, or experience across both—there’s no expectation that you know every technology we use. The mix of platform focus and cross-platform work varies by team, and we value strong fundamentals and your ability to learn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Millions of people trust Proton with their privacy. We answer only to our users — not advertisers, not investors with conflicting agendas, not governments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Great Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Diverse, collaborative, and tight-knit, with people from MIT, Harvard, Stanford, Caltech, Cambridge, ETH, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; The right hardware and software to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; We invest in your growth. Proton is one of the fastest ways to accelerate your career — real challenges, real ownership, from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong health coverage, solid retirement options, generous leave, and wellness support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt; From day one, you have a real stake in what we&#39;re building. When Proton wins, you win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Offices across Geneva, Zürich, Barcelona, London, and more. You&#39;ll spend most of your time collaborating face-to-face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt; Lunch and snacks on us every day in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transport:&lt;/strong&gt; We cover public transport, bike allowances, or parking — whichever works for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working:&lt;/strong&gt; You own your schedule. Outcomes matter more than clock-in times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation range:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring across multiple experience levels for this position, with the following annual gross base salary ranges:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Junior / Mid-level: €45,000–€64,000&lt;br&gt;Senior: €64,000–€106,000&lt;br&gt;Staff / Highly experienced: Up to €135,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your level and compensation will be determined based on your skills, experience and performance throughout the interview process. We’ll discuss compensation expectations early in the process to ensure alignment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our commitment to diversity and inclusion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background, feel valued and empowered. We strive to create equal opportunities, promote open dialogue, and support continuous learning to ensure every voice is heard and respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate privacy notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you apply for a position, refer a candidate, or are considered for a role at Proton AG (&quot;Proton,&quot; &quot;we,&quot; &quot;us,&quot; or &quot;our&quot;), we store and process your information using Greenhouse, our recruitment platform. Two privacy policies apply to this information, together:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Greenhouse&#39;s Service Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;, which governs how Greenhouse, as our data processor, handles and secures the information within their platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://job-boards.eu.greenhouse.io/protongdpr&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Proton&#39;s Recruitment &amp;amp; Hiring Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, which governs how we, as the data controller, use, retain, and manage your information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use your information to evaluate your suitability for the role you&#39;ve applied for. We also retain it to consider you for future roles that may align with your background and skills, unless you ask us not to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once we no longer have a legitimate business need to process your information, we will delete or anonymize it. If you have questions about how we use or manage your data, or if you&#39;d like to access, correct, or delete it, contact our privacy team at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proton does not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than directly from candidates, and we will not pay a fee for any placement resulting from an unsolicited submission, even if the candidate is later hired by Proton.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ONSITE&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;The Autonomous Ops &amp;amp; Maintenance (ATOM)Team&amp;nbsp; is developing an innovative platform that leverages artificial intelligence and automated systems to empower engineering groups in safely executing complex operations and software maintenance. Their primary objective is to minimize repetitive toil while delivering the precise visibility, oversight, and trust necessary to run automated solutions in mission-critical environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consider it an intelligent virtual collaborator operating alongside development and infrastructure engineers, directly offloading routine operational overhead that currently requires manual intervention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Software Engineer to help us design and scale our foundational architecture. In this role, you will synthesize vast technical datasets into rich structured knowledge, engineer AI-driven components capable of analyzing intricate operational workflows, and construct highly reliable systems to execute automated modifications seamlessly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a greenfield initiative from inception to scale, shaping foundational product architecture, engaging directly with users to refine early concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build mission-critical solutions that customers depend on daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build fault-tolerant, horizontally scalable solutions running in multi-tenant environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 6+ years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a BS/MS/PhD in a scientific field or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable building and operating production services end to end: You will independently own features and components, work through ambiguous technical problems, and be responsible for the reliability, observability, and operational quality of what you ship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with large scale distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrated ability to use AI coding tools in day-to-day workflows and validate, critique, and refine AI-generated output&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus Point: You have experience with Kubernetes, workflow orchestration systems, or building AI agents&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth: &lt;/strong&gt;(Describe opportunities offered here)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intradepartmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, ability to join our Community Guilds (Datadog employee resource groups)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Inclusion Talks, our internal panel discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free, global mental health benefits for employees and dependents age 6+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive global benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Purpose/Mission - The role owns the infrastructure, network and cybersecurity workstream for&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PHENOGY&#39;s corporate IT infrastructure (cloud, network, endpoints, identities and access) and its interfaces with the Battery Energy Storage System (BESS) product environment. It translates business, product, operational, customer and regulatory requirements into secure, resilient and auditable infrastructure and security controls across the BESS lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cybersecurity governance and the Information Security Management System (ISO/IEC 27001)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security architecture of BESS connectivity (EMS, BMS, gateways, IoT, APIs) and secure data exchange with partners such as Heidelberg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backup, business continuity and disaster recovery for critical systems (BESS/EMS, ERP, CRM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management of infrastructure and cybersecurity projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Tasks &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as internal-facing and technical owner of the IT infrastructure and security landscape: network, firewalling and web filtering, Microsoft 365/Azure tenants, identity and access management, endpoints, backup, and secure remote/supplier access to BESS sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the asset and configuration inventory, network and security architecture documentation, risk register, vulnerability backlog, security policies and the infrastructure/security roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the risk management and vulnerability management cycle: periodic assessments, prioritisation, patching and remediation tracking across IT systems, applications, APIs and BESS connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and operate security monitoring, incident response, escalation paths, maintenance windows and problem management, together with external service providers (MSP/MSSP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define backup and retention policies (daily, monthly, yearly; 10+ years for critical data), offline/immutable backups, disaster-recovery runbooks and regular restore and DR tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define secure segmentation between corporate IT and the OT/BESS environment and secure remote access for O&amp;amp;M and field service, aligned with IEC 62443 concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide infrastructure, system-integration and cybersecurity support to the After Sales &amp;amp; Service framework once operational responsibility moves to the Service Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support B2B customer and audit requests: security questionnaires, tender requirements and compliance evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on when required: configure firewall rules, endpoint and identity policies, backup jobs and cloud security settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key Projects (2027 portfolio)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Management &amp;amp; Vulnerability Assessment (Jan–Feb 2027): assess risks and vulnerabilities across all systems and deliver a prioritised remediation plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BESS Security Architecture II (Jan–Mar 2027): secure the BESS architecture and data exchange with Heidelberg, building on the current BESS security baseline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Continuity &amp;amp; Recovery System (Feb–Apr 2027): offline backup and disaster recovery for critical systems such as BESS/EMS, ERP and CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network Improvements (Feb–Jun 2027): introduce firewalling and web filtering, which are not yet in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Threat Protection – ISO 27001 (Mar–May 2027): protect network and application traffic, including APIs and IP-based access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ISO 27001 Enhancements (ongoing): close control gaps, maintain policies and evidence, and prepare for audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take over operation of granular backup and advanced endpoint management, and provide security input to the PHENOGY IoT solution POC (BMS/EMS communication and REST APIs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Core Competencies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead assigned infrastructure and cybersecurity projects from initiation through closure, using structured scope, schedule, budget, dependency, risk, issue, decision and change control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create project charters, work breakdown structures, delivery plans, security requirements, test and DR-test plans, cutover plans, acceptance records and handover packages to operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate external suppliers (MSP/MSSP, network and firewall vendors, cloud providers, BESS/EMS partners) to resolve cross-functional blockers and escalate material decisions to the Head of IT and relevant governance bodies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide concise status reporting on progress, milestones, risk posture, vulnerabilities, incidents, suppliers and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Qualifications &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree or equivalent professional experience in information technology, computer science, information security, engineering or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in IT infrastructure and cybersecurity management, including responsibility for delivering projects, ideally in an international mid-sized company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with network security (firewalls, VPN, segmentation, web filtering, IDS/IPS), Microsoft 365 / Entra ID / Intune / Defender, and backup and disaster recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running risk assessments, vulnerability management and security incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience implementing or maintaining an ISMS according to ISO/IEC 27001.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating technical suppliers and multidisciplinary stakeholders across business, IT and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand operational technology and industrial-system boundaries without assuming ownership of safety engineering or embedded-control design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong documentation, risk management and executive-status reporting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional English; German or another relevant operating language is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strongly preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience securing Battery Energy Storage Systems, EMS, BMS, SCADA, PLC, PCS/inverters, industrial gateways, IoT or energy-data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of IEC 62443, NIS2 and the EU Cyber Resilience Act in mixed IT/OT environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Azure networking and security, Microsoft Sentinel / Defender XDR and enterprise firewall platforms (e.g. Fortinet, Palo Alto, Check Point).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with industrial protocols and secure integration patterns, including Modbus TCP, OPC UA, MQTT, REST APIs, API gateways and certificate/PKI management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with backup and DR solutions for cloud and hybrid environments, including immutable and offline backups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized credentials such as CISSP, CISM, ISO 27001 Lead Implementer/Auditor, GICSP, PMP, PRINCE2 or ITIL are advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decision-making authority: Approves infrastructure and security changes, firewall and access rules and security exceptions within the agreed policy framework and budget; may isolate systems or accounts during a security incident; escalates risk acceptance and major investments to the Head of IT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting Line: Reporting to Head of IT Direct reports: none (functional lead of external infrastructure and security providers)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workload: 100% - Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel: approx. 10% – PHENOGY offices, BESS customer sites and partner/supplier sites as required&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Become part of our eco-passionate expert team - a first-class team all around.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Benefit from flexible work hours as well as remote and on-site working in a modern sustainable office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;Enjoy various events, an amazing coffee machine, and the occasional coffee from our CEO (acting Barista)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;At PHENOGY, we highly value diversity, equality, and inclusion. It makes our company stronger. &lt;strong&gt;Our philosophy: one mindset, many minds.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;For recruitment and staffing agencies: PHENOGY works exclusively with selected recruitment partners under formal agreements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We do not accept unsolicited candidate submissions from agencies and assume no liability for claims made by unauthorized recruiters regarding our recruitment processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;PHENOGY AG is a leading innovator of battery energy storage technologies and solutions for the green electrification of the planet. Our team members work on future-proof and sustainable battery systems that are powerful, safe, and robust – with circularity as a central principle. Our technology partner network spans leading battery research institutes. PHENOGY is an environmentally and socially conscious enterprise. We are committed to fostering prosperity for the people and our planet, ensuring sustainable growth – starting in the area of our greatest expertise and impact: energy storage solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We energize the future.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(26, 0, 120);&quot;&gt;PHENOGY is seeking curious, entrepreneurial-minded energy pioneers to help shape our vision, systems, and growth; playing a key-role as we launch into our ambitious future. If you’re inspired by our mission, values, and drive to change how we energize the future — we’d love your application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced Manager who takes technical ownership how PHENOGY turns technology into system solutions from system strategy and architecture to the engineering that delivers it. You will define which applications we serve with which system solutions: Standard solutions configured from a modular kit of standard components, and application-specific solutions for selected target segments where a business case justifies them. Working closely with CTO, product lifecycle management and the business side, you make sure our engineering resources go where they create the most value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your Tasks &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Develop and own the system strategy: which applications we serve with which system solutions, and which belong to the standard kit or to application-specific solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Define and maintain the modular kit of standard components and reference architectures from which standard solutions are configured.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Evaluate application-specific solutions together with commercial product lifecycle management and the business side, including technical concept, effort, risks, roll-out potential and comparison with alternative scenarios, as input to a clear business case.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Prioritise engineering resources across standard and application-specific solutions to maximise return.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own the system architecture and interfaces between subsystems (BMS, PCS, EMS, thermal management, fire safety) and the system behaviour across hardware and software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own the structure of the verification and validation plan and decide which supplier evidence is sufficient for bought-in components.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead and develop the system engineering team, and steer technical partners and suppliers on system questions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Assess the system-wide impact of changes and run technical change decisions in line with our ISO processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Must have’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Degree in electrical engineering, power electronics, mechatronics, systems engineering or a comparable field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At least 8 years&#39; experience in the development or integration of battery energy storage systems, power electronics systems or comparable electrical energy systems, including system-level responsibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Solid understanding across battery systems, BMS, power conversion, thermal management and grid integration, and the ability to challenge specialists in each.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Proven experience in requirements engineering, architecture definition and interface management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience working with external partners, suppliers or contract manufacturers on complex technical systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strong leadership, decision-making and communication skills; able to align engineers, partners and management on technical trade-offs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Fluent in German and English.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nice-to-have’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with stationary BESS from concept to field deployment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with product lifecycle management and stage-gate processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Familiarity with relevant standards and grid codes, e.g. IEC 62619, IEC 62933, UL 9540, VDE-AR-N 4105/4110.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with systems engineering methods and requirements management tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Knowledge of functional safety and cybersecurity on system level&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Familiarity with sodium-ion or other emerging cell chemistries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience in leading technical teams or acting as technical lead in a growing company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We offer you:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Join a high-caliber environment that enables you to develop your full potential, shape your job, and take ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Participate in the development of PHENOGY and inspire the world to transition to sustainable energy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Become part of our eco-passionate expert team - a first-class team all around. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Benefit from flexible work hours as well as remote and on-site working in a new modern sustainable office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Enjoy various events and an amazing coffee machine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At PHENOGY, we highly value diversity, equality, and inclusion. It makes our company stronger. Our philosophy: one mindset, many minds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:567,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:357}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; Root, Switzerland&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Travel Readiness:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; Medium (partner, supplier and customer sites, mainly in Europe)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
