&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fin.ai/&quot;&gt;Fin&lt;/a&gt;, now part of Salesforce, is on a mission to help businesses provide perfect customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI Agent Fin is the highest-performing AI Customer Agent on the market today, enabling businesses to deliver impeccable, always-on customer support across the customer journey, from service, to sales, to ecommerce. Powered by our own AI models, Fin resolves complex customer issues end-to-end across every channel, with minimal set-up and integration. Fin can also be combined with our natively integrated Intercom help desk, giving modern support teams one single system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together with Salesforce, the #1 AI CRM, where humans with agents drive customer success, we&#39;re building the future of customer experience. Here, ambition meets action. Tech meets trust. And innovation isn&#39;t a buzzword, it&#39;s a way of life. The world of work as we know it is changing, and we&#39;re looking for Trailblazers who are passionate about bettering business and the world through AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to level up your career at the company leading workforce transformation in the agentic era? You&#39;re in the right place. Agentforce is the future of AI, and you are the future of Salesforce.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s the opportunity?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Fin becomes mission-critical for our most strategic customers, we’re growing our team of Forward Deployed Engineers to help bridge the gap between customer needs and product innovation. This is a hybrid role, based in either our London or Dublin office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer, you’ll work hands-on with strategic customers, partnering closely with our R&amp;amp;D and Go-to-Market teams to design and deliver high-impact solutions. You’ll go beyond implementation - helping shape product direction, influence roadmap decisions and ensure Fin delivers real, measurable business outcomes in complex, real-world environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited by ownership, creativity and solving ambiguous problems, and want to work at the frontier of applied AI while collaborating with Product, Engineering and Go-to-Market teams, this role offers a rare opportunity to combine technical excellence with real customer impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What will I be doing?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of Fin by helping customers unlock the power of our AI capabilities to automate and scale their support operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed deeply with strategic customers to understand their business challenges and technical requirements, and provide the insight needed to achieve outstanding results with Fin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on with customers’ technical teams as a trusted technical expert, coding side-by-side to drive projects through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Sales, Success and Product teams to ensure seamless customer experiences, successful project delivery and actionable product feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the evolution of Forward Deployed Engineering by codifying best practices and sharing insights from customer engagements to help the team scale and grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What skills do I need?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong engineering background and experience building software with real-world usage. Experience building a SaaS product is a plus, but not a requirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in AI and machine learning, and the ability to quickly build an understanding of novel problems, capabilities and architectures - including their trade-offs and limitations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills, with the ability to navigate organisational boundaries and bring people together to achieve the best outcomes for our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of at least one high-level programming language, such as JavaScript, Python or Ruby. It doesn’t need to be a language we use today - great people learn quickly and can introduce us to better ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to prototype and ship software quickly while maintaining a high bar for quality and a clear focus on business goals and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency using and writing REST APIs to integrate systems effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills. You can comfortably discuss the same topics with engineers and non-technical audiences, adapting the depth and detail as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel and work on-site with customers to build strong relationships and deeply understand their needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unleash Your Potential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join Salesforce, you’ll be limitless in all areas of your life. Our benefits and resources support you to find balance and be your best, and our AI agents accelerate your impact so you can do your best. Together, we’ll bring the power of Agentforce to organizations of all sizes and deliver amazing experiences that customers love. Apply today to not only shape the future — but to redefine what’s possible — for yourself, for AI, and the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the United States, compensation offered will be determined by factors such as location, job level, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. Certain roles may be eligible for incentive compensation, equity, and benefits. At Fin, we want to give people what they need to do the best work of their careers. Our benefits and programs are designed to support your health and wellbeing, your family, your time away from work, and your financial future. Offerings vary by location in line with local practices and requirements. Learn more about working at Fin and the benefits we offer at&lt;a href=&quot;http://fin.ai/careers&quot;&gt; fin.ai/careers&lt;/a&gt;. Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance and the Los Angeles Fair Chance Initiative for Hiring, Salesforce will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fin has a hybrid working policy. We believe that working in person helps us stay connected, collaborate easier and create a great culture while still providing flexibility to work from home. We expect employees to be in the office at least three days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a radically open and accepting culture at Fin. We avoid spending time on divisive subjects to foster a safe and cohesive work environment for everyone. As an organization, our policy is to not advocate on behalf of the company or our employees on any social or political topics out of our internal or external communications. We respect personal opinion and expression on these topics on personal social platforms on personal time, and do not challenge or confront anyone for their views on non-work related topics. Our goal is to focus on doing incredible work to achieve our goals and unite the company through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.intercom.com/careers&quot;&gt;core values&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforce is an equal opportunity employer and maintains a policy of non-discrimination with all employees and applicants for employment. What does that mean exactly? It means that at Salesforce, we believe in equality for all. And we believe we can lead the path to equality in part by creating a workplace that’s inclusive, and free from discrimination.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/know-your-rights-workplace-discrimination-illegal&quot;&gt;Know your rights: workplace discrimination is illegal.&lt;/a&gt; Any employee or potential employee will be assessed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications – without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, transgender status, age, disability, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other classifications protected by law. This policy applies to current and prospective employees, no matter where they are in their Salesforce employment journey. It also applies to recruiting, hiring, job assignment, compensation, promotion, benefits, training, assessment of job performance, discipline, termination, and everything in between. Recruiting, hiring, and promotion decisions at Salesforce are fair and based on merit. The same goes for compensation, benefits, promotions, transfers, reduction in workforce, recall, training, and education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The UK Value Engineering team is responsible for our largest Fortune500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with Data and AI. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis data &amp;amp; AI platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Value Engineer - Banking &amp;amp; FS&lt;/strong&gt; you are spearheading our mission of data-driven business transformation with our customers by owning their end-to-end value journey. You are their trusted technology &amp;amp; business advisor, helping organisations achieve their strategic goals and realize significant value using the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform. A Value Engineer has full responsibility for the end-to-end value journey of our customers – landing, expanding, adopting and renewing. Responsibilities include translating customers’ objectives into value assessments or proof-of-value projects, helping organisations understand where Celonis fits into their IT landscape and AI strategy, building specific Celonis business cases and demos, running value workshops, and engaging with multiple senior stakeholders to deliver value driven results and secure long term partnership agreements. Your skillset combines a strong understanding of technology at both strategic and practical levels with consulting skills around strategic thinking and program management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify &amp;amp; Frame Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● Discover and translate customers’ strategic priorities into high-impact Celonis use cases&lt;br&gt;● Advise organisations on how the Celonis platform fits into their existing IT landscape and AI strategy&lt;br&gt;● Build demos and business cases, leveraging industry benchmarks and best practices in order to win new customers&lt;br&gt;● Use hands-on tech skills (SQL/Python) to build out (AI) prototypes to bring the Celonis platform to life for new audiences&lt;br&gt;● Communicate the value opportunity and strategic roadmap to C-Level executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realize Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● Facilitate business value workshops and use Celonis to identify and qualify opportunities for process enhancement&lt;br&gt;● Derive improvement measures in core business functions and initiate improvement actions and enterprise-wide change initiatives&lt;br&gt;● Present results and realized value to senior management and C-level executives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● Responsible for the end-to-end customer value journey, landing, expanding, adoption and renewing&lt;br&gt;● Build a strategic expansion roadmap for customers embedding Celonis Process Intelligence as a strategic business transformation platform in their organization and therefore drive adoption and expansion&lt;br&gt;● Provide feedback to our product development teams to enhance the Celonis platform and Apps based on new use cases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data, Analytics, Applications &amp;amp; IT:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Good knowledge of Business Software / SaaS applications (e.g. SAP), Hands-on SQL and/or Python skills,, experience in collaborating with IT teams, experience developing dashboards and automations in tools like PowerBI or RPA, knowledge of and experience with AI-powered solutions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live for Customer Value:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in an analytical role with the objective to demonstrate or secure value through business data analysis, business process improvement and respective Software deployment. Ideally in a customer-facing role in Solution Consulting, Sales Engineering or IT/Management Consulting with a Business Software / SaaS Provider or a Consultancy. Alternatively in an Inhouse role (e.g. Center of Excellence for Data Mining / Analytics / Intelligence) within an Enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in identifying use cases for business process improvement and deploying improvement measures, being a change agent and training users/process owners to realize value Project Management: Experience in planning and managing project scopes, expectations and timelines. You will manage multiple projects across your aligned accounts that will be at different parts of the value journey. Also, you will leverage partners from the Celonis Ecosystem wherever possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in preparing and communicating (value) roadmaps and results to stakeholders and management, both internally and externally. Excellent communication and presentation skills in English and sovereign appearance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of the Finance and/or Supply Chain domain as well as strategic transformation initiatives (e.g. Shared Services Transformation or System Transformation)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Expertise in the Finance and Banking industry and the ability to develop a deep understanding of industry trends and strategic opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics or a comparable technical degree&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director Information Security Governance, within the Infosec GRC Team, the Senior Governance, Risk and Compliance Analyst will help deliver and support all aspects of Ocado’s Compliance, Audit, Assurance and Attestation Programs including SOC 1, SOC 2, PCI DSS, NIST CSF, NIS 2, ISO 42001 and UK Corporate Governance Code compliance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role also includes day-to-day management and coordination of the Cybersecurity Risk Register and Risk Management Program, as well as all aspects of legal and regulatory compliance as relevant to the Information Security domain including AI Governanace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will also support and contribute to wider Infosec GRC team’s responsibilities, including the Vendor Risk Management Program and Information Security policies framework.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a hands-on role within a dynamic function, the successful candidate will use their compliance and assurance skillset to make constructive contributions both within Infosec and discussions/projects we contribute to across the business.&lt;br&gt;Reporting to the Director Information Security Governance, the role holder will support the management of all aspects of Ocado’s Attestation Programs, including Security Risk Management, Vendor Risk Management Program, AI Governance and Information Security policies framework management. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’d like you to do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the SOC 1, SOC 2, PCI DSS, NIST CSF, NIS 2, &amp;nbsp;ISO 42001, AI Governance, UK Corporate Governance Code and other Compliance, Audit, Assurance and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attestation Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing audit testing, ensuring preparedness for accreditation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying control weaknesses and any mitigating controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, enhance and fine-tune controls to meet compliance and business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising teams on requirements to meet SOC1, SOC 2, PCI DSS, NIST CSF, AI Governance and other related compliance and regulatory controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create audit plans and frameworks based on new or existing requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing in-scope teams for external audits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence gathering, deficiency plans and presenting these to external auditors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Producing project status reports and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying project/program risks and produce risk reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organising and managing external audits, presenting evidence to the external auditors&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may be asked to perform tasks as required by management deemed as a reasonable request. This job description is a summary of the typical functions of the role, not an exhaustive or comprehensive list of possible role responsibilities, tasks and duties and is subject to review. The responsibilities, tasks and duties of the job holder might differ from those outlined in the job description and other duties, as assigned, might form part of the job.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge, Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years’ experience in performing IT Controls testing or managing SOC 2 Type 2, PCI DSS and ISO related audits in a large technology organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of cloud computing environments and attestation or certification programs for technology companies that provide SaaS solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience assessing and auditing controls in cloud-native environments (e.g. AWS, GCP), including shared responsibility models and SaaS-based architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of current information security standards, frameworks and regulations such NIS 2, GDPR, NIST CSF, UK Corporate Governance Code etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and collaborative approach, comfortable working in a fast paced environment prioritising multiple parallel activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyse security controls, while understanding the risk of certain controls not being in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively communicate security risks and impact to various business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organising and managing external audits, presenting evidence to the external auditors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have at least one of ISO 27001 (or other ISO) &amp;nbsp;related Lead Auditor, CISSP, CISA, CRISC, or CISM certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing IT Controls testing, and ensure readiness across applicable compliance frameworks. Ensuring preparedness for accreditation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication and stakeholder management skills, including guiding stakeholders on their compliance obligations within the business context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Producing project status reports and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in supporting our people with meaningful, flexible benefits that prioritise well-being and work-life balance. Here’s a snapshot of what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time to recharge:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days annual leave (rising to 27 after 5 years), plus the option to buy more - and 30 days a year to work from anywhere in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Private Medical Insurance from your first month, wellbeing support through specialist apps and EAP, plus Income Protection and Life Assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family-first policies:&lt;/strong&gt; 22 weeks paid maternity/primary carer leave and 6 weeks paid paternity leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial support:&lt;/strong&gt; Pension with employer matching up to 7%, share schemes (Sharesave &amp;amp; BAYE) and interest-free loans for train tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commuter perks:&lt;/strong&gt; Cycle to Work Scheme, Car salary sacrifice and free shuttle buses to/from Hatfield and Welwyn Garden City stations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exclusive discounts:&lt;/strong&gt; 15% off at Ocado.com with free delivery (starting in your first month) and up to 70% off at our Company Shop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be bold, be unique, be brilliant, be you. We are looking for individuality and we value diversity. We are an equal opportunities employer and we are committed to treating all applicants and employees fairly and equally. We are committed to making reasonable adjustments to provide a positive, barrier-free recruitment process and supportive work environment. If you have any support or access requirements, we encourage you to advise us at the time of application.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tenstorrent is leading the industry on cutting-edge AI technology, revolutionizing performance expectations, ease of use, and cost efficiency. With AI redefining the computing paradigm, solutions must evolve to unify innovations in software models, compilers, platforms, networking, and semiconductors. Our diverse team of technologists have developed a high performance RISC-V CPU from scratch, and share a passion for AI and a deep desire to build the best AI platform possible. We value collaboration, curiosity, and a commitment to solving hard problems. We are growing our team and looking for contributors of all seniorities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tenstorrent builds open, scalable AI compute, and Europe is a priority market for revenue growth. As BD Executive, Europe, you will own business development across the UK, Germany, France and other EU countries, deepening existing engagements and opening new ones with enterprise and government clients and system integrators. You will work with the International GTM team, partners and customers to turn technical interest in our hardware into commercial opportunities. This is a senior role on a team that may grow as the region does.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is remote, based out of London, Frankfurt, or another major EU city with required travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome candidates at various experience levels for this role. During the interview process, candidates will be assessed for the appropriate level, and offers will align with that level, which may differ from the one in this posting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales or business development leader with 10+ years of experience in solution selling for AI hardware, HPC or similar technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted by government and enterprise clients and system integrators, with strong relationships you can bring into new conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven in building pipeline and closing commercial opportunities, from first meeting through signed deal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English, with German, French or another EU language as a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage pipeline across the UK, Germany, France and other EU countries, growing existing engagements and opening new ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own client relationships with enterprise, government and system integrator accounts, coordinating several stakeholders per initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across borders with GTM, partner and technical teams so each opportunity has the right support to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on region pipeline and market trends so the team can focus on the deals most likely to land.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How Tenstorrent&#39;s open, scalable AI hardware fits enterprise, government and sovereign compute needs in Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ways to build a regional business at a fast-moving AI compute company, with room for the team to grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical depth on AI systems and software, with training from our GTM and field engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where AI infrastructure demand is heading across the European market, from data center to cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tenstorrent offers a highly competitive compensation package and benefits, and we are an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This offer of employment is contingent upon the applicant being eligible to access U.S. export-controlled technology. &amp;nbsp;Due to U.S. export laws, including those codified in the U.S. Export Administration Regulations (EAR), the Company is required to ensure compliance with these laws when transferring technology to nationals of certain countries (such as EAR Country Groups D:1, E1, and E2). &amp;nbsp; These requirements apply to persons located in the U.S. and all countries outside the U.S. &amp;nbsp;As the position offered will have direct and/or indirect access to information, systems, or technologies subject to these laws, the offer may be contingent upon your citizenship/permanent residency status or ability to obtain prior license approval from the U.S. Commerce Department or applicable federal agency. &amp;nbsp;If employment is not possible due to U.S. export laws, any offer of employment will be rescinded.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;The Autonomous Ops &amp;amp; Maintenance (ATOM)Team&amp;nbsp; is developing an innovative platform that leverages artificial intelligence and automated systems to empower engineering groups in safely executing complex operations and software maintenance. Their primary objective is to minimize repetitive toil while delivering the precise visibility, oversight, and trust necessary to run automated solutions in mission-critical environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consider it an intelligent virtual collaborator operating alongside development and infrastructure engineers, directly offloading routine operational overhead that currently requires manual intervention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Software Engineer to help us design and scale our foundational architecture. In this role, you will synthesize vast technical datasets into rich structured knowledge, engineer AI-driven components capable of analyzing intricate operational workflows, and construct highly reliable systems to execute automated modifications seamlessly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a greenfield initiative from inception to scale, shaping foundational product architecture, engaging directly with users to refine early concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build mission-critical solutions that customers depend on daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build fault-tolerant, horizontally scalable solutions running in multi-tenant environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 6+ years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a BS/MS/PhD in a scientific field or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable building and operating production services end to end: You will independently own features and components, work through ambiguous technical problems, and be responsible for the reliability, observability, and operational quality of what you ship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with large scale distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrated ability to use AI coding tools in day-to-day workflows and validate, critique, and refine AI-generated output&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus Point: You have experience with Kubernetes, workflow orchestration systems, or building AI agents&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth: &lt;/strong&gt;(Describe opportunities offered here)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intradepartmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, ability to join our Community Guilds (Datadog employee resource groups)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Inclusion Talks, our internal panel discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free, global mental health benefits for employees and dependents age 6+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive global benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Wheely&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is redefining premium transportation across major cities in Europe, the US, and the Middle East. We blend cutting-edge technology with the craft of five-star chauffeuring to deliver an experience trusted by more than 100,000 active riders and 1,200 corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a profitable, fast-growing scale-up with $43M raised and over $100M in annual revenue. Having recently launched in New York City, we’re expanding rapidly across the US and EMEA. If you take pride in your craft and want to help shape the next chapter of our growth, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&lt;strong&gt; (Senior) Operations Manager in Paris&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll be a senior member of the France Operations team, reporting to the General Manager, France. You&#39;ll own the day-to-day health of the market — acquiring, retaining, and driving quality among our best-in-class chauffeurs — and help evolve the local operating model as we scale beyond Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an entrepreneurial, high-ownership role in a fast-moving environment, not a caretaker seat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why This Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-growth business.&lt;/strong&gt; Paris is scaling and we&#39;re actively expanding into new markets — you&#39;ll help shape how we operate as we grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct impact.&lt;/strong&gt; Chauffeur acquisition, supply and retention — your calls move the metrics that define the market&#39;s health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll build and lead the local ops team, processes, and operating rhythms yourself, not inherit someone else&#39;s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day operational execution: chauffeur supply growth and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the local operating model, turning global strategy and standards into effective execution on the ground.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to spot operational risks and opportunities, and design initiatives with clear, measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow Wheely Paris&#39;s operations team, building a culture of high performance and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product teams to shape feature development and improve operational tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support readiness as the market expands into new areas, launching business from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior point of contact for chauffeurs and key external stakeholders, representing Wheely&#39;s standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with applicable French regulations and VTC licensing requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No single background defines success here — we want analytically strong, entrepreneurial operators motivated by ownership and comfortable being accountable for outcomes in open-ended environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2—4+ years building, growing, or scaling something meaningful with limited structure, with the ability to move fast from analysis to execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relevant backgrounds include:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;scaling operations in a fast-paced tech environment (VC-backed business, scale-up, startup);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;top-tier management consulting, investment banking, or VC/PE; early or founding-team experience at a consumer or marketplace startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;experience in a marketplace/platform business (on-demand, mobility, location-based);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;track record building teams or operating models from scratch or through rapid expansion;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA or advanced degree in business, operations, analytics, or strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Paris, ability to work in the office 4 days a week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office-based role in Paris (9th arrondissement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee stock options plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and critical illness cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best-in-class equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly credit towards Wheely journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily Lunch Allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigo and Veligo travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;All of your personal information will be collected stored and processed in accordance with&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wheely.com/en/legal/uk/for-candidates/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wheely’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Xometry (NASDAQ: XMTR) powers the industries of today and tomorrow by connecting the people with big ideas to the manufacturers who can bring them to life. Xometry’s digital marketplace gives manufacturers the critical resources they need to grow their business while also making it easy for buyers at Fortune 1000 companies to tap into global manufacturing capacity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To strengthen our Finance team in Europe, we are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;General Ledger Accountant&lt;/strong&gt; to support accounting operations for our France entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparation of monthly and annual financial statements and daily accounting activities under local standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordination of SOX work with the decentralized teams, HQ and audit companies, Further development of the internal control system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in the consolidation of the Europe subgroup according to US Gaap (Sage Intacct)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordination of stakeholders (audit firms, tax consultants, lawyers) on accounting and sales tax issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development of internal reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Account reconciliation and analysis of balance sheet/P&amp;amp;L accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in the optimization or (re)design of processes in the financial sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation and creation of process descriptions and work instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project work in the financial sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years accounting experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of French Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (PCG / French GAAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in &lt;strong&gt;French and English&lt;/strong&gt; (written and spoken)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have gained experience in Finance with Big 4, management consulting or a start-up and have a university degree in finance, economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound knowledge of accounting software Intacct or other similar programme, common MS Office programs, especially Excel, preferably additional ERP experience, AI usage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on mentality, with the willingness to take over operational activities in day-to-day business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication skills are just as much a part of your strengths as result-oriented way of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent position in a fast-growing international company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of responsibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flat hierarchies and fast decision-making processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International and supportive team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSUs package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standard working schedule: 40 hours per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;France, Remote&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;862&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1nl3ok6&quot; data-start=&quot;916&quot; data-end=&quot;931&quot;&gt;Holiday calendar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bavarian holidays&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Xometry is an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Xometry is an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran or disability status.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://xometry.eu/en/policy/&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Start: immediately | Level: Intermediate | Location: Switzerland, remote | Working hours: Full-time (40h/week)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More Nutrition already has a very large presence in Switzerland with an 8-digit revenue, double digit growth and significant investment. Our presence has been anchored into the German-speaking part of Switzerland; we’re set to expand while growing our presence in Romandy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Marketing Manager, you will report into the VP, International, and will be responsible for developing and executing our brand strategy for More Nutrition in Switzerland, with a particular focus on Romandy. You will also start seeding the French market. Speaking French is MANDATORY.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will create impactful campaigns, drive local marketing initiatives and ensure a consistent brand experience across all touchpoints. You will work closely with cross-functional teams, agencies and local stakeholders to significantly expand our presence in the Swiss market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ve got a good understanding of cultural nuances between German-speaking Swizterland, Romandy and France. You’ve worked in a fast-paced consumer goods or FMCG environment, operating both with big retailers and direct online sales platforms. You’re comfortable in newly created roles, working with multiple functional stakeholders, and can roll up your sleeves to execute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your mission&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· As brand guardian, you develop and implement the brand strategy for Switzerland, combining global guidelines with local consumer insights&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You define the marketing activation calendar and lead the planning and execution of omnichannel campaigns (incl. mass media, influencer marketing, TikTok and point of sale)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You brief and manage agencies to create on-brand, locally relevant assets (in German and French) and ensure timely campaign delivery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You track brand metrics (awareness, equity, engagement) and campaign KPIs and use this data for continuous optimisation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You work closely with cross-functional teams to guarantee a consistent brand experience across D2C, pure play and point of sale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You coordinate closely with the local commercial teams to align marketing activities with market and sales targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You help shape the local product portfolio based on the needs and potential of the Swiss market&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your experience &amp;amp; skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· French speaking is mandatory Ideally you have experience working both in French-speaking Swizterland and France. You have some level of understanding of how the shopper may differ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You have 4–6 years of solid professional experience as a brand or marketing manager in FMCG / consumer goods, ideally in food &amp;amp; beverage&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You have proven experience leading or managing one or more brands in Switzerland or France with revenues of at least CHF 30 million&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You have solid experience managing a D2C business and omnichannel campaigns (incl. mass media, influencer marketing, social media such as TikTok and Meta, as well as point of sale + pure play)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You stand out with a strong hands-on mentality, excellent project management skills and a genuine enthusiasm for cross-functional collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You have a data-driven mindset and are confident using digital marketing tools&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· You are fluent in French and are confident using English for our internal communication. Speaking German is of course a definite plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why us?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At The Quality Group, more than 1,200 people share a common mission: to rethink nutrition – healthier, smarter and with real added value for the community. We believe in team spirit, ownership and the courage to push boundaries. Every contribution counts, regardless of location or department. Depending on where you join us, you can look forward to various benefits, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Attractive employee discounts on ESN &amp;amp; More products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Flexible working hours &amp;amp; home office options&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Workation options and more&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During the application process, you&#39;ll find out which specific benefits await you at your location and what it means to be part of TQG: a company shaping the future of nutrition with passion, quality and courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Quality Group (TQG) is an innovative provider of sports nutrition products and has united the successful brands ESN and More Nutrition since 2021. ESN has been Germany&#39;s market leader in sports nutrition since 2004, offering products such as protein powders, bars and supplements designed for ambitious fitness goals. More Nutrition, founded in 2017, stands for healthy, sugar-reduced nutrition products and offers solutions for mindful eating and weight management – without sacrifice. TQG&#39;s vision is to help people become the best version of themselves. With passion and innovative strength, the company develops high-quality products that promote health, performance and joy of life. With an agile corporate culture and exciting career opportunities, TQG is a strong partner not only for customers but also for employees. That&#39;s us – The Quality Group – nice to meet you! Now it&#39;s your turn! We look forward to receiving your application! Regardless of gender, age, background or identity – what matters to us is who you are and what you bring. Join our team and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Suisse de préférence, France à discuter, télétravail&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Début : dès que possible | Niveau : Intermédiaire | Lieu : Suisse, télétravail | Temps de travail : temps plein (40 h/semaine)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More Nutrition bénéficie déjà d’une très forte présence en Suisse, avec un chiffre d’affaires à 8 chiffres, une croissance à deux chiffres et des investissements importants. Notre présence s’est jusqu’ici ancrée en Suisse alémanique ; nous souhaitons à présent poursuivre notre expansion en renforçant notre présence en Romandie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Marketing Manager, tu seras rattaché(e) au VP International et seras responsable du développement et de la mise en œuvre de notre stratégie de marque pour More Nutrition en Suisse, avec un focus particulier sur la Romandie. Tu commenceras également à nous positionner sur le marché français.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ce rôle, tu exécuteras nos campagnes de marque, piloteras les initiatives marketing locales et garantiras une expérience de marque cohérente. Tu travailleras en étroite collaboration avec les équipes commerciales, DTC, marketing, produits…, les agences et autres partenaires locaux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu as une bonne compréhension des nuances culturelles entre la Suisse alémanique, la Romandie et la France. Tu as de l’expérience en biens de consommation ou FMCG dans des environnements dynamiques et as travaillé à la fois avec de grandes enseignes et des plateformes D2C. Tu es à l’aise dans des postes nouvellement créés, tu sais collaborer avec différentes fonctions et tu es orienté(e) action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merci de nous envoyer ton dossier de candidature en anglais.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ta mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;· En tant que gardien(ne) de la marque, tu développes et mets en œuvre la stratégie de marque pour la Suisse, en associant guidelines globales et insights consommateurs locaux&lt;br&gt;· Tu définis le calendrier d’activation et pilotes la planification et l’exécution de campagnes omnicanales (médias de masse, marketing d’influence, TikTok et point de vente inclus)&lt;br&gt;· Tu briefes et pilotes les agences pour créer des contenus conformes à la marque et adaptés localement (en allemand et en français)&lt;br&gt;· Tu suis les indicateurs de marque (notoriété, capital de marque, engagement) ainsi que les KPI de campagne et tu les optimises continuellement&lt;br&gt;· Tu travailles en étroite collaboration avec des équipes transverses pour garantir une expérience de marque cohérente sur tous les canaux&lt;br&gt;· Tu adaptes l’assortiment local en fonction des besoins et du potentiel du marché suisse (et français)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton expérience &amp;amp; tes compétences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;La maîtrise du français est obligatoire. Idéalement, tu as de l’expérience à la fois en Suisse romande et en France. Tu comprends les différences de comportement entre consommateurs suisses et français.&lt;br&gt;· Tu as 4 à 6 ans d’expérience professionnelle en tant que Brand Manager ou Marketing Manager en FMCG / biens de consommation, idéalement en Food &amp;amp; Beverage.&lt;br&gt;· Tu as géré une ou plusieurs marques en Suisse ou en France générant un chiffre d’affaires d’au moins 30 millions CHF.&lt;br&gt;· Tu as une solide expérience dans la gestion d’un business D2C et de campagnes omnicanales (médias de masse, marketing d’influence, réseaux sociaux comme TikTok et Meta, ainsi que point de vente + pure players).&lt;br&gt;· Tu te distingues par un fort esprit opérationnel, d’excellentes compétences en gestion de projet et un fort esprit de collaboration.&lt;br&gt;· Tu es analytique et maîtrises les outils de marketing digital.&lt;br&gt;· Tu parles couramment français et utilises l’anglais avec aisance au quotidien dans un contexte professionnel. Parler allemand est un atout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Pourquoi nous ?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez The Quality Group, plus de 1 200 personnes partagent une mission commune : repenser la nutrition – plus saine, plus intelligente et avec une réelle valeur ajoutée pour la communauté. Nous croyons en l’esprit d’équipe, à la responsabilité individuelle et au courage de repousser les limites. Chaque contribution compte, quel que soit le site ou le service. Selon l’endroit où tu nous rejoins, différents avantages t’attendent, notamment :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Des réductions attractives pour les collaborateurs sur les produits ESN &amp;amp; More&lt;br&gt;· Des horaires flexibles &amp;amp; des possibilités de télétravail&lt;br&gt;· Des options de workation et plus encore&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au cours du processus de recrutement, tu découvriras les avantages concrets proposés sur ton site et ce que signifie faire partie de TQG : une entreprise qui façonne l’avenir de la nutrition avec passion, qualité et courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;À propos de nous&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Quality Group (TQG) est un fournisseur innovant de produits de nutrition sportive qui réunit depuis 2021 les marques à succès ESN et More Nutrition. ESN est depuis 2004 le leader du marché allemand de la nutrition sportive et propose des produits tels que des protéines en poudre, des barres et des compléments alimentaires adaptés aux objectifs de fitness ambitieux. More Nutrition, fondée en 2017, est synonyme de produits nutritionnels sains et à teneur réduite en sucre, et propose des solutions pour une alimentation consciente et la gestion du poids – sans privation. La vision de TQG est d’aider chacun à devenir la meilleure version de lui-même. Avec passion et esprit d’innovation, l’entreprise développe des produits de haute qualité qui favorisent la santé, la performance et la joie de vivre. Grâce à une culture d’entreprise agile et à des opportunités de carrière passionnantes, TQG est un partenaire solide non seulement pour ses clients, mais aussi pour ses collaborateurs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;C’est nous – The Quality Group – ravis de te rencontrer ! À toi de jouer ! Nous nous réjouissons de recevoir ta candidature ! Quel que soit ton genre, ton âge, ton origine ou ton identité – ce qui compte pour nous, c’est qui tu es et ce que tu apportes. Rejoins notre équipe et grandis avec nous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At IMC, technology is not a department; it’s at the heart of everything we do. Developed in-house, our innovative software makes millions of trading decisions daily, and we win by making better and faster decisions than our competition. Our on-site IT Support team helps us move at a higher pace and quality each day, from hands-on support for end users to configuring and automating our systems to scale our support capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this fully on-site position, you are the first person people come to with any IT issue, whether it’s a MacBook, a SaaS application, identity and access management, or hardware and AV. You support our growing Zug office and act as first- to third-line support. Our environment is predominantly macOS and cloud-based, with a small Windows footprint. You’ll work across a wide range of SaaS and custom systems. To succeed and grow, you take ownership, work autonomously, and keep improving an IT environment that runs smoothly and is ready to scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-to-third line support for our users, mainly on macOS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing and supporting our end-user platform, including Microsoft 365, Okta (SSO, MFA, lifecycle management), Slack and the Atlassian stack (Jira, Confluence, Jira Service Management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Device management and patching: Jamf for macOS and Intune for phones, including enrollment, configuration profiles, app deployment and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Onboarding and offboarding, including account provisioning, access management and device setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Installing, setting up and servicing hardware and peripherals, including laptops, monitors, printers, and audio and video conferencing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshooting, escalating and documenting network and connectivity issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automating repetitive tasks and keeping knowledge base articles and runbooks in Confluence up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organizing and performing desk moves, room setups and physical equipment moves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Everything else that keeps us moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in an ICT-related field (BSc level ideally), or an equivalent qualification such as Informatiker/in EFZ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one year of experience in a similar role in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong macOS knowledge and hands-on experience with JAMF (Pro).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft 365 administration and Intune; working knowledge of Windows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Okta or a similar identity provider (SSO, SCIM, MFA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience administering or supporting Slack and the Atlassian suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting experience (Bash, Zsh, Python or PowerShell) is a plus, and so is Linux experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent troubleshooting and diagnostic skills, with the ability to solve problems creatively and proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to take on physical tasks such as desk moves and room setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong drive to grow (at IMC we are committed to helping with that).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work autonomously, with a sense of urgency, and prioritize based on business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available and willing to work on-site full-time in Zug.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in written and spoken English; German is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMC is a research-driven trading firm where quantitative modeling, machine learning, and engineering shape how modern markets are traded. A stabilizing force in markets since 1989, we provide liquidity across trading venues, delivering the best outcome in value and risk management to investors. Using our own technology and capital, we build proprietary systems and algorithms that operate across global markets. Our researchers, traders, and engineers work as a collective, combining rapid experimentation, advanced infrastructure, and real-time feedback to turn insight into execution and execution into advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join our high-performing Swiss sales team. We help leading enterprise organizations in Switzerland optimize their end-to-end processes, increase operational efficiency through our Process Intelligence platform, and provide the contextual layer to industrialize Enterprise AI.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applying a value-driven consultative sales approach, you will build and grow relationships to drive sales cycles from discovery to value realization. You will be responsible for a portfolio of enterprise accounts headquartered in Switzerland, combining existing customers, where you will expand our footprint, with new / greenfield accounts, where you will win new logos for Celonis. Navigating complex organizations from operational leaders up to the C-suite, you will collaborate cross-functionally to understand your accounts&#39; needs and drive the end-to-end sales cycle to a successful close.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Manage a balanced portfolio of existing customers (land-and-expand) and new / greenfield accounts (new logo acquisition)&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Build pipeline in greenfield accounts through targeted prospecting and account planning&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Engage stakeholders across lines of business, from operational leaders up to C-level&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Drive Celonis Process Intelligence sales motions across the core enterprise value chain, translating business challenges into compelling, AI-enabled use cases that deliver measurable execution capacity&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Hold an individual revenue target for closing six-figure+ deals within your accounts&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Engage closely with partners e.g., consulting firms and SaaS vendors&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Drive sales cycles through orchestrating virtual teams including business development representatives, marketing managers, partner managers, sales engineers / pre-sales, customer success managers, professional services, implementation partners...&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Grow your skills through structured enablement, coaching and close collaboration with experienced Strategic Account Executives and your Sales Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;●&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 3+ years of relevant experience in either one - or ideally both - of the following domains:&lt;br&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;SaaS Sales: Track record of applying a consultative sales approach to sell complex B2B software solutions to enterprise accounts, ideally with experience in both expanding existing customers and winning new logos.&lt;br&gt;○ &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;AI / Management Consulting: Experience in a (boutique) consultancy, delivering AI or digital transformation projects with exposure to account management, client relationships, and business development.&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;A track record of meeting or exceeding targets, commitment, and successful career progression with your previous companies&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;A hunter mentality: proven ability to prospect, open doors and build pipeline in new accounts&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong business acumen and a solid understanding of core processes and KPIs across the enterprise value chain (e.g., Finance, Procurement, Supply Chain)&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Curiosity and the ability to quickly understand different industries and business models&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to build trusted relationships with Business and IT stakeholders and the confidence to engage up to the C-level&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Grit, a hands-on mindset, strong discovery skills and a structured approach to running sales processes&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Excellent communication and presentation skills in German (fluent) and English&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Eagerness to learn and develop, open to feedback and coaching&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to adapt to a fast moving, ever changing, high growth environment and approach challenges with positivity, creative thinking, and a growth mindset&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Willingness to be collaborative, inclusive, to embrace diversity and to have strong interpersonal skills #differentmakesusbetter&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to leverage internal resources and work as a team #bestteamwins&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich area location preferred&lt;/strong&gt;; candidates based elsewhere in Switzerland must be available for &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;97&quot;&gt;weekly in-person presence&lt;/strong&gt; and customer visits (primarily in &lt;strong&gt;German-speaking Switzerland&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-SS6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join our high-performing Swiss sales team. We help leading enterprise organizations in Switzerland optimize their end-to-end processes, increase operational efficiency through our Process Intelligence platform, and provide the contextual layer to industrialize Enterprise AI.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applying a value-driven consultative sales approach, you will build and grow relationships to drive sales cycles from discovery to value realization. You will be responsible for a portfolio of enterprise accounts headquartered in Switzerland, combining existing customers, where you will expand our footprint, with new / greenfield accounts, where you will win new logos for Celonis. Navigating complex organizations from operational leaders up to the C-suite, you will collaborate cross-functionally to understand your accounts&#39; needs and drive the end-to-end sales cycle to a successful close.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Manage a balanced portfolio of existing customers (land-and-expand) and new / greenfield accounts (new logo acquisition)&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Build pipeline in greenfield accounts through targeted prospecting and account planning&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Engage stakeholders across lines of business, from operational leaders up to C-level&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Drive Celonis Process Intelligence sales motions across the core enterprise value chain, translating business challenges into compelling, AI-enabled use cases that deliver measurable execution capacity&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Hold an individual revenue target for closing six-figure+ deals within your accounts&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Engage closely with partners e.g., consulting firms and SaaS vendors&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Drive sales cycles through orchestrating virtual teams including business development representatives, marketing managers, partner managers, sales engineers / pre-sales, customer success managers, professional services, implementation partners...&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Grow your skills through structured enablement, coaching and close collaboration with experienced Strategic Account Executives and your Sales Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;●&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 3+ years of relevant experience in either one - or ideally both - of the following domains:&lt;br&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;SaaS Sales: Track record of applying a consultative sales approach to sell complex B2B software solutions to enterprise accounts, ideally with experience in both expanding existing customers and winning new logos.&lt;br&gt;○ &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;AI / Management Consulting: Experience in a (boutique) consultancy, delivering AI or digital transformation projects with exposure to account management, client relationships, and business development.&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;A track record of meeting or exceeding targets, commitment, and successful career progression with your previous companies&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;A hunter mentality: proven ability to prospect, open doors and build pipeline in new accounts&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Strong business acumen and a solid understanding of core processes and KPIs across the enterprise value chain (e.g., Finance, Procurement, Supply Chain)&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Curiosity and the ability to quickly understand different industries and business models&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to build trusted relationships with Business and IT stakeholders and the confidence to engage up to the C-level&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Grit, a hands-on mindset, strong discovery skills and a structured approach to running sales processes&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Excellent communication and presentation skills in German (fluent) and English&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Eagerness to learn and develop, open to feedback and coaching&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to adapt to a fast moving, ever changing, high growth environment and approach challenges with positivity, creative thinking, and a growth mindset&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Willingness to be collaborative, inclusive, to embrace diversity and to have strong interpersonal skills #differentmakesusbetter&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Ability to leverage internal resources and work as a team #bestteamwins&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich area location preferred&lt;/strong&gt;; candidates based elsewhere in Switzerland must be available for &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;97&quot;&gt;weekly in-person presence&lt;/strong&gt; and customer visits (primarily in &lt;strong&gt;German-speaking Switzerland&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-SS6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NinjaOne unifies IT to simplify work for nearly 40,000 customers in 140+ countries&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The NinjaOne Unified IT Operations Platform delivers endpoint management, autonomous patching, backup, and remote access in a single console to improve efficiency, increase resilience, and reduce spend. By automating IT and managing all endpoints, organizations give employees a great technology experience at work.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;NinjaOne is obsessed with customer success and has retained a 98% customer satisfaction score for more than 5 years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Role Mandate&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A seasoned, hands-on administrator who understands the business problem, scopes and implements complex solutions across Salesforce and connected systems with minimal guidance, and stays accountable for technical quality through delivery and ongoing support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NinjaOne is looking for a Senior Salesforce Administrator to help shape the systems and capabilities that support our growing global revenue organization. As part of Sales Operations, you&#39;ll translate complex business needs into practical, scalable solutions across Salesforce and our connected sales technology ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role for someone who combines strong technical judgment with business curiosity and a builder&#39;s mindset. You&#39;ll look beyond the immediate request to understand the underlying problem, challenge unnecessary complexity, and design and build solutions that improve how our teams work. Partnering closely with Salesforce Architects, Admins, our broader Sales Operations teams, and Revenue Stakeholders you&#39;ll guide solutions from discovery and design through implementation and adoption. Your impact will extend beyond individual projects: you&#39;ll help strengthen the architecture, standards, and technical capabilities that allow NinjaOne to scale without continually adding manual work or one-off solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Location - Berlin, Germany&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate Business Needs into Scalable Solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business and Operations stakeholders to understand workflows, identify root causes, and translate priorities into clearly scoped solutions. Challenge assumptions and clarify requirements before moving into a build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop practical recommendations that account for user experience, business impact, dependencies, delivery effort, and long-term maintainability. Explain options and tradeoffs clearly to technical and nontechnical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to Salesforce Solution Architecture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help scope, design, and implement technical solutions for approved Salesforce initiatives, including data models, automation, access controls, integration requirements, and the impact on existing workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Favor straightforward, maintainable solutions, using native capabilities and low-code tools where appropriate and custom development where justified. Consider scale, performance, security, and support needs before implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Connect Processes, Data, and Systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design solutions around end-to-end workflows across Sales, Marketing, Customer Success, and other revenue functions—not isolated requests within a single tool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales Integrations, Data &amp;amp; AI, and other technical owners to define system responsibilities, data flows, dependencies, and exception handling. Ensure Salesforce changes work reliably within the broader technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead Technical Delivery and Raise Quality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain hands-on through prototyping, configuration, complex automation, and troubleshooting. Work alongside administrators and developers through implementation, peer reviews of technical work, and help resolve design challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Salesforce Platform Manager to strengthen testing, version control, deployment practices, and release readiness. Create clear design documentation and support handoffs so solutions can be understood, maintained, and improved by the broader team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build for the Next Stage of Growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify technical debt, fragmented workflows, and recurring issues. Recommend phased improvements that address root causes and support new business, customer, and regional requirements without unnecessary customization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Data &amp;amp; AI and Operations teams to evaluate practical automation and AI-enabled improvements. Help define the data, access, integration, testing, and human-review requirements needed to move useful ideas into dependable workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to the Team&#39;s Technical Capabilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical mentorship and constructive design feedback to administrators and developers. Build reusable patterns and shared knowledge that improve delivery quality and reduce reliance on individual experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate risks, dependencies, and recommendations early. Contribute architectural input to the platform roadmap and follow through on the technical outcomes of the initiatives you support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring meaningful Salesforce delivery experience. You have 5+ years of hands-on Salesforce experience, including ownership of solution design and implementation for complex, cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong platform fundamentals. You understand Salesforce data architecture, security and sharing, Flow, configuration, and platform constraints. You can assess how design decisions affect reliability, performance, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work across configuration and code. You have the technical depth to evaluate Apex and Lightning components, review implementation approaches, and troubleshoot solutions alongside administrators and developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think beyond Salesforce alone. You have experience designing solutions involving connected applications, APIs, and data flows, with a clear understanding of system ownership and downstream impacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how revenue teams work. You can connect technical decisions to business workflows, user needs, and operational outcomes. You are comfortable turning incomplete or ambiguous requirements into a clear recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take ownership beyond the design document. You bring disciplined testing, documentation, and delivery practices, communicate tradeoffs directly, and stay engaged until a solution works in practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Highly Preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting a high-growth B2B SaaS organization with multiple sales motions, international teams, or evolving customer and partner models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CPQ, routing, sales engagement, and integration platforms such as DealHub, LeanData, Salesloft, or Workato.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving an established Salesforce environment through architectural simplification, automation redesign, integrations, or data migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant Salesforce certifications, particularly architecture-focused credentials, and experience applying automation or AI to business workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Business priorities become well-defined solutions with clear design decisions and fewer surprises during implementation. Revenue teams experience simpler workflows and less manual work. Salesforce changes fit reliably into connected systems, and the technical team can maintain and extend what has been built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over time, your work should help the organization deliver more consistently, reduce recurring issues and avoidable rework, and support growth without increasing complexity at the same pace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Love &amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grow personally and professionally with one of the fastest growing companies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enjoy your lunch covered by NinjaOne 3 times/week at the office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access to our Corporate Benefits Platform (with discounts for brands such as Expedia, FitX, Zalando and many more)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop your skills through our renowned training platform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with a curious, kind, international and intercultural workforce  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enjoy your work environment with its location in the heart of Berlin, directly at the Alexanderplatz (close to all transit) &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Additional Information&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is NOT eligible for Visa sponsorship.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-MM2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. We are committed to providing an inclusive and diverse work environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;When you apply, NinjaOne collects and uses your personal information to review your application and manage the hiring process. To learn how we use, store, and protect your data, and what your rights are, please read our Candidate Privacy Policy at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ninjaone.com/candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;cpp&quot;&gt;https://www.ninjaone.com/candidate-privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Anaplan, we are a team of innovators focused on optimizing business decision-making through our leading AI-infused scenario planning and analysis platform so our customers can outpace their competition and the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What unites Anaplanners across teams and geographies is our collective commitment to our customers’ success and to our Winning Culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Our customers rank among the who’s who in the Fortune 50. Coca-Cola, LinkedIn, Adobe, LVMH and Bayer are just a few of the 2,400+ global companies who rely on our best-in-class platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt; Our Winning Culture is the engine that drives our teams of innovators. We champion diversity of thought and ideas, we behave like leaders regardless of title, we are committed to achieving ambitious goals, and we love celebrating&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;our wins – big and small.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supported by operating principles of being strategy-led, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anaplan.com/careers/&quot;&gt;values-&lt;/a&gt;based and disciplined in execution, you’ll be inspired, connected, developed and rewarded here. Everything that makes you unique is welcome; join us and let’s build what’s next - together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anaplan is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Solution Architect&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Services team in Germany&lt;/strong&gt;—a group of expert consultants who are passionate about delivering real, measurable value through Anaplan’s cutting-edge planning platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a key member of our Professional Services team, you won’t just be implementing solutions, you’ll shape the future of enterprise planning for our most strategic customers. This team partners closely with stakeholders across Finance, Supply Chain, and Sales Performance Management to solve complex business challenges with smart, scalable solutions. From the very first engagement, you’ll have the opportunity to lead design, delivery, and strategic advisory work that drives transformation at the enterprise level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we drive financial transformation, you will be a key player in architecting the future direction of decision excellence in enterprise grade companies across Germany. You will influence and drive a companies planning direction and play a pivotal role in delivering the outcomes the CFO, CIO and CEO need to take their business to the next level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re known for collaboration, deep expertise, and ability to unlock the full potential of Anaplan’s powerful connected planning platform. You’ll work with Anaplan’s industry-leading Hyperblock™ technology that delivers real-time data capabilities, and best in class planning and modelling capabilities. Grow your own skills while helping customers outpace disruption and outperform the competition—by planning smarter, faster, and more effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Architect, you are responsible for the successful delivery of Anaplan planning solutions in some of our most important strategic accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the Architectural SME for large-scale connected planning solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;design ownership across engagements, acting as design authority towards customers and partners, and solution review and quality assurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with customer teams to transform and optimise business process through the Anaplan Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate existing solutions, spreadsheets, and business problems into sophisticated Anaplan multi-dimensional models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support scoping, estimations and customer presentations as part of a solution sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with knowledge management, mentoring and enablement across the Professional Services Teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re looking for smart, consultative professionals who love solving problems, building relationships, and pushing boundaries.&amp;nbsp;We want you to bring your vision, experience, and passion to our team – helping our customers to&amp;nbsp;out-predict, out-plan and outperform their competitors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience implementing planning or EPM solutions in a customer-facing context (consulting, Professional Services or partner).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on modeling in a multidimensional planning tool. Anaplan is ideal, but experience with TM1, OneStream, Pigment, Board, Jedox or similar is a valid basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of planning processes in finance (FP&amp;amp;A), supply chain (e.g. S&amp;amp;OP, demand and supply planning), sales or workforce planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running workshops, gathering requirements, presenting solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German (C1 or higher) and fluent business English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel within DACH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work remote and independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging (DEIB) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe attracting and retaining the best talent and fostering an inclusive culture strengthens our business. DEIB improves our workforce, enhances trust with our partners and customers, and drives business success. Build your career in a place where diversity, equity, inclusion and belonging aren’t just words on paper – this is what drives our innovation, it’s how we connect, and it contributes to what makes us a market leader. We believe in a hiring and working environment where all people are respected and valued, regardless of gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, ethnicity, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, or any other aspect which makes people unique. We hire you for who you are, and we want you to bring your authentic self to work every day! &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive equitable benefits and all privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Recruitment Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It has come to our attention that fraudulent and fictitious job opportunities are being circulated on the Internet. Prospective candidates are being contacted by certain individuals, mainly through telephone calls, emails and correspondence, claiming they are representatives of Anaplan. The main purpose of these correspondences and announcements is to obtain privileged information from individuals.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anaplan does not: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend offers to candidates without an extensive interview process with a member of our recruitment team and a hiring manager via video or in person.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Send job offers via email. All offers are first extended verbally by a member of our internal recruitment team whenever possible and then followed up via written communication. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All emails from Anaplan would come from an ----- email address. Should you have any doubts about the authenticity of an email, letter or telephone communication purportedly from, for, or on behalf of Anaplan, please send an email to ----- before taking any further action in relation to the correspondence.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW36347262 BCX0&quot;&gt;Privacy &amp;amp; AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW36347262 BCX0&quot;&gt; Notice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;andidate data processed during our recruitment activities is handled &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;in accordance with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt; our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anaplan.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This may include the use of artificial intelligence or automated tools to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt;assist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW238761408 BCX0&quot;&gt; our team in evaluating qualifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Intrinsic is an AI robotics group at Google aiming to reimagine the potential of industrial robotics. Our team believes that advances in AI, perception and simulation will redefine what’s possible for industrial robotics in the near future – with software and data at the core.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make industrial robotics intelligent, accessible, and usable for millions more businesses, entrepreneurs, and developers. We are a dynamic team of engineers, roboticists, designers, and technologists who are passionate about unlocking the creative and economic potential of industrial robotics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;em&gt;Role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior 3D Reconstruction and Spatial AI Engineer, you will own the development of the geometric and semantic perception stacks that power our physical AI framework. You will design real-time systems that enable our robots to translate unstructured, dynamic 3D environments into structured, queryable world models - seamlessly linking high-level task planners (such as VLM/VLA models) directly to robust, low-level manipulation and grasp policies in Flowstate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;em&gt;How your work moves the mission forward&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deploy real-time spatial perception and state estimation pipelines using both in-house models like Gemini/Gemma and open source models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build multi-sensor fusion pipelines integrating RGB-D, stereo cameras, and IMU data into dense spatial representations (ex: point clouds, neural occupancy grids, or implicit signed distance function fields)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ground high-level semantic concepts into 3D geometric structures. This means building queryable, object-centric 3D scene graphs that map not just where an object is, but what it is, and its relationship to the other objects, and its functional properties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate open-vocabulary vision language models (ex: CLiP based visual descriptors, DINOv2) into 3D metric space to allow the robot to reason about natural language instructions (ex: ‘pick up the half-eaten apple and put it in the trash bin’)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop learning-based spatial models (such as 3D Diffusion Policies) that utilize 3D point clouds to predict continuous grasp poses and trajectories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate abstract semantic logic into functional affordances (ex: identifying the ‘graspable’ part of a mug versus the ‘containment’ part)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Engineering teams to ensure that stochastic, learned semantic models cleanly map to deterministic safe boundaries on physical hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data strategies for collecting, labeling, and generating 3D synthetic data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;em&gt;Skills you will need to be successful&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;: PhD (preferred) or Master’s in Robotics, Computer Vision, Machine Learning, or a related quantitative field—with a focus on Spatial AI, SLAM, or Embodied AI .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3D Vision&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep mathematical foundations in multi-view geometry, camera calibration, visual-inertial odometry (VIO), and probabilistic state estimation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Deep Learning&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven experience training and deploying multimodal architectures (VLMs/VLAs), contrastive learning frameworks, or 3D neural scene representations (NeRFs, Gaussian Splatting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming &amp;amp; Systems&lt;/strong&gt;: Expert level command of Python (PyTorch)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;em&gt;Skills that will differentiate your candidacy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with robotics middleware (ROS2) and real time execution constraints would be a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on &quot;battle scars&quot; from deploying onto physical robotic manipulators or mobile platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Intrinsic, we are proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. Employment at Intrinsic is based solely on a person&#39;s merit and qualifications directly related to professional competence. Intrinsic does not discriminate against any employee or applicant because of race, creed, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition (including breastfeeding), or any other basis protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. It is Intrinsic’s policy to comply with all applicable national, state and local laws pertaining to nondiscrimination and equal opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation, please contact us at: -----<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&quot;The-team-and-your-Role:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba1876c8-0e3e-48c2-adf7-f7866f5b80f5&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;917&quot;&gt;Your Role:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;944&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b78cb1ed-3088-4d3d-a1ea-5c144273a801&quot;&gt;As a part of the larger Engineering department, the Platform team plays a crucial role in enhancing &lt;mark id=&quot;a843d743-e995-4fde-8833-8956849563a2&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;a843d743-e995-4fde-8833-8956849563a2&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;emnify&lt;/mark&gt; competitive edge by improving developer experience to increase development efficiency and scale productivity.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1164&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d8b983b4-8e59-4c90-9b16-e993879da76a&quot;&gt;You will join a growing team, fostering empathy and a collaboration mindset to ensure continuous improvement of development experience at emnify. The Platform team provides, &lt;mark id=&quot;a2e30a38-7ad2-4ffa-8a9f-850c04b16764&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;a2e30a38-7ad2-4ffa-8a9f-850c04b16764&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;in addition &lt;/mark&gt;to the centrally managed infrastructure used by all the teams for observability and CI/CD, consultation, SME services, and hands-on support to the engineering teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1518&quot; data-local-id=&quot;42f1384d&quot;&gt;As the &lt;mark id=&quot;e7ac6177-c94f-45e6-a5c9-07f04601b5f3&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;e7ac6177-c94f-45e6-a5c9-07f04601b5f3&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;authority on K8s and CI/CD, you will guide infrastructure engineers in best practices&lt;/mark&gt; for K8s, Jenkins, and GitHub Actions, collaborate with the security team to enhance our cloud infrastructure security, and research and implement new features, tools, and services in the emnify infrastructure and tooling landscape. Your experience and advice will help teams deliver impactful projects successfully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1929&quot; data-local-id=&quot;def5dffc-aeca-4ee4-9551-a0b47b65179a&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu1v1w _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://emnify.github.io/tech-radar/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Emnify technology radar&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&quot;Your-Impact:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c3262c78-4888-44ff-b875-2dc06f53b22d&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1955&quot;&gt;&lt;mark id=&quot;30b5560c-9368-48e7-a065-8dff2ea838da&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;30b5560c-9368-48e7-a065-8dff2ea838da&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Your Impact: &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88db3405-f8ec-4c19-86a3-4b2ec897e7fc&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1974&quot; data-local-id=&quot;15729ee9&quot;&gt;You’ll design, implement, and maintain K8s-based solutions, clusters, and supporting AWS infrastructure that help other engineering teams run their applications reliably on Kubernetes. You’ll elevate how we deliver our business-critical applications on Kubernetes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2241&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f934b7d195ca&quot;&gt;You’ll work closely with the security team to maintain and increase emnify&#39;s security posture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2339&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4552cb08-46b6-49ff-8d3a-c1bccf75c828&quot;&gt;&lt;mark id=&quot;c0f5af5c-856c-488c-9a86-166ed47dccbf&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;c0f5af5c-856c-488c-9a86-166ed47dccbf&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;You’ll continuously improve our CI/CD systems and concepts&lt;/mark&gt;, enabling product teams to safely and efficiently deploy their applications on AWS-managed services and Kubernetes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2517&quot; data-local-id=&quot;983215ec-cf77-47b6-884f-914300bf78c9&quot;&gt;You’ll collaborate with the product teams and take an active part in implementing new infrastructure and services, providing valuable insights and implementation recommendations to ensure the successful and timely delivery of projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2756&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4c1d2618afd9&quot;&gt;As part of the internal team rotation, take part in supporting the teams in their day-to-day operations and challenges they are facing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&quot;Your-Skills:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ae1f5458-baf8-4666-9d42-2055e4190444&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2895&quot;&gt;&lt;mark id=&quot;d628dbd7-953b-4ce7-9a3f-786e45a529ff&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;d628dbd7-953b-4ce7-9a3f-786e45a529ff&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Your Skills: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c29f2407-8397-4fa0-9eea-5c611f74ca78&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2913&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e79a503d9038&quot;&gt;Extensive hands-on experience designing and managing Kubernetes solutions and supporting AWS infrastructure, balancing cost, performance, usability, and maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3086&quot; data-local-id=&quot;137a144d50fe&quot;&gt;Extraordinary K8s and infrastructure troubleshooting skills. You should be comfortable with digging into the &lt;mark id=&quot;ba09a1a4-2d7f-4fac-8eac-ce6c98eebf78&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;ba09a1a4-2d7f-4fac-8eac-ce6c98eebf78&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;K8s control plane&lt;/mark&gt;, drivers, and networking components to locate a bit out of place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3282&quot; data-local-id=&quot;91daf08b1ed0&quot;&gt;Solid experience with CI/CD tools and pipelines. Ideally with Jenkins, GitHub Actions, and the &lt;mark id=&quot;12e51016-c981-4854-a0ef-5d4e2f063d9e&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;12e51016-c981-4854-a0ef-5d4e2f063d9e&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Argo suite.&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3392&quot; data-local-id=&quot;330a86c0&quot;&gt;Solid knowledge of networking, security, monitoring, and Linux system administration. &lt;mark id=&quot;e393d363-61b3-411b-99ff-6d27ac74c962&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;e393d363-61b3-411b-99ff-6d27ac74c962&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Experience in telecom/connectivity domains&lt;/mark&gt; is a plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3534&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1f458e618712&quot;&gt;Valid &lt;mark id=&quot;b7ea9e97-3a54-4ef4-81b6-9dd4378d168b&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;b7ea9e97-3a54-4ef4-81b6-9dd4378d168b&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/mark&gt; &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;CKA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; certification is required, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;CKS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; certification is a big plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3618&quot; data-local-id=&quot;35504334764e&quot;&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills and the ability to convey a technical topic to non-technical personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
