&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;5. Languages&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;English: professional proficiency required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;French: professional proficiency is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
