&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mirakl:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2012, Mirakl has been at the forefront of marketplace innovation, empowering every business to compete in the platform economy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, Mirakl’s operating system combines an enterprise marketplace solution (Mirakl Platform) that enables retailers and B2B organizations to launch, scale, and operate marketplaces and dropship, AI-powered multichannel selling (Mirakl Connect), retail media (Mirakl Ads) and an agentic commerce infrastructure (Mirakl Nexus).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With dual headquarters in Boston and Paris, Mirakl helps a global ecosystem of 450+ marketplaces (B2C and B2B) and a network of over 100k third-party marketplace sellers. Brands like Macy’s, Decathlon, Carrefour, Asos, and Airbus Helicopters use Mirakl to grow their businesses in new and remarkable ways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mirakl.com&quot;&gt;www.mirakl.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mirakl in Numbers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗓️ Founded in 2012 | Member of French Tech Next40&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👥 750+ employees in 9 offices worldwide: Paris, Barcelona, Bordeaux, Boston, London, Munich, New York, Sydney, Tokyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🇫🇷 350+ Mirakl Tech teams members mainly based in France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⚙️ 5 Saas Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Mirakl means accelerating your career alongside ambitious, passionate, and supportive colleagues. We&#39;re proud of the diversity of backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences that make our teams unique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our 5 values guide how we collaborate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💡&lt;strong&gt; Work Hard Together:&lt;/strong&gt; Teamwork and collaboration are the foundation of our success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏆 &lt;strong&gt;Get Things Done: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We prioritize action and efficiency for impactful results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Go Above &amp;amp; Beyond:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; We tackle challenges proactively and always aim for excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 &lt;strong&gt;Succeed Through Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge sharing and continuous learning are core to our culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Satisfy &amp;amp; Empower Clients:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re committed to our clients&#39; success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our &lt;strong&gt;Mirakl Assistant&lt;/strong&gt; team, led by &lt;strong&gt;Remi Takase, Senior Data Science Manager&lt;/strong&gt;. The team is part of a passionate and skilled data organisation of Data Scientists, Research Scientists, Data Engineers and SREs, building on a state-of-the-art Machine Learning and Data platform. The Mirakl Assistant team is a new team that runs like a start-up inside a scale-up. Together, you&#39;ll be designing, building and scaling the conversational AI assistant that changes how our users work across Mirakl products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The assistant knows the platform and the users, and helps them get the most out of Mirakl, from finding their way around the product, to understanding their business and growing it. We&#39;re taking it from conversational to action-oriented: users ask, and the assistant gets it done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI agents are fundamentally reshaping commerce software: what customers expect from it, how they interact with it, and how they integrate it into their business. At Mirakl, AI is a core part of our product strategy - from Catalog Transformer and content generation to AI Agents and Agentic Commerce. This is where you come in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The position is a permanent contract, based in Paris or Bordeaux, with up to 1 day of remote work per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and scale the core capabilities of the Mirakl Assistant, including RAG, LLM orchestration, tool use, memory and context engineering, from rapid prototype to robust production feature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full production lifecycle of the assistant: automated data pipelines, CI/CD, deployment, load testing, latency and resilience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run technical discovery and feasibility studies for new capabilities and integrations across Mirakl products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive quality improvement through rigorous offline and online evaluation, data-driven experimentation and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with Software, Data Engineering, SRE and Product teams to evolve the agentic foundations and translate user needs into capabilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as a Machine Learning Engineer with strong software engineering skills, or as a Software/Data Engineer with hands-on AI and ML experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of deploying AI/ML systems in production products, with an automation-first approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building AI agents with LLMs, RAG, MCP and related technologies, including architectural design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in data-driven iteration, from experimentation to evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LLM orchestration and agentic systems design (RAG, MCP, LangChain, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software engineering proficiency in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid grounding in machine learning algorithms and fundamental&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorous metrics-driven evaluation and experimentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &quot;0 to 1&quot; mindset: able to thrive in ambiguity and take an idea from exploration to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product sense: understanding end users’ pain points and balancing technical excellence with customer impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and cross-functional collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend development (TypeScript, React) is a plus&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Python, SQL, TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Backend:&lt;/strong&gt; FastAPI, LangChain, OpenSearch, Kafka, PostgreSQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend:&lt;/strong&gt; React (micro-frontend architecture)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI:&lt;/strong&gt; LLMs (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Platform &amp;amp; Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Spark, Delta Lake, Databricks Workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Langfuse, MLflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Docker, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions, ArgoCD, AWS, GCP&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;English:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;French:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
