&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Commerce is the global leader in licensed sports merchandise, operating a vertically integrated platform that designs, manufactures, and delivers officially licensed apparel, jerseys, headwear, and collectibles for major leagues, teams, and events worldwide. With more than 900 e-commerce sites and a global omnichannel presence across digital, in-venue, and retail, Fanatics Commerce reaches fans in over 180 countries and powers official fan experiences for many of the world&#39;s most iconic sports properties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fanatics, we bring our BOLD Leadership Principles to life every day - building championship teams, obsessing over fans, acting with entrepreneurial speed, and delivering with a determined and relentless mindset.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As we continue to scale our global platform, the Senior Licensing Manager – UEFA will play a critical role in strategically growing and leading the UEFA Masterlicense business unit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ROLE OVERVIEW&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Licensing Manager – UEFA serves as the senior lead for the UEFA Masterlicense business, owning client and licensee relationships while ensuring operational and financial objectives are met with precision and efficiency. This role partners closely with senior leadership to develop and execute strategic licensing plans that maximize revenue, position client brands appropriately, and identify new business opportunities across the European licensing landscape. The Director, Licensing – UEFA delivers business and fan impact through BOLD leadership and execution excellence, leveraging data, automation, and AI-enabled insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW WILL YOU DRIVE IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Leadership Impact&lt;/strong&gt; (Build Championship Teams)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate division strategy clearly across licensing, legal, finance, and operations teams to ensure cohesive execution against the UEFA Masterlicense program&#39;s goals and objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior leadership to report key business results to corporate officers and align divisional priorities with enterprise-wide strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Finance on royalty reporting and royalty accounting, and with Legal on contract drafting and negotiation, ensuring seamless cross-functional delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and direct the UEFA licensing business unit, setting performance goals for direct reports and providing ongoing evaluation against the group&#39;s objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop team members through clear expectations, coaching, and alignment to BOLD leadership principles to build a high-performing licensing organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fan &amp;amp; Customer Impact&lt;/strong&gt; (Obsessed with Fans)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain meaningful, trust-based relationships with UEFA and all licensing clients, key stakeholders, business partners, and strategic alliances to advance each client&#39;s licensing program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an in-depth working knowledge of all Fanatics Licensing Management (FLM) clients to proactively anticipate needs and deliver consistently high levels of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee day-to-day management of client licensing programs — including contract negotiation and royalty reporting — ensuring clients receive accurate, timely, and strategic partnership support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent FLM at industry licensing trade shows and participate in business sessions with leading licensees to strengthen relationships and elevate the Fanatics brand in the European market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation &amp;amp; Problem Solving&lt;/strong&gt; (Limitless Entrepreneurial Spirit)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in identifying new business opportunities that align with high-quality business strategies and support both short-term and long-term objectives of the UEFA licensing program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the senior leadership team to develop and implement innovative strategic licensing plans that position client brands competitively and maximize licensing revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously evaluate operational and logistics processes within the licensing business unit, identifying improvements that drive greater efficiency and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay connected to industry trends and competitive dynamics in the European sports licensing landscape, bringing forward-thinking perspectives to client and business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt; (Determined &amp;amp; Relentless Mindset)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the day-to-day management of the P&amp;amp;L for the UEFA licensing business unit, ensuring the division achieves its strategic and financial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the development of annual reports for clients, delivering accurate and insightful performance summaries that inform future licensing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage competing priorities and complex stakeholder relationships simultaneously, operating with exceptional attention to detail and a self-starter mindset in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full accountability for divisional results, driving a culture of relentless execution and continuous improvement across all licensing operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; DIGITAL CAPABILITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building a future-ready organization. This role is expected to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI and technology to improve efficiency, quality, and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and digital tools to inform decisions and enhance performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate curiosity and adaptability in adopting new technologies and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of innovation and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CAPABILITIES &amp;amp; EXPERIENCE YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in the licensing industry, with demonstrated expertise in managing licensing programs, client relationships, and contractual obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in customer and client relations, with a proven ability to build and sustain strategic partnerships at a senior level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of management experience, including directing teams and evaluating performance against defined business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage a business unit P&amp;amp;L and deliver against financial and strategic targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in contract negotiation and working cross-functionally with Legal and Finance teams on licensing agreements and royalty processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated self-starter with the ability to excel at multi-tasking in a fast-paced, ever-changing environment, with exceptional attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Microsoft Office; strong written and verbal communication skills with the ability to present key results to senior and corporate leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WORK LOCATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On-site: Your work location will be onsite in Paris or Manchester.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Fanatics, we operate with a BOLD mindset—We Build Championship Teams, we&#39;re Obsessed with Fans, we embrace a Limitless Entrepreneurial Spirit, and we approach every challenge with a Determined &amp;amp; Relentless Mindset. If you&#39;re ready to contribute to a dynamic, fast-paced environment that thrives on collaboration and growth, we want you to be part of our team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Fanatics, we operate with a BOLD mindset - We Build Championship Teams, we’re Obsessed with Fans, we embrace a Limitless Entrepreneurial Spirit, and we approach every challenge with a Determined and Relentless Mindset. If you’re ready to contribute to a dynamic, fast-paced environment that thrives on collaboration and growth, we want you to be part of our team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;ABOUT US&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics is a leading global sports platform redefining how fans connect with the teams, players and moments they love. Our businesses — Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, Fanatics Events, Fanatics Advertising, Fanatics Markets and Fanatics Studios — maximize the presence and reach for hundreds of partners globally and create a one-stop experience that allows fans to buy, bet, collect, and earn, while engaging with sports in deeper, more immersive ways. This includes licensed fan gear and lifestyle products, sportsbook and iGaming, physical and digital trading cards, live events, premium sports entertainment content, credit card offerings and more. Together, they form a powerful, integrated ecosystem — connected by the Fanatics ONE loyalty program and FanCash, the currency of sport — delivering personalized experiences to over 100 million fans worldwide. Fanatics holds partnerships with over 900 sports properties, from professional leagues and players’ associations to teams, colleges and retail partners; over 7,000 athletes and celebrities; and over 2,000 retail locations, including all Lids stores. Backed by a team of more than 22,000 employees, Fanatics is committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics Commerce is a leading designer, manufacturer, and seller of licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods. It operates a vertically-integrated platform of digital and physical capabilities for leading sports leagues, teams, colleges, and associations globally – as well as its flagship site, &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanatics.com&quot;&gt;www.fanatics.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics Commerce has a broad range of online, sports venue, and vertical apparel partnerships worldwide, including comprehensive partnerships with leading leagues, teams, colleges, and sports organizations across the world—including the NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, MLS, Formula 1, and Australian Football League (AFL); the Dallas Cowboys, Golden State Warriors, Paris Saint-Germain, Chelsea FC, and Tokyo Giants; the University of Notre Dame, University of Alabama, and University of Texas; the International Olympic Committee (IOC), England Rugby, and the Union of European Football Associations (UEFA).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Fanatics Commerce, we infuse our BOLD Leadership Principles in everything we do:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Build Championship Teams&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Obsessed with Fans&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Limitless Entrepreneurial Spirit&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;· Determined and Relentless Mindset&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Notre solution logicielle est utilisée par des traders dans les banques et entreprises d’investissement, et traite &lt;strong&gt;un grand volume de données en temps réel&lt;/strong&gt;. Pour rendre ces informations compréhensibles et exploitables, une &lt;strong&gt;visualisation claire, interactive et ergonomique &lt;/strong&gt;est essentielle. L’objectif du stage est de concevoir une bibliothèque web réutilisable permettant d’afficher dynamiquement des données financières complexes (prix, volatilité, paramètres d’algorithmes) dans des graphes interactifs, en commençant par les graphiques boursiers linéaires et les graphiques à barre Open High Low Close (OHLC)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accompagné par un développeur expert sur ces technologies, tu développeras un &lt;strong&gt;prototype de bibliothèque en HTML5, JavaScript et &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ReactJS&lt;/strong&gt;, intégrable dans notre logiciel, avec des &lt;strong&gt;exemples d’utilisation concrets&lt;/strong&gt;. Tu mettras en œuvre des fonctionnalités avancées d’interaction (zoom, sélection, modification de valeurs) pour offrir une &lt;strong&gt;expérience utilisateur fluide et pertinente&lt;/strong&gt;. Tu rédigeras également la documentation technique de la bibliothèque.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi ce stage est pour toi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce stage est une opportunité unique &lt;strong&gt;d’approfondir tes compétences en développement web moderne&lt;/strong&gt; et en &lt;strong&gt;visualisation de données&lt;/strong&gt;. Tu découvriras comment transformer des données complexes en interfaces claires et interactives, tout en travaillant au sein d’une équipe expérimentée. Tu utiliseras des outils comme GitLab et Docker, et contribueras à un produit innovant avec un impact direct sur les utilisateurs finaux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROFIL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De formation &lt;strong&gt;BAC +5 &lt;/strong&gt;en informatique,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as de réelles compétences en &lt;strong&gt;Java, Javascript &amp;amp; HTML5&lt;/strong&gt; et une bonne connaissance de la programmation Java ainsi que des outils et frameworks couramment associés (Eclipse/IDEA IntelliJ, Mockito …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as un intérêt pour le développement d’interfaces utilisateur, &lt;strong&gt;UX/UI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es à l’aise pour collaborer et &lt;strong&gt;résoudre les problèmes &lt;/strong&gt;avec les différents membres de l’équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anglais&lt;/strong&gt; impératif&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Environnent de &lt;strong&gt;travail riche &lt;/strong&gt;autant &lt;strong&gt;techniquement&lt;/strong&gt; (temps réel, programmation fonctionnelle) que &lt;strong&gt;fonctionnellement&lt;/strong&gt; (finance de marché, front office)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Localisations Possibles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nantes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rennes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Durée de stage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 mois&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Horizon is an equal opportunity employer. We promote diversity, multiculturalism, and inclusion.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrez dans le monde de l&#39;innovation fintech et contribuez à l&#39;avenir du trading électronique&lt;/strong&gt;. Au sein de notre équipe d&#39;ingénieurs, vous contribuerez à façonner et à améliorer une &lt;strong&gt;plateforme de trading&lt;/strong&gt; utilisée par des professionnels du monde entier. Ce stage vous permettra d&#39;acquérir une expérience pratique des &lt;strong&gt;systèmes temps réel&lt;/strong&gt;, de collaborer à l&#39;élaboration de la &lt;strong&gt;roadmap produit &lt;/strong&gt;(métiers de courtage, trading algorithmique, market making) et de &lt;strong&gt;renforcer vos compétences Java&lt;/strong&gt; dans un environnement &lt;strong&gt;performant&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein d&#39;une équipe de développement, tu intégreras le processus Scrum et contribueras à la &lt;strong&gt;préparation, à l&#39;estimation, à la planification, au développement&lt;/strong&gt; et à la livraison du produit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Encadré par des développeurs expérimentés, tu seras notamment amené à&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer des compétences fonctionnelles et techniques,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concevoir et implémenter &lt;/strong&gt;de nouvelles fonctionnalités et des améliorations système,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribuer aux spécifications et à la conception de la solution&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la qualité grâce à des &lt;strong&gt;tests automatisés &lt;/strong&gt;(unités et intégration)&amp;nbsp;,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rédiger une documentation claire et utile,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec les équipes en France et à l&#39;international.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu coderas principalement en &lt;strong&gt;Java&lt;/strong&gt;, en utilisant des outils et des frameworks tels que IntelliJ IDEA, JUnit, Mockito, GitLab, Gradle, Docker et SQL.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROFIL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De formation &lt;strong&gt;BAC +5&lt;/strong&gt; en&lt;strong&gt; informatique&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as de réelles compétences en &lt;strong&gt;Java&lt;/strong&gt; et une bonne connaissance de la programmation Java (Java SE 8 à 23) ainsi que &lt;strong&gt;des outils et &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;couramment associés (Eclipse/IDEA IntelliJ, JUnit, log4j, Mockito …).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es à l’aise pour collaborer et &lt;strong&gt;résoudre les problèmes &lt;/strong&gt;avec les différents membres de l’équipe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anglais&lt;/strong&gt; impératif.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Environnent de &lt;strong&gt;travail riche &lt;/strong&gt;autant &lt;strong&gt;techniquement&lt;/strong&gt; (temps réel, programmation fonctionnelle) que &lt;strong&gt;fonctionnellement&lt;/strong&gt; (finance de marché, front office).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LOCALISATIONS POSSIBLES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nantes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rennes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Montréal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paris&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DUREE DU STAGE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 mois&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Horizon is an equal opportunity employer. We promote diversity, multiculturalism, and inclusion.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;H3 est un logiciel de calcul des prix en temps réel, qui contient de multiples méthodes de calcul selon les types de produits.&lt;br&gt;Certaines plateformes logicielles clients sont hébergées chez Horizon, ce qui facilite l’accès aux environnements de production pour l’équipe support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;À l’inverse, lorsque les clients hébergent eux-mêmes leurs plateformes, le support doit leur demander les éléments techniques nécessaires à l’analyse des éventuels défauts logiciels.&lt;br&gt;Ainsi, dès qu’un client signale un problème, le support doit réagir rapidement en sollicitant une liste d’informations clés : configuration des produits, paramètres de calcul, journaux applicatifs, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TES MISSIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sur le périmètre fonctionnel d&#39;un client majeur, ta mission sera d&#39;identifier et de décrire précisément les requis du support pour chaque type de produits et méthode de calcul de prix. Cela se traduira par les étapes suivantes :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Découvrir chaque fonctionnalité par type de produits et méthode de calcul de prix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reproduire chaque méthode de calcul sur une plateforme interne gérée par le support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier les éléments nécessaires à l&#39;analyse de défauts- documenter des guides d&#39;analyse:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;via la création de tickets, dans le but d&#39;améliorer la documentation client&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;via l&#39;enregistrement de démos sous forme de courtes vidéos tutorielles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi ce stage est fait pour toi ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce stage est idéal si tu es passionné(e) par l&#39;informatique et que tu souhaites acquérir une expérience pratique dans le domaine de la finance. Si tu es curieux(se), rigoureux(se) et que tu aimes relever des défis techniques et fonctionnels, ce stage est fait pour toi !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PROFIL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De formation &lt;strong&gt;BAC +4/5 en informatique&lt;/strong&gt;,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as de réelles compétences en &lt;strong&gt;gestion et déploiement de logiciel&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es à l’aise pour collaborer et &lt;strong&gt;résoudre les problèmes &lt;/strong&gt;avec les différents membres de l’équipe mais aussi avec le client,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anglais impératif,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Environnent de travail riche autant techniquement (temps réel, programmation fonctionnelle) que fonctionnellement (finance de marché, front office).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LOCALISATIONS POSSIBLES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nantes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DUREE DU STAGE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3 mois&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Horizon is an equal opportunity employer. We promote diversity, multiculturalism, and inclusion.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Event Streaming Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Engineering teams tackle complex technical challenges across a global, three-sided marketplace, building and scaling systems that serve millions of customers, riders and partners every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From real-time logistics to resilient infrastructure and marketplace optimisation, we design, build and operate technology that powers Deliveroo’s growth at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Software Engineer to join our team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us build and operate the event streaming infrastructure that powers business-critical workflows across Deliveroo, DoorDash and Wolt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get to know our Engineering team, what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Event Streaming Systems team within the broader Storage organisation. The team builds and operates highly reliable, scalable and efficient event streaming infrastructure, including Kafka, Event Streaming abstractions(internally called EventBus) and future streaming platform technologies. These systems support Tier-0 workflows and are foundational to how engineering teams build reliable, event-driven products at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design, build and operate large-scale event streaming infrastructure that supports critical production workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improve the reliability, scalability, observability and automation of Kafka, EventBus and related streaming platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Debug complex distributed systems issues, including performance bottlenecks, capacity constraints and production reliability challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build infrastructure automation and self-healing capabilities that reduce operational toil and improve platform resilience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to incident response, operational readiness and continuous improvement for Tier-0 infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with EventBus, Storage, SRE, Data Platform and Core Infrastructure teams across US and EU regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help shape the long-term architecture and evolution of Deliveroo’s event streaming platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong hands-on experience building or operating distributed systems in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Kafka or similar event streaming systems, either as a platform, infrastructure service or critical production dependency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong coding ability in Java, Go, Python or similar languages, with a focus on reliable, maintainable production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience operating scalable production infrastructure, including debugging, troubleshooting and improving reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of infrastructure automation, observability, capacity management and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Good fundamentals in Linux, networking and JVM-based systems, or curiosity to deepen expertise in these areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with the ability to work across platform, infrastructure and product engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience contributing to Kafka or related open source distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Redpanda, WarpStream, AutoMQ, Pulsar or similar streaming technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with JVM tuning, broker tuning, partition management or Cruise Control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with tiered storage, diskless streaming architectures or multi-region event streaming platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience operating Tier-0 infrastructure at large scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;br&gt;Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast&lt;br&gt;Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;br&gt;Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 A culture built for builders&lt;br&gt;High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create&lt;br&gt;Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://deliveroo.engineering/&quot;&gt;Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine, our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/interview-guide-for-engineers/&quot;&gt;Explore our Engineering Interview Guide&lt;/a&gt; to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo will process your personal information in accordance with our&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Commerce &amp;amp; Technology division helps leading global brands design, build and run the commerce platforms behind their growth. We are seeking a Principal Solutions Architect to lead solution in business pursuits and account growth, across enterprise commerce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be the person in the room who understands how the whole commerce estate fits together, from web storefront and mobile app through commerce platform, data and ERP.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; You will turn that understanding into a clear case for business value, win the trust of senior client stakeholders, and when it helps, build a working demonstration to show them what good looks like.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;37&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Architect Enterprise Commerce: Design end to end commerce solutions across Adobe Commerce, Salesforce Commerce Cloud, Shopify, HCL and composable (MACH) solutions, spanning web, mobile apps, data and back office systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;37&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead with value: Frame every solution around commercial outcomes, cost and return, so clients can see clear cases for change rather than a technology shopping list.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;37&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Serve as an outward-facing, energetic leader who runs workshops, participates in governance, and collaborates with commercial teams to identify and shape technical growth opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;38&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Client Engagement and Discovery: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior business and technology stakeholders. Run discovery workshops, ask the questions that uncover what really matters, and cut through complexity to the decisions that count.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
